eateShaderModule({ code: code }); pipe = dev.createComputePipeline({ layout: 'auto', compute: { module: module, entryPoint: 'main' } }); pc.set(code, pipe); }\n  const entries = objs.map((buf, i) => ({ binding: i, resource: { buffer: buf } }));\n  entries.push({ binding: bufs.length, resource: { buffer: ub } });\n  const bg = dev.createBindGroup({ layout: pipe.getBindGroupLayout(0), entries: entries });\n  const enc = dev.createCommandEncoder();\n  const pass = enc.beginComputePass();\n  pass.setPipeline(pipe); pass.setBindGroup(0, bg);\n  // 超過單維 65535 個工作群組時改二維派發；著色器以 gid.x + gid.y·4194240（=65535×64）還原扁平索引\n  // groups 給陣列 [x, y, z] 時照三維派發（平鋪矩陣乘用：x 是欄方向的平鋪、y 是列方向、z 是批次）\n  if (Array.isArray(groups)) pass.dispatchWorkgroups(groups[0], groups[1] || 1, groups[2] || 1);\n  else if (groups > 65535) pass.dispatchWorkgroups(65535, Math.ceil(groups / 65535)); else pass.dispatchWorkgroups(groups);\n  pass.end();\n  const rb = bufs.map((b) => (b.out ? dev.createBuffer({ size: b.data.byteLength, usage: USAGE.MAP_READ | USAGE.COPY_DST }) : null));\n  bufs.forEach((b, i) => { if (b.out) enc.copyBufferToBuffer(objs[i], 0, rb[i], 0, b.data.byteLength); });\n  dev.queue.submit([enc.finish()]);\n  const outs = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < bufs.length; i++) {\n    if (!bufs[i].out) continue;\n    await rb[i].mapAsync(1);\n    outs.push(new (bufs[i].data.constructor === Int32Array ? Int32Array : Float32Array)(rb[i].getMappedRange().slice(0)));\n    rb[i].unmap(); if (rb[i].destroy) rb[i].destroy();\n  }\n  objs.forEach((buf, i) => { if (!bufs[i].cache && buf.destroy) buf.destroy(); });\n  if (ub.destroy) ub.destroy();\n  return outs;\n}\n\n// 先試 T1；沒有 WebGPU、或執行失敗就退到 CPU 參考版，原因照實寫進 info\n// 三層：T1（WGSL）→ T3（WebGL2）→ cpu-js。每一層失敗都把原因接到 reason。\nasync function tryLayers(name, opts, gpuFn, glFn, refFn) {\n  const o = opts || {};\n  const nav = o.navigator !== undefined ? o.navigator : (typeof navigator !== 'undefined' ? navigator : undefined);\n  const notes = [];\n  const glAvail = glSupport(getGl(o)).ok && !!glFn ? 'native' : 'missing';  // webgl2 欄位回報「這個核心的 WebGL2 層是否可用」\n  const g = await getDevice(nav);\n  if (g.dev) {\n    try { return { result: await gpuFn(g.dev), info: layerInfo(name, 'T1', '', glAvail) }; }\n    catch (e) { notes.push('WGSL 執行失敗：' + String((e && e.message) || e)); }\n  } else notes.push(g.reason);\n  const gl = getGl(o);\n  const gs = glSupport(gl);\n  let glState = 'missing';\n  if (gs.ok && glFn) {\n    glState = 'native';\n    try { return { result: glFn(gl), info: layerInfo(name, 'T3', notes.join('；'), 'native') }; }\n    catch (e) { glState = 'failed'; notes.push('WebGL2 執行失敗：' + String((e && e.message) || e)); }\n  } else if (!gs.ok) notes.push(gs.reason);\n  else notes.push('WebGL2 版尚未實作（此核心）');\n  // refFn 可以是非同步的（例如純 CPU 池）：這裡一律 await，同步的參考實作照常\n  return { result: await refFn(), info: layerInfo(name, 'cpu-js', notes.join('；'), glState) };\n}\nfunction layerInfo(op, layer, reason, webgl2) {\n  return { lib: 'cudaweb-nn', op: op, layer: layer, reason: reason || '', webgl2: webgl2 };\n}\n\n// ---------- RMSNorm ----------\n// y[t,i] = x[t,i] · g[i] / sqrt(mean_i(x[t,·]²) + eps)；x 為 T×d 列主序\nfunction rmsnormRef(x, g, T, d, eps) {\n  if (x.length !== T * d) throw new Error('rmsnorm：x 的長度 ' + x.length + ' 與 T×d=' + (T * d) + ' 不符');\n  if (g.length !== d) throw new Error('rmsnorm：g 的長度 ' + g.length + ' 與 d=' + d + ' 不符');\n  const y = new Float64Array(T * d);\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) {\n    let s = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < d; i++) s += x[t * d + i] * x[t * d + i];\n    const inv = 1 / Math.sqrt(s / d + eps);\n    for (let i = 0; i < d; i++) y[t * d + i] = x[t * d + i] * inv * g[i];\n  }\n  return y;\n}\n\nconst WGSL_RMSNORM = `\nstruct P { rows: u32, d: u32, eps: f32, pad: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> g: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel rmsnorm\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let r = gid.x;\n  if (r >= p.rows) { return; }\n  var s: f32 = 0.0;\n  for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < p.d; i = i + 1u) { let v = x[r * p.d + i]; s = s + v * v; }\n  let inv = 1.0 / sqrt(s / f32(p.d) + p.eps);\n  for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < p.d; i = i + 1u) { y[r * p.d + i] = x[r * p.d + i] * inv * g[i]; }\n}\n`;\n\n// WebGL2 片段著色器：每個輸出像素算自己那一列的平方和（單趟、不用多趟縮減；列長度小時成本可接受，大列再改多趟）\nconst FS_RMSNORM = `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\n// @kernel rmsnorm\nuniform highp sampler2D uX;\nuniform highp sampler2D uG;\nuniform int uW;\nuniform int uRows;\nuniform int uD;\nuniform float uEps;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nfloat fetchX(int i) { return texelFetch(uX, ivec2(i % uW, i / uW), 0).r; }\nfloat fetchG(int i) { return texelFetch(uG, ivec2(i % uW, i / uW), 0).r; }\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  if (idx >= uRows * uD) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  int row = idx / uD;\n  int i = idx - row * uD;\n  float s = 0.0;\n  for (int j = 0; j < uD; j++) { float v = fetchX(row * uD + j); s += v * v; }\n  float inv = 1.0 / sqrt(s / float(uD) + uEps);\n  fragColor = vec4(fetchX(idx) * inv * fetchG(i), 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n`;\n\nasync function rmsnorm(x, g, T, d, eps, opts) {\n  const xf = Float32Array.from(x), gf = Float32Array.from(g);\n  return tryLayers('rmsnorm', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16);\n      new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([T, d]);\n      new Float32Array(uni, 8, 1)[0] = eps;\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_RMSNORM,\n        [{ data: xf, out: false }, { data: gf, out: false }, { data: new Float32Array(T * d), out: true }],\n        uni, Math.ceil(T / 64));\n      return outs[0];\n    },\n    (gl) => glRun(gl, FS_RMSNORM, [xf, gf], { i: { uRows: T, uD: d }, f: { uEps: eps } }, T * d, ['uX', 'uG']),\n    () => rmsnormRef(xf, gf, T, d, eps));\n}\n\n// ---------- softmax（沿最後一維，數值穩定：先減最大值）----------\n// x 為 rows×cols 列主序；每列獨立\nfunction softmaxRef(x, rows, cols) {\n  if (x.length !== rows * cols) throw new Error('softmax：x 的長度 ' + x.length + ' 與 rows×cols=' + (rows * cols) + ' 不符');\n  const y = new Float64Array(rows * cols);\n  for (let r = 0; r < rows; r++) {\n    let mx = -Infinity;\n    for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++) if (x[r * cols + c] > mx) mx = x[r * cols + c];\n    let s = 0;\n    for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++) { const e = Math.exp(x[r * cols + c] - mx); y[r * cols + c] = e; s += e; }\n    for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++) y[r * cols + c] /= s;\n  }\n  return y;\n}\n\nconst WGSL_SOFTMAX = `\nstruct P { rows: u32, cols: u32, pad0: u32, pad1: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel softmax\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let r = gid.x;\n  if (r >= p.rows) { return; }\n  var mx: f32 = x[r * p.cols];\n  for (var c: u32 = 1u; c < p.cols; c = c + 1u) { mx = max(mx, x[r * p.cols + c]); }\n  var s: f32 = 0.0;\n  for (var c: u32 = 0u; c < p.cols; c = c + 1u) { let e = exp(x[r * p.cols + c] - mx); y[r * p.cols + c] = e; s = s + e; }\n  for (var c: u32 = 0u; c < p.cols; c = c + 1u) { y[r * p.cols + c] = y[r * p.cols + c] / s; }\n}\n`;\n\n// WebGL2 片段著色器：每個輸出像素對自己那一列取最大值與指數和（單趟）\nconst FS_SOFTMAX = `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\n// @kernel softmax\nuniform highp sampler2D uX;\nuniform int uW;\nuniform int uRows;\nuniform int uCols;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nfloat fetchX(int i) { return texelFetch(uX, ivec2(i % uW, i / uW), 0).r; }\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  if (idx >= uRows * uCols) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  int row = idx / uCols;\n  float mx = fetchX(row * uCols);\n  for (int c = 1; c < uCols; c++) mx = max(mx, fetchX(row * uCols + c));\n  float s = 0.0;\n  for (int c = 0; c < uCols; c++) s += exp(fetchX(row * uCols + c) - mx);\n  fragColor = vec4(exp(fetchX(idx) - mx) / s, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n`;\n\nasync function softmax(x, rows, cols, opts) {\n  const xf = Float32Array.from(x);\n  return tryLayers('softmax', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16);\n      new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([rows, cols]);\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_SOFTMAX,\n        [{ data: xf, out: false }, { data: new Float32Array(rows * cols), out: true }],\n        uni, Math.ceil(rows / 64));\n      return outs[0];\n    },\n    (gl) => glRun(gl, FS_SOFTMAX, [xf], { i: { uRows: rows, uCols: cols } }, rows * cols, ['uX']),\n    () => softmaxRef(xf, rows, cols));\n}\n\n// ---------- SiLU（逐元素）：y = x · sigmoid(x) = x / (1 + e^(−x)) ----------\nfunction siluRef(x) {\n  const y = new Float64Array(x.length);\n  for (let i = 0; i < x.length; i++) y[i] = x[i] / (1 + Math.exp(-x[i]));\n  return y;\n}\n\nconst WGSL_SILU = `\nstruct P { n: u32, pad0: u32, pad1: u32, pad2: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel silu\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x;\n  if (i >= p.n) { return; }\n  let v = x[i];\n  y[i] = v / (1.0 + exp(-v));\n}\n`;\n\n// WebGL2 片段著色器：逐元素 x / (1 + e^(−x))\nconst FS_SILU = `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\n// @kernel silu\nuniform highp sampler2D uX;\nuniform int uW;\nuniform int uN;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  if (idx >= uN) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  float v = texelFetch(uX, ivec2(idx % uW, idx / uW), 0).r;\n  fragColor = vec4(v / (1.0 + exp(-v)), 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n`;\n\nasync function silu(x, opts) {\n  const xf = Float32Array.from(x);\n  return tryLayers('silu', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16);\n      new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1).set([xf.length]);\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_SILU,\n        [{ data: xf, out: false }, { data: new Float32Array(xf.length), out: true }],\n        uni, Math.ceil(xf.length / 64));\n      return outs[0];\n    },\n    (gl) => glRun(gl, FS_SILU, [xf], { i: { uN: xf.length } }, xf.length, ['uX']),\n    () => siluRef(xf));\n}\n\n// ---------- RoPE（旋轉位置編碼）----------\n// x 為 T×(H·hd) 列主序；每個 head 內相鄰兩維一組，角度 θ = t · 10000^(−2i/hd)；dir=−1 為反向（轉置旋轉）\nfunction ropeRef(x, T, H, hd, dir) {\n  if (x.length !== T * H * hd) throw new Error('rope：x 的長度 ' + x.length + ' 與 T×H×hd=' + (T * H * hd) + ' 不符');\n  if (hd % 2 !== 0) throw new Error('rope：hd 必須是偶數（收到 ' + hd + '）');\n  const y = new Float64Array(x.length), d = H * hd;\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) for (let h = 0; h < H; h++) for (let i = 0; i < hd / 2; i++) {\n    const th = t * Math.pow(10000, -2 * i / hd), c = Math.cos(th), s = dir * Math.sin(th);\n    const o = t * d + h * hd + 2 * i;\n    const a = x[o], b = x[o + 1];\n    y[o] = a * c - b * s;\n    y[o + 1] = a * s + b * c;\n  }\n  return y;\n}\n\nconst WGSL_ROPE = `\nstruct P { T: u32, H: u32, hd: u32, dir: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel rope\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let hp = p.hd / 2u;\n  let total = p.T * p.H * hp;\n  let k = gid.x;\n  if (k >= total) { return; }\n  let i = k % hp;\n  let h = (k / hp) % p.H;\n  let t = k / (hp * p.H);\n  let d = p.H * p.hd;\n  let th = f32(t) * pow(10000.0, -2.0 * f32(i) / f32(p.hd));\n  let c = cos(th);\n  let s = p.dir * sin(th);\n  let o = t * d + h * p.hd + 2u * i;\n  let a = x[o];\n  let b = x[o + 1u];\n  y[o] = a * c - b * s;\n  y[o + 1u] = a * s + b * c;\n}\n`;\n\n// WebGL2 片段著色器：每個輸出元素依自己在 (t, h, 對) 中的位置，取出同一對的兩個輸入做旋轉\nconst FS_ROPE = `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\n// @kernel rope\nuniform highp sampler2D uX;\nuniform int uW;\nuniform int uT;\nuniform int uH;\nuniform int uHd;\nuniform float uDir;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nfloat fetchX(int i) { return texelFetch(uX, ivec2(i % uW, i / uW), 0).r; }\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  int d = uH * uHd;\n  if (idx >= uT * d) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  int t = idx / d;\n  int rem = idx - t * d;\n  int r2 = rem % uHd;\n  int i = r2 / 2;\n  int o = idx - (r2 - 2 * i);\n  float th = float(t) * pow(10000.0, -2.0 * float(i) / float(uHd));\n  float c = cos(th);\n  float s = uDir * sin(th);\n  float a = fetchX(o);\n  float b = fetchX(o + 1);\n  float v = (r2 == 2 * i) ? (a * c - b * s) : (a * s + b * c);\n  fragColor = vec4(v, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n`;\n\nasync function rope(x, T, H, hd, dir, opts) {\n  const xf = Float32Array.from(x);\n  return tryLayers('rope', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16);\n      new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 3).set([T, H, hd]);\n      new Float32Array(uni, 12, 1)[0] = dir;\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_ROPE,\n        [{ data: xf, out: false }, { data: new Float32Array(xf.length), out: true }],\n        uni, Math.ceil(T * H * (hd / 2) / 64));\n      return outs[0];\n    },\n    (gl) => glRun(gl, FS_ROPE, [xf], { i: { uT: T, uH: H, uHd: hd }, f: { uDir: dir } }, xf.length, ['uX']),\n    () => ropeRef(xf, T, H, hd, dir));\n}\n\n// ---------- AdamW（逐元素，解耦權重衰減）----------\n// m ← b1·m + (1−b1)·g；v ← b2·v + (1−b2)·g²；p ← p − lr·wd·p − lr·(m/c1)/(sqrt(v/c2)+eps)\n// c1 = 1−b1^t、c2 = 1−b2^t 由主機算好傳入。wd=0 時與 lora_ref_train.js 的 adamStep 相同公式。\nfunction adamwCore(p, g, m, v, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd, c1, c2) {\n  const n = p.length, P2 = new Float64Array(n), M2 = new Float64Array(n), V2 = new Float64Array(n);\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n    M2[i] = b1 * m[i] + (1 - b1) * g[i];\n    V2[i] = b2 * v[i] + (1 - b2) * g[i] * g[i];\n    P2[i] = p[i] - lr * wd * p[i] - lr * (M2[i] / c1) / (Math.sqrt(V2[i] / c2) + eps);\n  }\n  return { p: P2, m: M2, v: V2 };\n}\nfunction adamwRef(p, g, m, v, t, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd) {\n  if (p.length !== g.length || p.length !== m.length || p.length !== v.length) throw new Error('adamw：p、g、m、v 長度不同');\n  return adamwCore(p, g, m, v, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd, 1 - Math.pow(b1, t), 1 - Math.pow(b2, t));\n}\n\nconst WGSL_ADAMW = `\nstruct P { n: u32, lr: f32, b1: f32, b2: f32, eps: f32, wd: f32, c1: f32, c2: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read_write> pp: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> gg: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> mm: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<storage, read_write> vv: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(4) var<uniform> u: P;\n// @kernel adamw\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x;\n  if (i >= u.n) { return; }\n  let g = gg[i];\n  let m2 = u.b1 * mm[i] + (1.0 - u.b1) * g;\n  let v2 = u.b2 * vv[i] + (1.0 - u.b2) * g * g;\n  let p0 = pp[i];\n  mm[i] = m2;\n  vv[i] = v2;\n  pp[i] = p0 - u.lr * u.wd * p0 - u.lr * (m2 / u.c1) / (sqrt(v2 / u.c2) + u.eps);\n}\n`;\n\n// WebGL2：AdamW 三個輸出各一趟（不用多個 draw buffer）。每趟都從四個輸入重算 m2、v2，所以三趟互不依賴。\nfunction fsAdamw(tag, outExpr) {\n  return `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\n// @kernel ${tag}\nuniform highp sampler2D uP;\nuniform highp sampler2D uG;\nuniform highp sampler2D uM;\nuniform highp sampler2D uV;\nuniform int uW;\nuniform int uN;\nuniform float uLr;\nuniform float uB1;\nuniform float uB2;\nuniform float uEps;\nuniform float uWd;\nuniform float uC1;\nuniform float uC2;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nfloat fetch(sampler2D t, int i) { return texelFetch(t, ivec2(i % uW, i / uW), 0).r; }\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  if (idx >= uN) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  float p = fetch(uP, idx);\n  float g = fetch(uG, idx);\n  float m = fetch(uM, idx);\n  float v = fetch(uV, idx);\n  float m2 = uB1 * m + (1.0 - uB1) * g;\n  float v2 = uB2 * v + (1.0 - uB2) * g * g;\n  fragColor = vec4(${outExpr}, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n`;\n}\nconst FS_ADAMW_P = fsAdamw('adamw_p', 'p - uLr * uWd * p - uLr * (m2 / uC1) / (sqrt(v2 / uC2) + uEps)');\nconst FS_ADAMW_M = fsAdamw('adamw_m', 'm2');\nconst FS_ADAMW_V = fsAdamw('adamw_v', 'v2');\n\nasync function adamw(p, g, m, v, t, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd, opts) {\n  const pf = Float32Array.from(p), gf = Float32Array.from(g), mf = Float32Array.from(m), vf = Float32Array.from(v);\n  const n = pf.length;\n  return tryLayers('adamw', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const c1 = 1 - Math.pow(b1, t), c2 = 1 - Math.pow(b2, t);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(32);\n      new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = n;\n      const fl = new Float32Array(uni, 4, 7);\n      fl.set([lr, b1, b2, eps, wd, c1, c2]);\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_ADAMW,\n        [{ data: pf, out: true }, { data: gf, out: false }, { data: mf, out: true }, { data: vf, out: true }],\n        uni, Math.ceil(n / 64));\n      return { p: outs[0], m: outs[1], v: outs[2] };\n    },\n    (gl) => {\n      const c1 = 1 - Math.pow(b1, t), c2 = 1 - Math.pow(b2, t);\n      const ins = [pf, gf, mf, vf], names = ['uP', 'uG', 'uM', 'uV'];\n      const uni = { i: { uN: n }, f: { uLr: lr, uB1: b1, uB2: b2, uEps: eps, uWd: wd, uC1: c1, uC2: c2 } };\n      return {\n        p: glRun(gl, FS_ADAMW_P, ins, uni, n, names),\n        m: glRun(gl, FS_ADAMW_M, ins, uni, n, names),\n        v: glRun(gl, FS_ADAMW_V, ins, uni, n, names),\n      };\n    },\n    () => adamwRef(pf, gf, mf, vf, t, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd));\n}\n\n// ---------- 交叉熵（O8）：前向 loss 與反向 dl 一次派發，一個工作群組算一列 ----------\n// 輸入 lg（T×V f32）、tg（T 個 u32 目標）、invT（=1/T）。輸出 dl（T×V）＝(softmax − onehot)·invT，rows（T）＝每列 −log p_t（未除 T）。\n// 主機把 rows 加總再除以 T 得到平均 loss。數值：列內先取最大值（數值穩定），再 exp 求和。\nconst WGSL_CE = `\nstruct P { T: u32, V: u32, invT: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> lg: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> tg: array<u32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> dl: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<storage, read_write> rows: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(4) var<uniform> u: P;\nvar<workgroup> red: array<f32, 64>;\n// @kernel cross_entropy\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(workgroup_id) wid: vec3<u32>, @builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let row = wid.x;\n  let t = lid.x;\n  let base = row * u.V;\n  var mx: f32 = -3.0e38;\n  for (var j: u32 = t; j < u.V; j = j + 64u) { mx = max(mx, lg[base + j]); }\n  red[t] = mx;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  for (var s: u32 = 32u; s > 0u; s = s >> 1u) { if (t < s) { red[t] = max(red[t], red[t + s]); } workgroupBarrier(); }\n  let rmax = red[0];\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  var sm: f32 = 0.0;\n  for (var j: u32 = t; j < u.V; j = j + 64u) { sm = sm + exp(lg[base + j] - rmax); }\n  red[t] = sm;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  for (var s: u32 = 32u; s > 0u; s = s >> 1u) { if (t < s) { red[t] = red[t] + red[t + s]; } workgroupBarrier(); }\n  let total = red[0];\n  let tgt = tg[row];\n  for (var j: u32 = t; j < u.V; j = j + 64u) {\n    let p = exp(lg[base + j] - rmax) / total;\n    var one: f32 = 0.0;\n    if (j == tgt) { one = 1.0; }\n    dl[base + j] = (p - one) * u.invT;\n  }\n  if (t == 0u) { rows[row] = log(total) - (lg[base + tgt] - rmax); }\n}\n`;\n// f64 參考：rows[t] = −log p_t；dl = (p − onehot)·invT。\nfunction crossEntropyRef(lg, tg, T, V, invT) {\n  const rows = new Float64Array(T), dl = new Float64Array(T * V);\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) {\n    let mx = -Infinity; for (let j = 0; j < V; j++) if (lg[t * V + j] > mx) mx = lg[t * V + j];\n    let s = 0; for (let j = 0; j < V; j++) s += Math.exp(lg[t * V + j] - mx);\n    rows[t] = Math.log(s) - (lg[t * V + tg[t]] - mx);\n    for (let j = 0; j < V; j++) dl[t * V + j] = (Math.exp(lg[t * V + j] - mx) / s - (j === tg[t] ? 1 : 0)) * invT;\n  }\n  return { rows, dl };\n}\n// 獨立呼叫（與其他運算一樣走三層降級）。回傳 { result: { loss（平均）, dl }, info }。\nasync function crossEntropy(lg, tg, T, V, opts) {\n  if (T > 65535) throw new Error('cross_entropy：T 超過 65535（一列一個工作群組，單維派發上限）');\n  const invT = 1 / T;\n  return tryLayers('cross_entropy', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([T, V]); new Float32Array(uni, 8, 1)[0] = invT;\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_CE,\n        [{ data: Float32Array.from(lg), out: false }, { data: Uint32Array.from(tg), out: false },\n          { data: new Float32Array(T * V), out: true }, { data: new Float32Array(T), out: true }],\n        uni, T);\n      const rows = outs[1]; let s = 0; for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) s += rows[t];\n      return { loss: s / T, dl: outs[0] };\n    },\n    null,\n    () => { const r = crossEntropyRef(lg, tg, T, V, invT); let s = 0; for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) s += r.rows[t]; return { loss: s / T, dl: r.dl }; });\n}\n\n// ---------- 逐元素批次運算（O8 每層一次提交用）：axpy、mul、scal ----------\nconst WGSL_AXPY_B = `\nstruct P { n: u32, s: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> xa: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> xb: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> yo: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> u: P;\n// @kernel axpy_batch\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x; if (i >= u.n) { return; }\n  yo[i] = xa[i] + u.s * xb[i];\n}\n`;\nconst WGSL_MUL_B = `\nstruct P { n: u32, s: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> xa: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> xb: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> yo: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> u: P;\n// @kernel mul_batch\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x; if (i >= u.n) { return; }\n  yo[i] = xa[i] * xb[i];\n}\n`;\nconst WGSL_SCAL_B = `\nstruct P { n: u32, s: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> xa: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> yo: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> u: P;\n// @kernel scal_batch\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x; if (i >= u.n) { return; }\n  yo[i] = u.s * xa[i];\n}\n`;\n// IEEE 半精度：f32 → f16 位元（就近偶數捨入；溢位成 ±Inf、極小值成次正規數或 0）與反向解碼。\nconst _f32buf = new Float32Array(1), _u32buf = new Uint32Array(_f32buf.buffer);\nfunction f32ToF16Bits(x) {\n  _f32buf[0] = x; const b = _u32buf[0];\n  const sign = (b >>> 16) & 0x8000, exp = (b >>> 23) & 0xff; let mant = b & 0x7fffff;\n  if (exp === 0xff) return sign | 0x7c00 | (mant ? 0x200 : 0);\n  const e = exp - 127 + 15;\n  if (e >= 31) return sign | 0x7c00;\n  if (e <= 0) {\n    if (e < -10) return sign;\n    mant |= 0x800000; const shift = 14 - e; let half = mant >>> shift;\n    const rem = mant & ((1 << shift) - 1), halfway = 1 << (shift - 1);\n    if (rem > halfway || (rem === halfway && (half & 1))) half++;\n    return sign | half;\n  }\n  let half = (e << 10) | (mant >>> 13); const rem = mant & 0x1fff;\n  if (rem > 0x1000 || (rem === 0x1000 && (half & 1))) half++;\n  return sign | half;\n}\nfunction f16ToF32(h) {\n  const s = (h & 0x8000) ? -1 : 1, e = (h >>> 10) & 0x1f, m = h & 0x3ff;\n  if (e === 0) return s * m * Math.pow(2, -24);\n  if (e === 0x1f) return m ? NaN : s * Infinity;\n  return s * (1024 + m) * Math.pow(2, e - 25);\n}\nconst MM_F16_CODE = core.mmTileWgsl({ marker: 'matmul_f16', dtype: 'f16' });\n\n// ---------- 批次提交：同一個 command encoder、中間結果留在 GPU 緩衝區，只在 read() 時回讀 ----------\n// 用法：const b = createBatch(dev); const x = b.upload(arr); const y = b.rmsnorm(x, g, T, d, eps); ...\n//       const [out] = await b.read([[y, n]]);   // 整批只 submit 一次、回讀只在最後\n// 目前涵蓋 RMSNorm、softmax、SiLU、RoPE（同一層內的逐元素與列運算）與 matmul（2026-11-18 加入，與 gpu_core 共用核心）。\n// 注意力、q8mm、MatMulNBits 還沒進批次（見 docs/CHECKLIST.cudaweb-optimize.md 的 O6）。\n// 動態量化（O6，與 infer_ops.quantizeDynamicRef 同一套規則）：兩段。\n// 第一段：單一工作群組求全域最小／最大（先含 0，與參考版一致），算出 scale、zp，寫進 st[0..3] = [mn, mx, scale, zp]。\n// 第二段：逐元素 q = clamp(round(x/scale)+zp, 0, 255) − zp（int32）。scale 為 0 時 scale 記 1、zp 記 0（與參考版一致）。\nconst WGSL_QDYN_STATS = `\n// @kernel qdyn_stats\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> st: array<f32>;\nstruct U { n: u32 };\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> u: U;\nvar<workgroup> smn: array<f32, 256>;\nvar<workgroup> smx: array<f32, 256>;\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  var mn: f32 = 0.0;\n  var mx: f32 = 0.0;\n  var i: u32 = t;\n  loop {\n    if (i >= u.n) { break; }\n    let v = x[i];\n    mn = min(mn, v);\n    mx = max(mx, v);\n    i = i + 256u;\n  }\n  smn[t] = mn;\n  smx[t] = mx;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  var s: u32 = 128u;\n  loop {\n    if (s == 0u) { break; }\n    if (t < s) {\n      smn[t] = min(smn[t], smn[t + s]);\n      smx[t] = max(smx[t], smx[t + s]);\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    s = s >> 1u;\n  }\n  if (t == 0u) {\n    let mnv = smn[0];\n    let mxv = smx[0];\n    let scale = (mxv - mnv) / 255.0;\n    var sc: f32 = scale;\n    var zp: f32 = 0.0;\n    if (scale == 0.0) { sc = 1.0; } else { zp = clamp(round(-mnv / scale), 0.0, 255.0); }\n    st[0] = mnv;\n    st[1] = mxv;\n    st[2] = sc;\n    st[3] = zp;\n  }\n}`;\nconst WGSL_QDYN = `\n// @kernel qdyn\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> st: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> q: array<i32>;\nstruct U { n: u32 };\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> u: U;\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x;\n  if (i >= u.n) { return; }\n  let sc = st[2];\n  let zp = st[3];\n  let qf = clamp(round(x[i] / sc) + zp, 0.0, 255.0);\n  q[i] = i32(qf) - i32(zp);\n}`;\n// O7 融合：單列（解碼 T=1）的 RMSNorm＋動態量化，一個工作群組（256 執行緒）一次派發完成。\n// 步驟：平方和（並行歸約）→ inv → 每個元素 v = x·inv·g（寫進 y，給殘差或需要時用）→ min／max 歸約 → scale、zp 寫進 st → 逐元素量化（重算 v，不讀 y，避免儲存緩衝的跨執行緒可見性問題）。\n// 與「rmsnorm（每列一個執行緒、逐元素串列）＋quantizeDyn（兩段）」比，派發數 1 對 3。\nconst WGSL_RMSQ_FUSED = `\n// @kernel rmsq_fused\nstruct P { d: u32, eps: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> g: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<storage, read_write> q: array<i32>;\n@group(0) @binding(4) var<storage, read_write> st: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(5) var<uniform> p: P;\nvar<workgroup> sh: array<f32, 256>;\nvar<workgroup> smn: array<f32, 256>;\nvar<workgroup> smx: array<f32, 256>;\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  var s: f32 = 0.0;\n  var i: u32 = t;\n  loop { if (i >= p.d) { break; } let v = x[i]; s = s + v * v; i = i + 256u; }\n  sh[t] = s;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  var r: u32 = 128u;\n  loop { if (r == 0u) { break; } if (t < r) { sh[t] = sh[t] + sh[t + r]; } workgroupBarrier(); r = r >> 1u; }\n  let inv = 1.0 / sqrt(sh[0] / f32(p.d) + p.eps);\n  var mn: f32 = 0.0;\n  var mx: f32 = 0.0;\n  i = t;\n  loop {\n    if (i >= p.d) { break; }\n    let v = x[i] * inv * g[i];\n    y[i] = v;\n    mn = min(mn, v);\n    mx = max(mx, v);\n    i = i + 256u;\n  }\n  smn[t] = mn;\n  smx[t] = mx;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  var c: u32 = 128u;\n  loop {\n    if (c == 0u) { break; }\n    if (t < c) { smn[t] = min(smn[t], smn[t + c]); smx[t] = max(smx[t], smx[t + c]); }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    c = c >> 1u;\n  }\n  let mnv = smn[0];\n  let mxv = smx[0];\n  let scale = (mxv - mnv) / 255.0;\n  var sc: f32 = scale;\n  var zp: f32 = 0.0;\n  if (scale == 0.0) { sc = 1.0; } else { zp = clamp(round(-mnv / scale), 0.0, 255.0); }\n  if (t == 0u) { st[0] = mnv; st[1] = mxv; st[2] = sc; st[3] = zp; }\n  i = t;\n  loop {\n    if (i >= p.d) { break; }\n    let v = x[i] * inv * g[i];\n    q[i] = i32(clamp(round(v / sc) + zp, 0.0, 255.0)) - i32(zp);\n    i = i + 256u;\n  }\n}`;\n// 對照用（O7 拆開量）：單列 RMSNorm，同樣的並行歸約，但只輸出 f32（不量化）。用來分開「rmsnorm 並行化」與「融合」的貢獻。\nconst WGSL_RMS_PAR = `\nstruct P { d: u32, eps: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> g: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\nvar<workgroup> sh: array<f32, 256>;\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  var s: f32 = 0.0;\n  var i: u32 = t;\n  loop { if (i >= p.d) { break; } let v = x[i]; s = s + v * v; i = i + 256u; }\n  sh[t] = s;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  var r: u32 = 128u;\n  loop { if (r == 0u) { break; } if (t < r) { sh[t] = sh[t] + sh[t + r]; } workgroupBarrier(); r = r >> 1u; }\n  let inv = 1.0 / sqrt(sh[0] / f32(p.d) + p.eps);\n  i = t;\n  loop { if (i >= p.d) { break; } y[i] = x[i] * inv * g[i]; i = i + 256u; }\n}`;\nconst MM_TILED_CODE = core.mmTileWgsl({ marker: 'matmul', dtype: 'f32' });\nconst MM_VEC4_CODE = core.mmTileWgslVec4({ marker: 'matmul_vec4' });\nfunction createBatch(dev) {\n  const enc = dev.createCommandEncoder();\n  let submitted = false;\n  const pool = GP.poolFor(dev);\n  // 這個批次借來的緩衝區；submit 之後整批歸還池（佇列依序執行，之後的寫入排在這次讀取之後，安全）\n  const temps = [];\n  const stats = { dispatches: 0, readbacks: 0, submits: 0, pipelineHits: 0, pipelineMisses: 0, pool: pool.stats };\n  function storage(n) {\n    const buf = pool.acquire(Math.max(4, n * 4), USAGE.STORAGE | USAGE.COPY_SRC | USAGE.COPY_DST);\n    temps.push(buf);\n    return buf;\n  }\n  function upload(arr) { const f = arr instanceof Float32Array ? arr : Float32Array.from(arr); const buf = storage(f.length); dev.queue.writeBuffer(buf, 0, f); return { buf: buf, n: f.length }; }\n  // f16 上傳：每個值存成半精度位元（2 位元組），長度為奇數時補一個 0 讓 writeBuffer 的長度是 4 的倍數\n  function uploadF16(arr) {\n    const n = arr.length, bits = new Uint16Array(n + (n & 1));\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) bits[i] = f32ToF16Bits(arr[i]);\n    const buf = storage(bits.length / 2); dev.queue.writeBuffer(buf, 0, bits);\n    return { buf: buf, n: n, f16: true };\n  }\n  function uploadU32(arr) { const u = arr instanceof Uint32Array ? arr : Uint32Array.from(arr); const buf = storage(u.length); dev.queue.writeBuffer(buf, 0, u); return { buf: buf, n: u.length }; }\n  function dispatch(code, bindBufs, uniform, groups) {\n    if (submitted) throw new Error('批次已經提交，不能再加入運算');\n    const ub = pool.acquire(Math.max(16, Math.ceil(uniform.byteLength / 16) * 16), USAGE.UNIFORM | USAGE.COPY_DST);\n    temps.push(ub);\n    dev.queue.writeBuffer(ub, 0, uniform);\n    const got = GP.pipelineFor(dev, code);\n    if (got.hit) stats.pipelineHits++; else stats.pipelineMisses++;\n    const pipe = got.pipe;\n    const entries = bindBufs.map((b, i) => ({ binding: i, resource: { buffer: b } }));\n    entries.push({ binding: bindBufs.length, resource: { buffer: ub } });\n    const bg = dev.createBindGroup({ layout: pipe.getBindGroupLayout(0), entries: entries });\n    const pass = enc.beginComputePass();\n    pass.setPipeline(pipe); pass.setBindGroup(0, bg);\n    if (Array.isArray(groups)) pass.dispatchWorkgroups(groups[0], groups[1], groups[2]); else pass.dispatchWorkgroups(groups);\n    pass.end();\n    stats.dispatches++;\n  }\n  const b = {\n    upload: upload,\n    uploadU32: uploadU32,\n    uploadF16: uploadF16,\n    rmsnorm(x, g, T, d, eps) {\n      const y = storage(T * d);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([T, d]); new Float32Array(uni, 8, 1)[0] = eps;\n      dispatch(WGSL_RMSNORM, [x.buf, g.buf, y], uni, Math.ceil(T / 64));\n      return { buf: y, n: T * d };\n    },\n    softmax(x, rows, cols) {\n      const y = storage(rows * cols);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([rows, cols]);\n      dispatch(WGSL_SOFTMAX, [x.buf, y], uni, Math.ceil(rows / 64));\n      return { buf: y, n: rows * cols };\n    },\n    // （批次內的 rmsnorm、softmax、silu、rope 都只走 T1；批次是 GPU 內連續運算，不經過 WebGL2）\n    silu(x) {\n      const y = storage(x.n);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = x.n;\n      dispatch(WGSL_SILU, [x.buf, y], uni, Math.ceil(x.n / 64));\n      return { buf: y, n: x.n };\n    },\n    rope(x, T, H, hd, dir) {\n      const y = storage(T * H * hd);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 3).set([T, H, hd]); new Float32Array(uni, 12, 1)[0] = dir;\n      dispatch(WGSL_ROPE, [x.buf, y], uni, Math.ceil(T * H * (hd / 2) / 64));\n      return { buf: y, n: T * H * hd };\n    },\n    // 矩陣乘（與 gpu_core 的 wgMatmul 同一組核心：K、N 為 4 的倍數時用 vec4 版）。A 是 M×K 的句柄，B 是 K×N 的句柄（常駐權重也可以）\n    // fl（選用）：{ transA, transB }（O5 的轉置版，走同一份平鋪核心的 p0 旗標；轉置時不用 vec4 版）\n    // fl.f16 = true：輸入必須是 uploadF16 的句柄（儲存 f16、累加 f32），走 f16 平鋪核心（需要 shader-f16）。\n    matmul(A, B, M, K, N, fl) {\n      const y = storage(M * N);\n      const flags = core.mmTileFlags(fl);\n      const f16 = !!(fl && fl.f16);\n      if (f16 && !(A.f16 && B.f16)) throw new Error('matmul f16：輸入必須用 uploadF16 上傳');\n      if (!f16 && (A.f16 || B.f16)) throw new Error('matmul：f16 句柄必須帶 fl.f16');\n      const v4 = !f16 && core.mmTileVec4Ok(M, K, N, flags);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(32); new Uint32Array(uni).set(core.mmTileWords(M, K, N, flags, 1));\n      dispatch(f16 ? MM_F16_CODE : (v4 ? MM_VEC4_CODE : MM_TILED_CODE), [A.buf, B.buf, y], uni, core.mmTileDispatch(M, N, 1));\n      return { buf: y, n: M * N };\n    },\n    // 逐元素（同一命令編碼器內，不回讀）：axpy＝x + s·y、mul＝x·y、scal＝s·x\n    axpy(x, y, s) { const o = storage(x.n); const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = x.n; new Float32Array(uni, 4, 1)[0] = s; dispatch(WGSL_AXPY_B, [x.buf, y.buf, o], uni, Math.ceil(x.n / 64)); return { buf: o, n: x.n }; },\n    mul(x, y) { const o = storage(x.n); const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = x.n; dispatch(WGSL_MUL_B, [x.buf, y.buf, o], uni, Math.ceil(x.n / 64)); return { buf: o, n: x.n }; },\n    scal(x, s) { const o = storage(x.n); const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = x.n; new Float32Array(uni, 4, 1)[0] = s; dispatch(WGSL_SCAL_B, [x.buf, o], uni, Math.ceil(x.n / 64)); return { buf: o, n: x.n }; },\n    // 交叉熵（O8）：logits 是 T×V 的句柄，tgt 是 uploadU32 的句柄；回傳 dl（T×V，已乘 invT）與 rows（T，未除 T）\n    crossEntropy(logits, tgt, T, V, invT) {\n      const dl = storage(T * V), rows = storage(T);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([T, V]); new Float32Array(uni, 8, 1)[0] = invT;\n      dispatch(WGSL_CE, [logits.buf, tgt.buf, dl, rows], uni, T);\n      return { dl: { buf: dl, n: T * V }, rows: { buf: rows, n: T } };\n    },\n    // O7 融合：單列 RMSNorm＋動態量化，一次派發。回傳 { y: {buf,n}（正規化後的 f32）, q: {buf,n,st}（i32 xq；st＝[mn,mx,scale,zp]） }\n    rmsQuantFused(x, g, d, eps) {\n      const y = storage(d), q = storage(d), st = storage(4);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = d; new Float32Array(uni, 4, 1)[0] = eps;\n      dispatch(WGSL_RMSQ_FUSED, [x.buf, g.buf, y, q, st], uni, 1);\n      return { y: { buf: y, n: d }, q: { buf: q, n: d, st: { buf: st, n: 4 } } };\n    },\n    // 對照用（O7）：單列 RMSNorm 並行版（一次派發，只輸出 f32）\n    rmsParallel(x, g, d, eps) {\n      const y = storage(d);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = d; new Float32Array(uni, 4, 1)[0] = eps;\n      dispatch(WGSL_RMS_PAR, [x.buf, g.buf, y], uni, 1);\n      return { buf: y, n: d };\n    },\n    // 動態量化：回傳 { buf, n }（i32 的 xq，已扣 zero point）與 st（[mn, mx, scale, zp] 的句柄，讀回用 read([[st, 4]])）\n    quantizeDyn(x) {\n      const n = x.n;\n      const st = storage(4), q = storage(n);\n      const u1 = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(u1, 0, 1)[0] = n;\n      dispatch(WGSL_QDYN_STATS, [x.buf, st], u1, 1);\n      dispatch(WGSL_QDYN, [x.buf, st, q], u1, Math.ceil(n / 64));\n      return { buf: q, n: n, st: { buf: st, n: 4 } };\n    },\n    // 一次 submit，整批的回讀都在這裡；specs = [[handle, n], ...]，回傳 Float32Array 陣列\n    async read(specs) {\n      if (submitted) throw new Error('批次已經提交過');\n      submitted = true;\n      const rbs = specs.map(([h, n]) => {\n        const rb = pool.acquire(Math.max(4, n * 4), USAGE.MAP_READ | USAGE.COPY_DST);\n        enc.copyBufferToBuffer(h.buf, 0, rb, 0, n * 4);\n        return rb;\n      });\n      dev.queue.submit([enc.finish()]);\n      stats.submits++;\n      // 命令已排進佇列，中間緩衝區可以歸還（之後的重用排在這次提交之後）\n      for (const t of temps) pool.release(t);\n      temps.length = 0;\n      const out = [];\n      for (let i = 0; i < rbs.length; i++) {\n        const rb = rbs[i], n = specs[i][1];\n        await rb.mapAsync(1);\n        // 池裡的緩衝區可能比要求的大（分桶），只取前 n 個值\n        out.push(new Float32Array(rb.getMappedRange().slice(0, n * 4)));\n        rb.unmap();\n        pool.release(rb);\n        stats.readbacks++;\n      }\n      return out;\n    },\n    // 給其他模組（infer_ops 的批次 q8mm）用的底層介面：配置輸出、以指定的儲存緩衝區與 uniform 派發一個核心\n    alloc(n) { return { buf: storage(n), n: n }; },\n    dispatchRaw(code, bindBufs, uniform, groups) { dispatch(code, bindBufs, uniform, groups); },\n    stats: stats,\n  };\n  return b;\n}\n\n// 訓練器用的運算介面（lora_ref_train.js 的 lossAndGradsAsync／adamStepAsync 接受的 ops）。\n// 每次呼叫都走三層降級（T1 → T3 → cpu-js），並把實際使用的層記在 stats 裡，給後端選單與測試用。\nfunction trainerOps(opts) {\n  const o = opts || {};\n  const stats = { calls: 0, layers: {}, last: null };\n  const rec = (op, info) => {\n    stats.calls++;\n    const key = op + ':' + info.layer;\n    stats.layers[key] = (stats.layers[key] || 0) + 1;\n    stats.last = info;\n  };\n  return {\n    stats: stats,\n    rmsnorm: async (x, g, T, d, eps) => { const r = await rmsnorm(x, g, T, d, eps, o); rec('rmsnorm', r.info); return r.result; },\n    softmax: async (x, rows, cols) => { const r = await softmax(x, rows, cols, o); rec('softmax', r.info); return r.result; },\n    silu: async (x) => { const r = await silu(x, o); rec('silu', r.info); return r.result; },\n    rope: async (x, T, H, hd, dir) => { const r = await rope(x, T, H, hd, dir, o); rec('rope', r.info); return r.result; },\n    adamw: async (p, g, m, v, t, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd) => { const r = await adamw(p, g, m, v, t, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd, o); rec('adamw', r.info); return r.result; },\n  };\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { trainerOps, crossEntropy, crossEntropyRef, WGSL_CE, f32ToF16Bits, f16ToF32, WGSL_AXPY_B, WGSL_MUL_B, WGSL_SCAL_B, MM_F16_CODE, rmsnormRef, rmsnorm, softmaxRef, softmax, siluRef, silu, ropeRef, rope, adamwCore, adamwRef, adamw, createBatch, runWgsl, getDevice, getGl, glSupport, glRun, tryLayers, nnBackendInfo, withMeasureLock, measureLockState, requestExclusiveGpu, registerIdleGpuHolder, NN_OPS, WGSL_RMSNORM, WGSL_SOFTMAX, WGSL_SILU, WGSL_ROPE, WGSL_ADAMW, WGSL_RMSQ_FUSED, NOTE_T3 };\n\n};\nMODS[\"infer_ops\"] = function (module, exports, require) {\n// infer_ops.js — 離線模型推論用的 cudaweb 核心（DESIGN.webgpu-cuda.md §7.3、§12）。\n// 目前內容：q8 反量化矩陣乘兩種（對應 Qwen3-0.6B 現有 onnx q8 權重格式）：\n//   q8mm  ：MatMulInteger 路徑。權重 K×N（uint8、單一 zero point），輸入先動態量化成 uint8（扣掉 zero point 後是 int32），\n//           累加用 int32（精確），最後乘上 輸入scale×權重scale，與 ORT 的 DynamicQuantizeLinear→MatMulInteger→Cast→Mul 一致。\n//   q8lm  ：lm_head 路徑。權重 V×K（詞表×隱藏，uint8、單一 zero point），輸入是 f32，logits[v] = scale · Σ x[k]·(w[v,k] − zp)。\n// 每個核心三層：T1 = WGSL、T3 = WebGL2（此檔尚未實作，會寫明）、cpu-js = 參考版。\n// 注意：node 內的測試用假裝置只驗證主機端流程；WGSL 的數值要在真 WebGPU（scripts/eval/cudaweb_infer_browser.js）驗證。\n'use strict';\nconst nn = require('./nn_ops.js');\n// R5：解碼 M=1 的 split-K（q8mm_splitk.js）；載入失敗（嵌入器沒有這個檔）就不提供，規則不會選到它\nlet SQ = null;\ntry { SQ = require('./q8mm_splitk.js'); } catch (_) { SQ = null; }\n\nconst USAGE = { MAP_READ: 0x0001, COPY_SRC: 0x0004, COPY_DST: 0x0008, UNIFORM: 0x0040, STORAGE: 0x0080 };\nconst MAX_GROUPS = 65535;\nconst MAX_CHUNK_BYTES = 64 * 1024 * 1024;  // 預設裝置的儲存緩衝上限 128 MiB；權重照列切成 ≤ 64 MiB 的塊\n\n// ---------- 參考版（CPU，純 JS） ----------\nfunction roundHalfEven(v) {\n  const r = Math.round(v);\n  return (Math.abs(v % 1) === 0.5 && r % 2 !== 0) ? r - 1 : r;\n}\n// ORT DynamicQuantizeLinear（uint8）：回傳 { q: Uint8Array, scale, zp }\nfunction quantizeDynamicRef(x) {\n  let mn = 0, mx = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < x.length; i++) { if (x[i] < mn) mn = x[i]; if (x[i] > mx) mx = x[i]; }\n  const scale = Math.fround((mx - mn) / 255);\n  if (scale === 0) return { q: new Uint8Array(x.length), scale: 1, zp: 0 };\n  const zp = Math.min(255, Math.max(0, roundHalfEven(Math.fround(-mn / scale))));\n  const q = new Uint8Array(x.length);\n  for (let i = 0; i < x.length; i++) q[i] = Math.min(255, Math.max(0, roundHalfEven(Math.fround(x[i] / scale)) + zp));\n  return { q: q, scale: scale, zp: zp };\n}\n// xq：M×K 的 int（已扣輸入 zero point），W：K×N uint8，回傳 Float32Array(M×N)\nfunction q8mmRef(xq, W, wzp, M, K, N, scale) {\n  const out = new Float32Array(M * N);\n  const acc = new Int32Array(N);\n  const sc = Math.fround(scale);\n  for (let m = 0; m < M; m++) {\n    acc.fill(0);\n    for (let k = 0; k < K; k++) {\n      const xv = xq[m * K + k];\n      if (xv === 0) continue;\n      const row = k * N;\n      for (let n = 0; n < N; n++) acc[n] += xv * (W[row + n] - wzp);\n    }\n    for (let n = 0; n < N; n++) out[m * N + n] = Math.fround(Math.fround(acc[n]) * sc);\n  }\n  return out;\n}\n// x：K 個 f32，W：V×K uint8 → Float64Array(V)（用雙精度累加，當作「真值」）\nfunction q8lmRef(x, W, wzp, V, K, scale) {\n  const out = new Float64Array(V);\n  for (let v = 0; v < V; v++) {\n    let s = 0; const row = v * K;\n    for (let k = 0; k < K; k++) s += x[k] * (W[row + k] - wzp);\n    out[v] = s * scale;\n  }\n  return out;\n}\n\n// ---------- WGSL ----------\nconst WGSL_Q8MM = `\nstruct P { M: u32, K: u32, N: u32, wzp: i32, scale: f32, p0: u32, p1: u32, p2: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<i32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> w: array<u32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel q8mm\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let n = gid.x;\n  let m = gid.y;\n  if (n >= p.N || m >= p.M) { return; }\n  var acc: i32 = 0;\n  for (var k: u32 = 0u; k < p.K; k = k + 1u) {\n    let idx = k * p.N + n;\n    let wv = i32((w[idx >> 2u] >> ((idx & 3u) * 8u)) & 255u) - p.wzp;\n    acc = acc + x[m * p.K + k] * wv;\n  }\n  y[m * p.N + n] = f32(acc) * p.scale;\n}\n`;\n// q8mm 解碼／通用變體（@kernel q8mm_dec）：一個工作群組（256 執行緒）負責「一列輸入 m」的「64 個輸出欄」。\n// 執行緒 t：cq = t&15 管 4 個相鄰欄（一個 u32 權重字＝同一列 k 的 4 個位元組），ks = t>>4 管 K 的第 ks 條切片（每 16 個 k 取一個）。\n// 輸入 x 的一段（256 個 k）先搬進共用記憶體 xs（所有執行緒重複讀，走共用記憶體），每個執行緒的 4 個整數累加器各自累加，\n// 最後 16 條切片的部分和經共用記憶體 red（16×64，4 KiB）樹外歸約（64 個執行緒各加 16 個值）。\n// 整數累加（i32）精確，所以與 q8mmRef 逐位相同。N 必須是 4 的倍數（由主機端檢查）。\n// 共用記憶體用量：xs 1 KiB + red 4 KiB＝5 KiB（低階卡的上限 16 KiB 內）。\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_DEC = `\nstruct P { M: u32, K: u32, N: u32, wzp: i32, scale: f32, nq: u32, p1: u32, p2: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<i32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> w: array<u32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\nvar<workgroup> xs: array<i32, 256>;\nvar<workgroup> red: array<i32, 1024>;\n// @kernel q8mm_dec\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>, @builtin(workgroup_id) wid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  let cq = t & 15u;\n  let ks = t >> 4u;\n  let m = wid.y;\n  let quad = wid.x * 16u + cq;\n  let qok = quad < p.nq;\n  var a0: i32 = 0;\n  var a1: i32 = 0;\n  var a2: i32 = 0;\n  var a3: i32 = 0;\n  for (var kt: u32 = 0u; kt < p.K; kt = kt + 256u) {\n    let kk = kt + t;\n    if (kk < p.K) { xs[t] = x[m * p.K + kk]; } else { xs[t] = 0; }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    for (var j: u32 = 0u; j < 16u; j = j + 1u) {\n      let tl = j * 16u + ks;\n      let k = kt + tl;\n      if (qok && k < p.K) {\n        let word = w[k * p.nq + quad];\n        let xv = xs[tl];\n        a0 = a0 + xv * (i32(word & 255u) - p.wzp);\n        a1 = a1 + xv * (i32((word >> 8u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n        a2 = a2 + xv * (i32((word >> 16u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n        a3 = a3 + xv * (i32((word >> 24u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n      }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n  }\n  let b = ks * 64u + cq * 4u;\n  red[b] = a0;\n  red[b + 1u] = a1;\n  red[b + 2u] = a2;\n  red[b + 3u] = a3;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  if (t < 64u) {\n    var s: i32 = 0;\n    for (var q: u32 = 0u; q < 16u; q = q + 1u) { s = s + red[q * 64u + t]; }\n    let n = wid.x * 64u + t;\n    if (n < p.N) { y[m * p.N + n] = f32(s) * p.scale; }\n  }\n}\n`;\n// q8mm 多列解碼（@kernel q8mm_decr）：一個工作群組負責 4 列輸入 × 64 個輸出欄。權重字每個只讀一次，同時乘 4 列\n// （WGSL_Q8MM_DEC 每列一個工作群組，M 列就把整個權重讀 M 次）。整數累加與 WGSL_Q8MM_DEC 相同，所以逐位相同。\n// 共用記憶體：xs 4 列×256 k 的 i32（4 KiB）＋ red 16×64 的 i32（4 KiB）＝8 KiB。4 列的結果依序經 red 歸約（每列一次屏障組）。\n// 工作群組數：ceil(N/64) × ceil(M/4)。\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_DECR = `\nstruct P { M: u32, K: u32, N: u32, wzp: i32, scale: f32, nq: u32, p1: u32, p2: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<i32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> w: array<u32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\nvar<workgroup> xs: array<i32, 1024>;\nvar<workgroup> red: array<i32, 1024>;\n// @kernel q8mm_decr\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>, @builtin(workgroup_id) wid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  let cq = t & 15u;\n  let ks = t >> 4u;\n  let m0 = wid.y * 4u;\n  let quad = wid.x * 16u + cq;\n  let qok = quad < p.nq;\n  var a: array<i32, 16>;\n  for (var kt: u32 = 0u; kt < p.K; kt = kt + 256u) {\n    let kk = kt + t;\n    for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 4u; r = r + 1u) {\n      let m = m0 + r;\n      if (m < p.M && kk < p.K) { xs[r * 256u + t] = x[m * p.K + kk]; } else { xs[r * 256u + t] = 0; }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    for (var j: u32 = 0u; j < 16u; j = j + 1u) {\n      let tl = j * 16u + ks;\n      let k = kt + tl;\n      if (qok && k < p.K) {\n        let word = w[k * p.nq + quad];\n        let b0 = i32(word & 255u) - p.wzp;\n        let b1 = i32((word >> 8u) & 255u) - p.wzp;\n        let b2 = i32((word >> 16u) & 255u) - p.wzp;\n        let b3 = i32((word >> 24u) & 255u) - p.wzp;\n        for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 4u; r = r + 1u) {\n          let xv = xs[r * 256u + tl];\n          a[r * 4u] = a[r * 4u] + xv * b0;\n          a[r * 4u + 1u] = a[r * 4u + 1u] + xv * b1;\n          a[r * 4u + 2u] = a[r * 4u + 2u] + xv * b2;\n          a[r * 4u + 3u] = a[r * 4u + 3u] + xv * b3;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n  }\n  for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 4u; r = r + 1u) {\n    let b = ks * 64u + cq * 4u;\n    red[b] = a[r * 4u];\n    red[b + 1u] = a[r * 4u + 1u];\n    red[b + 2u] = a[r * 4u + 2u];\n    red[b + 3u] = a[r * 4u + 3u];\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    if (t < 64u) {\n      var s: i32 = 0;\n      for (var q: u32 = 0u; q < 16u; q = q + 1u) { s = s + red[q * 64u + t]; }\n      let m = m0 + r;\n      let n = wid.x * 64u + t;\n      if (m < p.M && n < p.N) { y[m * p.N + n] = f32(s) * p.scale; }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n  }\n}\n`;\n// q8mm 多列解碼 8 列版（@kernel q8mm_decr8）：與 q8mm_decr 相同的整數累加，一個工作群組負責 8 列 × 64 欄，\n// 權重字的位元組拆解只做一次、供 8 列共用（decr 的拆解成本由 4 列分攤）。共用記憶體 8 KiB：歸約時 xs 同一段當 red。\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_DECR8 = `\nstruct P { M: u32, K: u32, N: u32, wzp: i32, scale: f32, nq: u32, p1: u32, p2: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<i32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> w: array<u32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\nvar<workgroup> xs: array<i32, 2048>;\n// @kernel q8mm_decr8\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>, @builtin(workgroup_id) wid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  let cq = t & 15u;\n  let ks = t >> 4u;\n  let m0 = wid.y * 8u;\n  let quad = wid.x * 16u + cq;\n  let qok = quad < p.nq;\n  var a: array<i32, 32>;\n  for (var kt: u32 = 0u; kt < p.K; kt = kt + 256u) {\n    let kk = kt + t;\n    for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 8u; r = r + 1u) {\n      let m = m0 + r;\n      if (m < p.M && kk < p.K) { xs[r * 256u + t] = x[m * p.K + kk]; } else { xs[r * 256u + t] = 0; }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    for (var j: u32 = 0u; j < 16u; j = j + 1u) {\n      let tl = j * 16u + ks;\n      let k = kt + tl;\n      if (qok && k < p.K) {\n        let word = w[k * p.nq + quad];\n        let b0 = i32(word & 255u) - p.wzp;\n        let b1 = i32((word >> 8u) & 255u) - p.wzp;\n        let b2 = i32((word >> 16u) & 255u) - p.wzp;\n        let b3 = i32((word >> 24u) & 255u) - p.wzp;\n        for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 8u; r = r + 1u) {\n          let xv = xs[r * 256u + tl];\n          a[r * 4u] = a[r * 4u] + xv * b0;\n          a[r * 4u + 1u] = a[r * 4u + 1u] + xv * b1;\n          a[r * 4u + 2u] = a[r * 4u + 2u] + xv * b2;\n          a[r * 4u + 3u] = a[r * 4u + 3u] + xv * b3;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n  }\n  for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 8u; r = r + 1u) {\n    let b = ks * 64u + cq * 4u;\n    xs[b] = a[r * 4u];\n    xs[b + 1u] = a[r * 4u + 1u];\n    xs[b + 2u] = a[r * 4u + 2u];\n    xs[b + 3u] = a[r * 4u + 3u];\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    if (t < 64u) {\n      var s: i32 = 0;\n      for (var q: u32 = 0u; q < 16u; q = q + 1u) { s = s + xs[q * 64u + t]; }\n      let m = m0 + r;\n      let n = wid.x * 64u + t;\n      if (m < p.M && n < p.N) { y[m * p.N + n] = f32(s) * p.scale; }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n  }\n}\n`;\n// q8mm 多列解碼 8 列 f32 版（@kernel q8mm_decr8f）：與 q8mm_decr8 逐位相同，但乘加在 f32 做（這台 f32 乘加屋頂約是 i32 的 2.5 倍）。\n// 精確條件：|輸入| ≤ 255、|權重−zp| ≤ 255；每個執行緒的部分和最多 K/16 個乘積，K ≤ 4096 時 ≤ 16.6M < 2^24，每一步都是精確整數。\n// 歸約前把部分和轉成 i32 再用 i32 加總。主機端只在 K ≤ 4096 時路由到這個核心。共用記憶體：xs f32 8 KiB ＋ red i32 4 KiB ＝ 12 KiB。\n// 實測（真 Chrome，K1024 N1024，交錯三輪）：M8 0.60→0.44 ms、M16 1.07→0.79 ms。\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_DECR8F = `\nstruct P { M: u32, K: u32, N: u32, wzp: i32, scale: f32, nq: u32, p1: u32, p2: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<i32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> w: array<u32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\nvar<workgroup> xs: array<f32, 2048>;\nvar<workgroup> red: array<i32, 1024>;\n// @kernel q8mm_decr8f\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>, @builtin(workgroup_id) wid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  let cq = t & 15u;\n  let ks = t >> 4u;\n  let m0 = wid.y * 8u;\n  let quad = wid.x * 16u + cq;\n  let qok = quad < p.nq;\n  var a: array<f32, 32>;\n  for (var kt: u32 = 0u; kt < p.K; kt = kt + 256u) {\n    let kk = kt + t;\n    for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 8u; r = r + 1u) {\n      let m = m0 + r;\n      if (m < p.M && kk < p.K) { xs[r * 256u + t] = f32(x[m * p.K + kk]); } else { xs[r * 256u + t] = 0.0; }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    for (var j: u32 = 0u; j < 16u; j = j + 1u) {\n      let tl = j * 16u + ks;\n      let k = kt + tl;\n      if (qok && k < p.K) {\n        let word = w[k * p.nq + quad];\n        let b0 = f32(i32(word & 255u) - p.wzp);\n        let b1 = f32(i32((word >> 8u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n        let b2 = f32(i32((word >> 16u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n        let b3 = f32(i32((word >> 24u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n        for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 8u; r = r + 1u) {\n          let xv = xs[r * 256u + tl];\n          a[r * 4u] = a[r * 4u] + xv * b0;\n          a[r * 4u + 1u] = a[r * 4u + 1u] + xv * b1;\n          a[r * 4u + 2u] = a[r * 4u + 2u] + xv * b2;\n          a[r * 4u + 3u] = a[r * 4u + 3u] + xv * b3;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n  }\n  for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 8u; r = r + 1u) {\n    let b = ks * 64u + cq * 4u;\n    red[b] = i32(a[r * 4u]);\n    red[b + 1u] = i32(a[r * 4u + 1u]);\n    red[b + 2u] = i32(a[r * 4u + 2u]);\n    red[b + 3u] = i32(a[r * 4u + 3u]);\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    if (t < 64u) {\n      var s: i32 = 0;\n      for (var q: u32 = 0u; q < 16u; q = q + 1u) { s = s + red[q * 64u + t]; }\n      let m = m0 + r;\n      let n = wid.x * 64u + t;\n      if (m < p.M && n < p.N) { y[m * p.N + n] = f32(s) * p.scale; }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n  }\n}\n`;\n// q8mm 多列解碼 4 列 f32 版（@kernel q8mm_decr4f）：與 q8mm_decr 逐位相同，乘加在 f32；精確條件與 q8mm_decr8f 相同（K ≤ 4096）。\n// 主機端只在 4 ≤ M < 8 且 K ≤ 4096 時路由到這裡。共用記憶體：xs f32 4 KiB ＋ red i32 4 KiB ＝ 8 KiB。\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_DECR4F = `\nstruct P { M: u32, K: u32, N: u32, wzp: i32, scale: f32, nq: u32, p1: u32, p2: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<i32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> w: array<u32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\nvar<workgroup> xs: array<f32, 1024>;\nvar<workgroup> red: array<i32, 1024>;\n// @kernel q8mm_decr4f\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>, @builtin(workgroup_id) wid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  let cq = t & 15u;\n  let ks = t >> 4u;\n  let m0 = wid.y * 4u;\n  let quad = wid.x * 16u + cq;\n  let qok = quad < p.nq;\n  var a: array<f32, 16>;\n  for (var kt: u32 = 0u; kt < p.K; kt = kt + 256u) {\n    let kk = kt + t;\n    for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 4u; r = r + 1u) {\n      let m = m0 + r;\n      if (m < p.M && kk < p.K) { xs[r * 256u + t] = f32(x[m * p.K + kk]); } else { xs[r * 256u + t] = 0.0; }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    for (var j: u32 = 0u; j < 16u; j = j + 1u) {\n      let tl = j * 16u + ks;\n      let k = kt + tl;\n      if (qok && k < p.K) {\n        let word = w[k * p.nq + quad];\n        let b0 = f32(i32(word & 255u) - p.wzp);\n        let b1 = f32(i32((word >> 8u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n        let b2 = f32(i32((word >> 16u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n        let b3 = f32(i32((word >> 24u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n        for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 4u; r = r + 1u) {\n          let xv = xs[r * 256u + tl];\n          a[r * 4u] = a[r * 4u] + xv * b0;\n          a[r * 4u + 1u] = a[r * 4u + 1u] + xv * b1;\n          a[r * 4u + 2u] = a[r * 4u + 2u] + xv * b2;\n          a[r * 4u + 3u] = a[r * 4u + 3u] + xv * b3;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n  }\n  for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 4u; r = r + 1u) {\n    let b = ks * 64u + cq * 4u;\n    red[b] = i32(a[r * 4u]);\n    red[b + 1u] = i32(a[r * 4u + 1u]);\n    red[b + 2u] = i32(a[r * 4u + 2u]);\n    red[b + 3u] = i32(a[r * 4u + 3u]);\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    if (t < 64u) {\n      var s: i32 = 0;\n      for (var q: u32 = 0u; q < 16u; q = q + 1u) { s = s + red[q * 64u + t]; }\n      let m = m0 + r;\n      let n = wid.x * 64u + t;\n      if (m < p.M && n < p.N) { y[m * p.N + n] = f32(s) * p.scale; }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n  }\n}\n`;\n// q8mm 2 列解碼 f32 版（@kernel q8mm_decr2f）：2 列 × 64 欄，權重只讀一次（WGSL_Q8MM_DEC 每列一個工作群組，M=2 時權重讀兩次）。\n// 精確條件同 decr4f（K ≤ 4096）。主機端只在 M=2 且 K ≤ 4096 時路由到這裡。共用記憶體：xs f32 2 KiB ＋ red i32 4 KiB。\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_DECR2F = `\nstruct P { M: u32, K: u32, N: u32, wzp: i32, scale: f32, nq: u32, p1: u32, p2: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<i32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> w: array<u32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\nvar<workgroup> xs: array<f32, 512>;\nvar<workgroup> red: array<i32, 1024>;\n// @kernel q8mm_decr2f\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>, @builtin(workgroup_id) wid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  let cq = t & 15u;\n  let ks = t >> 4u;\n  let m0 = wid.y * 2u;\n  let quad = wid.x * 16u + cq;\n  let qok = quad < p.nq;\n  var a: array<f32, 8>;\n  for (var kt: u32 = 0u; kt < p.K; kt = kt + 256u) {\n    let kk = kt + t;\n    for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 2u; r = r + 1u) {\n      let m = m0 + r;\n      if (m < p.M && kk < p.K) { xs[r * 256u + t] = f32(x[m * p.K + kk]); } else { xs[r * 256u + t] = 0.0; }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    for (var j: u32 = 0u; j < 16u; j = j + 1u) {\n      let tl = j * 16u + ks;\n      let k = kt + tl;\n      if (qok && k < p.K) {\n        let word = w[k * p.nq + quad];\n        let b0 = f32(i32(word & 255u) - p.wzp);\n        let b1 = f32(i32((word >> 8u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n        let b2 = f32(i32((word >> 16u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n        let b3 = f32(i32((word >> 24u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n        for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 2u; r = r + 1u) {\n          let xv = xs[r * 256u + tl];\n          a[r * 4u] = a[r * 4u] + xv * b0;\n          a[r * 4u + 1u] = a[r * 4u + 1u] + xv * b1;\n          a[r * 4u + 2u] = a[r * 4u + 2u] + xv * b2;\n          a[r * 4u + 3u] = a[r * 4u + 3u] + xv * b3;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n  }\n  for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 2u; r = r + 1u) {\n    let b = ks * 64u + cq * 4u;\n    red[b] = i32(a[r * 4u]);\n    red[b + 1u] = i32(a[r * 4u + 1u]);\n    red[b + 2u] = i32(a[r * 4u + 2u]);\n    red[b + 3u] = i32(a[r * 4u + 3u]);\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    if (t < 64u) {\n      var s: i32 = 0;\n      for (var q: u32 = 0u; q < 16u; q = q + 1u) { s = s + red[q * 64u + t]; }\n      let m = m0 + r;\n      let n = wid.x * 64u + t;\n      if (m < p.M && n < p.N) { y[m * p.N + n] = f32(s) * p.scale; }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n  }\n}\n`;\n// q8mm 預填 4×8 暫存器分塊（@kernel q8mm_pf8x4）：一個工作群組 64 列 × 128 欄（256 執行緒，每執行緒 4 列 × 8 欄 ＝ 32 個 f32 累加器）。\n// 每個權重字的位元組只拆一次，共用記憶體讀取由 4×4 版的每 16 次乘加 5 次降到 6 次／32 次乘加。\n// 精確條件：|輸入| ≤ 255、|權重−zp| ≤ 255；每個累加器跨整個 K 累加，K ≤ 4096 時 ≤ 16.6M < 2^24，每一步精確。主機端只在 K ≤ 4096 路由到這裡，其餘仍用 WGSL_Q8MM_PF。\n// 實測（真 Chrome，K1024 N1024，交錯）：M64 2.70→1.94 ms、M128 5.24→3.83、M256 10.41→7.12（約 −30%）；M70 N132 1.245→1.16；與 q8mmRef 逐位相同。\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_PF8X4 = `\nstruct P { M: u32, K: u32, N: u32, wzp: i32, scale: f32, nq: u32, p1: u32, p2: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<i32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> w: array<u32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\nvar<workgroup> xs: array<f32, 1024>;\nvar<workgroup> ws: array<u32, 512>;\n// @kernel q8mm_pf8x4\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>, @builtin(workgroup_id) wid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  let cq = t & 15u;\n  let rg = t >> 4u;\n  let m0 = wid.y * 64u;\n  let q0 = wid.x * 32u;\n  var acc: array<f32, 32>;\n  for (var kt: u32 = 0u; kt < p.K; kt = kt + 16u) {\n    for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < 4u; i = i + 1u) {\n      let idx = t + i * 256u;\n      let gm = m0 + (idx >> 4u);\n      let kk = idx & 15u;\n      if (gm < p.M && kt + kk < p.K) { xs[idx] = f32(x[gm * p.K + kt + kk]); } else { xs[idx] = 0.0; }\n    }\n    for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < 2u; i = i + 1u) {\n      let idx = t + i * 256u;\n      let wk = idx >> 5u;\n      let wq = q0 + (idx & 31u);\n      if (kt + wk < p.K && wq < p.nq) { ws[idx] = w[(kt + wk) * p.nq + wq]; } else { ws[idx] = 0u; }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    for (var kk: u32 = 0u; kk < 16u; kk = kk + 1u) {\n      let w0 = ws[kk * 32u + cq * 2u];\n      let w1 = ws[kk * 32u + cq * 2u + 1u];\n      let b0 = f32(i32(w0 & 255u) - p.wzp);\n      let b1 = f32(i32((w0 >> 8u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n      let b2 = f32(i32((w0 >> 16u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n      let b3 = f32(i32((w0 >> 24u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n      let b4 = f32(i32(w1 & 255u) - p.wzp);\n      let b5 = f32(i32((w1 >> 8u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n      let b6 = f32(i32((w1 >> 16u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n      let b7 = f32(i32((w1 >> 24u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n      for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 4u; r = r + 1u) {\n        let xv = xs[(rg * 4u + r) * 16u + kk];\n        acc[r * 8u] = acc[r * 8u] + xv * b0;\n        acc[r * 8u + 1u] = acc[r * 8u + 1u] + xv * b1;\n        acc[r * 8u + 2u] = acc[r * 8u + 2u] + xv * b2;\n        acc[r * 8u + 3u] = acc[r * 8u + 3u] + xv * b3;\n        acc[r * 8u + 4u] = acc[r * 8u + 4u] + xv * b4;\n        acc[r * 8u + 5u] = acc[r * 8u + 5u] + xv * b5;\n        acc[r * 8u + 6u] = acc[r * 8u + 6u] + xv * b6;\n        acc[r * 8u + 7u] = acc[r * 8u + 7u] + xv * b7;\n      }\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n  }\n  for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 4u; r = r + 1u) {\n    let gm = m0 + rg * 4u + r;\n    for (var c: u32 = 0u; c < 8u; c = c + 1u) {\n      let gn = q0 * 4u + cq * 8u + c;\n      if (gm < p.M && gn < p.N) { y[gm * p.N + gn] = acc[r * 8u + c] * p.scale; }\n    }\n  }\n}\n`;\n// q8mm 預填／大 M 變體（@kernel q8mm_pf）：一個工作群組（16×16＝256 執行緒）負責 64 列輸入 × 64 個輸出欄的一塊。\n// 執行緒 (rg, cq)：cq = t&15 管 4 欄（一個權重字），rg = t>>4 管 4 列（暫存器分塊 4×4＝16 個整數累加器）。\n// 每次沿 K 取 16 個 k：輸入塊 64×16 i32（4 KiB）與權重塊 16×16 個 u32（1 KiB）先搬進共用記憶體，再由 16 個 k 做累加。\n// 共用記憶體用量 5 KiB。整數累加精確，與 q8mmRef 逐位相同。N 必須是 4 的倍數（主機端檢查）。\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_PF = `\nstruct P { M: u32, K: u32, N: u32, wzp: i32, scale: f32, nq: u32, p1: u32, p2: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<i32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> w: array<u32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\nvar<workgroup> xs: array<f32, 1024>;\nvar<workgroup> ws: array<u32, 256>;\n// @kernel q8mm_pf\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>, @builtin(workgroup_id) wid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  let cq = t & 15u;\n  let rg = t >> 4u;\n  let m0 = wid.y * 64u;\n  let q0 = wid.x * 16u;\n  var acc: array<i32, 16>;\n  for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < 16u; i = i + 1u) { acc[i] = 0; }\n  // 每個 K 區塊（16 個 k）的部分和用 f32 乘加：|x|,|b| ≤ 255，一個區塊的和 ≤ 16·255·255 ≈ 1.04e6 < 2^24，每一步都是精確整數，\n  // 所以與 i32 累加逐位相同；區塊結束再轉成 i32 加到 acc。Kepler 上 f32 乘加比 i32 乘法快得多。\n  for (var kt: u32 = 0u; kt < p.K; kt = kt + 16u) {\n    var pa: array<f32, 16>;\n    for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < 4u; i = i + 1u) {\n      let idx = t + i * 256u;\n      let gm = m0 + (idx >> 4u);\n      let kk = idx & 15u;\n      if (gm < p.M && kt + kk < p.K) { xs[idx] = f32(x[gm * p.K + kt + kk]); } else { xs[idx] = 0.0; }\n    }\n    let wk = t >> 4u;\n    let wq = q0 + (t & 15u);\n    if (kt + wk < p.K && wq < p.nq) { ws[t] = w[(kt + wk) * p.nq + wq]; } else { ws[t] = 0u; }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    for (var kk: u32 = 0u; kk < 16u; kk = kk + 1u) {\n      let word = ws[kk * 16u + cq];\n      let b0 = f32(i32(word & 255u) - p.wzp);\n      let b1 = f32(i32((word >> 8u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n      let b2 = f32(i32((word >> 16u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n      let b3 = f32(i32((word >> 24u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n      for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 4u; r = r + 1u) {\n        let xv = xs[(rg * 4u + r) * 16u + kk];\n        pa[r * 4u] = pa[r * 4u] + xv * b0;\n        pa[r * 4u + 1u] = pa[r * 4u + 1u] + xv * b1;\n        pa[r * 4u + 2u] = pa[r * 4u + 2u] + xv * b2;\n        pa[r * 4u + 3u] = pa[r * 4u + 3u] + xv * b3;\n      }\n    }\n    for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < 16u; i = i + 1u) { acc[i] = acc[i] + i32(pa[i]); }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n  }\n  for (var r: u32 = 0u; r < 4u; r = r + 1u) {\n    let gm = m0 + rg * 4u + r;\n    for (var c: u32 = 0u; c < 4u; c = c + 1u) {\n      let gn = q0 * 4u + cq * 4u + c;\n      if (gm < p.M && gn < p.N) { y[gm * p.N + gn] = f32(acc[r * 4u + c]) * p.scale; }\n    }\n  }\n}\n`;\n// 一個工作群組（64 執行緒）算一個詞表列；每個執行緒讀整個 u32（4 個位元組）。K 必須是 4 的倍數。\nconst WGSL_Q8LM = `\nstruct P { rows: u32, K: u32, wzp: i32, scale: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> w: array<u32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\nvar<workgroup> sh: array<f32, 64>;\n// @kernel q8lm\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>, @builtin(workgroup_id) wid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let row = wid.y * 65535u + wid.x;\n  let kw = p.K >> 2u;\n  var acc: f32 = 0.0;\n  if (row < p.rows) {\n    let base = row * kw;\n    for (var j: u32 = lid.x; j < kw; j = j + 64u) {\n      let word = w[base + j];\n      let k4 = j * 4u;\n      acc = acc + x[k4] * f32(i32(word & 255u) - p.wzp)\n                + x[k4 + 1u] * f32(i32((word >> 8u) & 255u) - p.wzp)\n                + x[k4 + 2u] * f32(i32((word >> 16u) & 255u) - p.wzp)\n                + x[k4 + 3u] * f32(i32((word >> 24u) & 255u) - p.wzp);\n    }\n  }\n  sh[lid.x] = acc;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  for (var s: u32 = 32u; s > 0u; s = s >> 1u) {\n    if (lid.x < s) { sh[lid.x] = sh[lid.x] + sh[lid.x + s]; }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n  }\n  if (lid.x == 0u && row < p.rows) { y[row] = sh[0] * p.scale; }\n}\n`;\n\n// ---------- 主機端：緩衝區與分派 ----------\nconst wcache = new WeakMap();  // 裝置 → WeakMap(Uint8Array → { buf, bytes })\nfunction packedBytes(u8) {\n  const padded = (u8.length + 3) & ~3;\n  if (padded === u8.length && (u8.byteOffset & 3) === 0) return new Uint8Array(u8.buffer, u8.byteOffset, u8.length);\n  const c = new Uint8Array(padded); c.set(u8); return c;\n}\n// 權重緩衝區：同一個 Uint8Array 在同一裝置上只上傳一次（常駐）\nfunction weightBuf(dev, u8) {\n  let m = wcache.get(dev);\n  if (!m) { m = new WeakMap(); wcache.set(dev, m); }\n  let e = m.get(u8);\n  if (!e) {\n    const bytes = packedBytes(u8);\n    const buf = dev.createBuffer({ size: bytes.byteLength, usage: USAGE.STORAGE | USAGE.COPY_DST | USAGE.COPY_SRC });\n    dev.queue.writeBuffer(buf, 0, bytes);\n    e = { buf: buf, bytes: bytes.byteLength };\n    m.set(u8, e);\n  }\n  return e.buf;\n}\nconst pipes = new WeakMap();  // 裝置 → Map(程式碼 → 管線)\nfunction pipeFor(dev, code) {\n  let m = pipes.get(dev);\n  if (!m) { m = new Map(); pipes.set(dev, m); }\n  let p = m.get(code);\n  if (!p) { p = dev.createComputePipeline({ layout: 'auto', compute: { module: dev.createShaderModule({ code: code }), entryPoint: 'main' } }); m.set(code, p); }\n  return p;\n}\nfunction inBuf(dev, arr) {\n  const buf = dev.createBuffer({ size: Math.max(4, arr.byteLength), usage: USAGE.STORAGE | USAGE.COPY_DST | USAGE.COPY_SRC });\n  dev.queue.writeBuffer(buf, 0, arr);\n  return buf;\n}\n// 分派一次並讀回輸出（Float32Array，長度 outLen）\nasync function dispatchRead(dev, code, bufs, outLen, uniform, gx, gy) {\n  const out = dev.createBuffer({ size: Math.max(4, outLen * 4), usage: USAGE.STORAGE | USAGE.COPY_SRC | USAGE.COPY_DST });\n  const ub = dev.createBuffer({ size: Math.max(16, Math.ceil(uniform.byteLength / 16) * 16), usage: USAGE.UNIFORM | USAGE.COPY_DST });\n  dev.queue.writeBuffer(ub, 0, uniform);\n  const pipe = pipeFor(dev, code);\n  const all = bufs.concat([out]);\n  const entries = all.map((b, i) => ({ binding: i, resource: { buffer: b } }));\n  entries.push({ binding: all.length, resource: { buffer: ub } });\n  const bg = dev.createBindGroup({ layout: pipe.getBindGroupLayout(0), entries: entries });\n  const enc = dev.createCommandEncoder();\n  const pass = enc.beginComputePass();\n  pass.setPipeline(pipe); pass.setBindGroup(0, bg); pass.dispatchWorkgroups(gx, gy || 1); pass.end();\n  const rb = dev.createBuffer({ size: Math.max(4, outLen * 4), usage: USAGE.MAP_READ | USAGE.COPY_DST });\n  enc.copyBufferToBuffer(out, 0, rb, 0, Math.max(4, outLen * 4));\n  dev.queue.submit([enc.finish()]);\n  await rb.mapAsync(1);\n  const res = new Float32Array(rb.getMappedRange().slice(0, outLen * 4));\n  rb.unmap();\n  out.destroy && out.destroy(); rb.destroy && rb.destroy(); ub.destroy && ub.destroy();\n  return res;\n}\n\nfunction unif(fn) { const ab = new ArrayBuffer(32); fn(new DataView(ab)); return new Uint8Array(ab); }\n\n// ---------- 對外 API ----------\n// q8mm：xq（Int32Array，M×K，已扣輸入 zero point）、W（Uint8Array，K×N）、wzp、scale = 輸入scale × 權重scale\n// opts.q8variant：'simple'（逐格，低階保底）、'dec'（解碼，共用記憶體 GEMV 式）或 'pf'（預填，64×64 平鋪＋4×4 暫存器分塊）；\n// 沒給時：N 不是 4 的倍數 → simple；M ≥ 16 → pf；否則 dec。測試與對拍用 opts.q8variant 強制。\n// 門檻以實測為準：這台 Kepler 上 M=8 時 pf 比 dec 慢（4.2 ms 對 0.8 ms），M=64 才勝出（4.1 ms 對 5.8 ms）；M=16、32 尚未量，先取已量到的 64。\nconst Q8_PF_MIN_M = 64;\n// 4 ≤ M < 64 → 'decr'（多列解碼，每工作群組 4 列，權重只讀一次）：real Chrome 實測 M=4 0.455→0.40、M=8 0.81→0.65、M=16 1.58→1.135、M=32 2.93→2.115 ms；M=1、2 仍用 'dec'（decr 較慢）。\n// K 參數只用來判斷 f32 版是否精確（K ≤ 4096）；沒給 K 時走 i32 的 decr8，一定精確。\nfunction q8mmVariant(N, opts, M, K) {\n  const forced = opts && opts.q8variant;\n  if (forced === 'simple' || forced === 'dec' || forced === 'pf' || forced === 'decr' || forced === 'decr8' || forced === 'decr8f' || forced === 'pf8x4' || forced === 'decr4f' || forced === 'decr2f' || forced === 'splitk') return forced;\n  if (N % 4 !== 0) return 'simple';\n  // R5：split-K（'splitk'）只在強制指定時使用。純核心時間快 21–25%（1×4096×1024 0.245→0.185 ms；1×1024×3072 0.195→0.155），\n  // 但端到端（含 x 上傳與兩段的讀回）變慢或持平（10.1 對 8.4 ms；9.0 對 9.1 ms），所以自動規則不選它。\n  if (M !== undefined && M >= Q8_PF_MIN_M) return (K !== undefined && K <= 4096) ? 'pf8x4' : 'pf';   // f32 4×8 分塊（K ≤ 4096 精確）；其餘用 pf\n  if (M !== undefined && M >= 8) return (K !== undefined && K <= 4096) ? 'decr8f' : 'decr8';   // f32 8 列版：M=8 0.60→0.44 ms、M=16 1.07→0.79 ms（K ≤ 4096 精確）\n  if (M !== undefined && M >= 4) return (K !== undefined && K <= 4096) ? 'decr4f' : 'decr';\n  if (M === 2 && K !== undefined && K <= 4096) return 'decr2f';\n  return 'dec';\n}\nasync function q8mm(xq, W, wzp, M, K, N, scale, opts) {\n  const sc = Math.fround(scale);\n  const variant = q8mmVariant(N, opts, M, K);\n  return nn.tryLayers('q8mm', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      if (variant !== 'simple' && N % 4 !== 0) throw new Error('q8mm ' + variant + '：N 必須是 4 的倍數（N=' + N + '）');\n      if (variant === 'splitk') {\n        // R5 split-K：部分和＋歸約，兩段在同一個批次裡一次 submit；整數累加，結果與 q8mmRef 逐位相同\n        // 權重用既有的快取緩衝區（weightBuf：同一份 W 只上傳一次），位元組與核心的 u32 讀法一致（小端、每字 4 個 n），不需要 JS 重排\n        const S = SQ.pickSplits(K), nq = N >>> 2;\n        const xbuf = inBuf(dev, Int32Array.from(xq));\n        const wbuf = weightBuf(dev, W);\n        const bt = nn.createBatch(dev);\n        const hP = bt.alloc(S * M * N), hY = bt.alloc(M * N);\n        const pv = new DataView(new ArrayBuffer(32));\n        pv.setUint32(0, M, true); pv.setUint32(4, K, true); pv.setUint32(8, N, true); pv.setUint32(12, nq, true); pv.setInt32(16, wzp, true); pv.setUint32(20, S, true);\n        const rv = new DataView(new ArrayBuffer(32));\n        rv.setUint32(0, M, true); rv.setUint32(4, K, true); rv.setUint32(8, N, true); rv.setUint32(12, nq, true); rv.setInt32(16, wzp, true); rv.setUint32(20, S, true); rv.setFloat32(24, sc, true);\n        bt.dispatchRaw(SQ.WGSL_Q8_SPLITK_PARTIAL, [xbuf, wbuf, hP.buf], new Uint8Array(pv.buffer), SQ.dispatchPartial(M, N, S));\n        bt.dispatchRaw(SQ.WGSL_Q8_SPLITK_REDUCE, [hP.buf, hY.buf], new Uint8Array(rv.buffer), SQ.dispatchReduce(M, N));\n        const got = await bt.read([[hY, M * N]]);\n        xbuf.destroy && xbuf.destroy();\n        return got[0];\n      }\n      const xb = inBuf(dev, Int32Array.from(xq));\n      const wb = weightBuf(dev, W);\n      let r;\n      if (variant === 'dec' || variant === 'pf') {\n        const u = unif((d) => { d.setUint32(0, M, true); d.setUint32(4, K, true); d.setUint32(8, N, true); d.setInt32(12, wzp, true); d.setFloat32(16, sc, true); d.setUint32(20, N >>> 2, true); });\n        if (variant === 'dec') r = await dispatchRead(dev, WGSL_Q8MM_DEC, [xb, wb], M * N, u, Math.ceil(N / 64), M);\n        else r = await dispatchRead(dev, WGSL_Q8MM_PF, [xb, wb], M * N, u, Math.ceil(N / 64), Math.ceil(M / 64));\n      } else if (variant === 'pf8x4') {\n        const u = unif((d) => { d.setUint32(0, M, true); d.setUint32(4, K, true); d.setUint32(8, N, true); d.setInt32(12, wzp, true); d.setFloat32(16, sc, true); d.setUint32(20, N >>> 2, true); });\n        r = await dispatchRead(dev, WGSL_Q8MM_PF8X4, [xb, wb], M * N, u, Math.ceil(N / 128), Math.ceil(M / 64));\n      } else if (variant === 'decr2f') {\n        const u = unif((d) => { d.setUint32(0, M, true); d.setUint32(4, K, true); d.setUint32(8, N, true); d.setInt32(12, wzp, true); d.setFloat32(16, sc, true); d.setUint32(20, N >>> 2, true); });\n        r = await dispatchRead(dev, WGSL_Q8MM_DECR2F, [xb, wb], M * N, u, Math.ceil(N / 64), Math.ceil(M / 2));\n      } else if (variant === 'decr4f') {\n        const u = unif((d) => { d.setUint32(0, M, true); d.setUint32(4, K, true); d.setUint32(8, N, true); d.setInt32(12, wzp, true); d.setFloat32(16, sc, true); d.setUint32(20, N >>> 2, true); });\n        r = await dispatchRead(dev, WGSL_Q8MM_DECR4F, [xb, wb], M * N, u, Math.ceil(N / 64), Math.ceil(M / 4));\n      } else if (variant === 'decr8f') {\n        const u = unif((d) => { d.setUint32(0, M, true); d.setUint32(4, K, true); d.setUint32(8, N, true); d.setInt32(12, wzp, true); d.setFloat32(16, sc, true); d.setUint32(20, N >>> 2, true); });\n        r = await dispatchRead(dev, WGSL_Q8MM_DECR8F, [xb, wb], M * N, u, Math.ceil(N / 64), Math.ceil(M / 8));\n      } else if (variant === 'decr8') {\n        const u = unif((d) => { d.setUint32(0, M, true); d.setUint32(4, K, true); d.setUint32(8, N, true); d.setInt32(12, wzp, true); d.setFloat32(16, sc, true); d.setUint32(20, N >>> 2, true); });\n        r = await dispatchRead(dev, WGSL_Q8MM_DECR8, [xb, wb], M * N, u, Math.ceil(N / 64), Math.ceil(M / 8));\n      } else if (variant === 'decr') {\n        const u = unif((d) => { d.setUint32(0, M, true); d.setUint32(4, K, true); d.setUint32(8, N, true); d.setInt32(12, wzp, true); d.setFloat32(16, sc, true); d.setUint32(20, N >>> 2, true); });\n        r = await dispatchRead(dev, WGSL_Q8MM_DECR, [xb, wb], M * N, u, Math.ceil(N / 64), Math.ceil(M / 4));\n      } else {\n        const u = unif((d) => { d.setUint32(0, M, true); d.setUint32(4, K, true); d.setUint32(8, N, true); d.setInt32(12, wzp, true); d.setFloat32(16, sc, true); });\n        r = await dispatchRead(dev, WGSL_Q8MM, [xb, wb], M * N, u, Math.ceil(N / 64), M);\n      }\n      xb.destroy && xb.destroy();\n      return r;\n    },\n    null,\n    () => q8mmRef(xq, W, wzp, M, K, N, sc));\n}\n\n// ---------- 批次版 q8mm（O6）：輸入 xq 與 sx 都在 GPU 上（來自 nn_ops 批次的 quantizeDyn），整段不回讀 ----------\n// 做法：把三個核心的 binding(3) uniform 換成 binding(4)，新增 binding(3) 的 sx（[輸入 scale]），輸出乘上 sx[0]·wscale。\n// 權重 wbuf 是 GPU 緩衝區（K×N/4 個 u32，布局與 q8mm 的權重相同：每列 N 個 uint8，小端 4 個一字）；wscale、wzp 是主機端常數。\n// 注意：GPU 的 f32 乘法與參考版（f64 算 scale 再 fround）會差 1 ulp 左右，判準用相對誤差，不要求逐位相同（q 本身仍逐位相同）。\nfunction dynKernel(src) {\n  return src.replace('@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;', '@group(0) @binding(3) var<storage, read> sx: array<f32>;\\n@group(0) @binding(4) var<uniform> p: P;')\n    .replace('* p.scale;', '* (sx[2] * p.scale);');   // sx＝quantizeDyn 的 st：[mn, mx, scale, zp]，輸入 scale 在 sx[2]\n}\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_DYN = dynKernel(WGSL_Q8MM);\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_DEC_DYN = dynKernel(WGSL_Q8MM_DEC);\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_PF_DYN = dynKernel(WGSL_Q8MM_PF);\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_DECR_DYN = dynKernel(WGSL_Q8MM_DECR);\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_DECR8_DYN = dynKernel(WGSL_Q8MM_DECR8);\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_DECR8F_DYN = dynKernel(WGSL_Q8MM_DECR8F);\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_PF8X4_DYN = dynKernel(WGSL_Q8MM_PF8X4);\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_DECR4F_DYN = dynKernel(WGSL_Q8MM_DECR4F);\nconst WGSL_Q8MM_DECR2F_DYN = dynKernel(WGSL_Q8MM_DECR2F);\n// b：nn_ops.createBatch；xq：quantizeDyn 的回傳（{buf, n, st}）；wbuf：GPUBuffer；回傳 { buf, n }（M×N 的 f32 句柄）\nfunction q8mmBatched(b, xq, wbuf, wzp, M, K, N, wscale, opts) {\n  // R5：split-K 目前只有獨立（非批次）的 q8mm 路徑；批次版在這種形狀退回解碼核心（同樣是整數累加，逐位相同）\n  const variant = (q8mmVariant(N, opts, M, K) === 'splitk') ? 'dec' : q8mmVariant(N, opts, M, K);\n  if (variant !== 'simple' && N % 4 !== 0) throw new Error('q8mm ' + variant + '：N 必須是 4 的倍數（N=' + N + '）');\n  const y = b.alloc(M * N);\n  const u = new ArrayBuffer(32), d = new DataView(u);\n  d.setUint32(0, M, true); d.setUint32(4, K, true); d.setUint32(8, N, true); d.setInt32(12, wzp, true); d.setFloat32(16, Math.fround(wscale), true); d.setUint32(20, N >>> 2, true);\n  const sx = xq.st.buf;\n  if (variant === 'dec') b.dispatchRaw(WGSL_Q8MM_DEC_DYN, [xq.buf, wbuf, y.buf, sx], new Uint8Array(u), [Math.ceil(N / 64), M, 1]);\n  else if (variant === 'pf') b.dispatchRaw(WGSL_Q8MM_PF_DYN, [xq.buf, wbuf, y.buf, sx], new Uint8Array(u), [Math.ceil(N / 64), Math.ceil(M / 64), 1]);\n  else if (variant === 'pf8x4') b.dispatchRaw(WGSL_Q8MM_PF8X4_DYN, [xq.buf, wbuf, y.buf, sx], new Uint8Array(u), [Math.ceil(N / 128), Math.ceil(M / 64), 1]);\n  else if (variant === 'decr2f') b.dispatchRaw(WGSL_Q8MM_DECR2F_DYN, [xq.buf, wbuf, y.buf, sx], new Uint8Array(u), [Math.ceil(N / 64), Math.ceil(M / 2), 1]);\n  else if (variant === 'decr4f') b.dispatchRaw(WGSL_Q8MM_DECR4F_DYN, [xq.buf, wbuf, y.buf, sx], new Uint8Array(u), [Math.ceil(N / 64), Math.ceil(M / 4), 1]);\n  else if (variant === 'decr8f') b.dispatchRaw(WGSL_Q8MM_DECR8F_DYN, [xq.buf, wbuf, y.buf, sx], new Uint8Array(u), [Math.ceil(N / 64), Math.ceil(M / 8), 1]);\n  else if (variant === 'decr8') b.dispatchRaw(WGSL_Q8MM_DECR8_DYN, [xq.buf, wbuf, y.buf, sx], new Uint8Array(u), [Math.ceil(N / 64), Math.ceil(M / 8), 1]);\n  else if (variant === 'decr') b.dispatchRaw(WGSL_Q8MM_DECR_DYN, [xq.buf, wbuf, y.buf, sx], new Uint8Array(u), [Math.ceil(N / 64), Math.ceil(M / 4), 1]);\n  else b.dispatchRaw(WGSL_Q8MM_DYN, [xq.buf, wbuf, y.buf, sx], new Uint8Array(u), [Math.ceil(N / 64), M, 1]);\n  return y;\n}\n\n// q8lm：x（Float32Array K）、W（Uint8Array V×K，不論多大；超過儲存緩衝上限時照列分塊）、回傳 logits\n// chunks 可選：事先切好的 Uint8Array 陣列（同一個陣列物件重複使用才能常駐），沒給就用 W.subarray 切（每次新物件，不常駐）\nfunction planChunks(W, V, K, maxBytes) {\n  const rowsPer = Math.max(1, Math.floor(maxBytes / K));\n  const out = [];\n  for (let r = 0; r < V; r += rowsPer) { const n = Math.min(rowsPer, V - r); out.push({ row0: r, rows: n, w: W.subarray(r * K, (r + n) * K) }); }\n  return out;\n}\nasync function q8lm(x, chunks, wzp, K, scale, opts) {\n  const xf = Float32Array.from(x);\n  const V = chunks.reduce((s, c) => s + c.rows, 0);\n  const sc = Math.fround(scale);\n  return nn.tryLayers('q8lm', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      if (K % 4 !== 0) throw new Error('q8lm：K 必須是 4 的倍數（K=' + K + '）');\n      const xb = inBuf(dev, xf);\n      const out = new Float32Array(V);\n      for (const c of chunks) {\n        const wb = weightBuf(dev, c.w);\n        const u = unif((d) => { d.setUint32(0, c.rows, true); d.setUint32(4, K, true); d.setInt32(8, wzp, true); d.setFloat32(12, sc, true); });\n        const r = await dispatchRead(dev, WGSL_Q8LM, [xb, wb], c.rows, u, Math.min(c.rows, MAX_GROUPS), Math.ceil(c.rows / MAX_GROUPS));\n        out.set(r, c.row0);\n      }\n      xb.destroy && xb.destroy();\n      return out;\n    },\n    null,\n    () => {\n      const o = new Float32Array(V);\n      for (const c of chunks) { const r = q8lmRef(xf, c.w, wzp, c.rows, K, sc); for (let i = 0; i < c.rows; i++) o[c.row0 + i] = r[i]; }\n      return o;\n    });\n}\n\n// ---------- WebGL2（T3）：lm_head 的 q8 矩陣乘退路 ----------\n// 權重打包成 RGBA8 紋理：每個紋理像素是同一列的 4 個相鄰位元組（k=4j..4j+3），紋理寬度 = maxTex，\n// 紋理像素序號 t = 列×(K/4)+j。一個分塊（tile）＝一張 maxTex×maxTex 的紋理（至多 maxTex² 個像素）。\n// 片段著色器每個輸出（一個詞表列）讀 K/4 個像素做點積；x 放在寬 K、高 1 的 RGBA32F 紋理（R 通道）。\n// 輸出寫進 RGBA32F 的 FBO，readPixels 讀回。需要 EXT_color_buffer_float（nn.glSupport 會檢查）。\nconst VS_GL = '#version 300 es\\nvoid main(){ vec2 p = vec2(float((gl_VertexID << 1) & 2), float(gl_VertexID & 2)); gl_Position = vec4(p * 2.0 - 1.0, 0.0, 1.0); }\\n';\nconst FS_Q8LM_GL = `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\nuniform highp sampler2D uW;\nuniform highp sampler2D uX;\nuniform int uK4;\nuniform int uTW;\nuniform int uRows;\nuniform int uOW;\nuniform float uZp;\nuniform float uScale;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uOW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  if (idx >= uRows) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  float acc = 0.0;\n  for (int j = 0; j < uK4; j++) {\n    int t = idx * uK4 + j;\n    vec4 b = floor(texelFetch(uW, ivec2(t % uTW, t / uTW), 0) * 255.0 + 0.5);\n    int k = j * 4;\n    acc += texelFetch(uX, ivec2(k, 0), 0).r * (b.r - uZp)\n         + texelFetch(uX, ivec2(k + 1, 0), 0).r * (b.g - uZp)\n         + texelFetch(uX, ivec2(k + 2, 0), 0).r * (b.b - uZp)\n         + texelFetch(uX, ivec2(k + 3, 0), 0).r * (b.a - uZp);\n  }\n  fragColor = vec4(acc * uScale, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}`;\nconst glStateOf = new WeakMap();  // WebGL2 上下文 → { prog, maxTex, weights: WeakMap(權重陣列 → 分塊紋理) }\nfunction glStateFor(gl) {\n  let s = glStateOf.get(gl);\n  if (!s) {\n    const maxTex = gl.getParameter(gl.MAX_TEXTURE_SIZE) || 4096;\n    s = { prog: null, maxTex: maxTex, weights: new WeakMap() };\n    glStateOf.set(gl, s);\n  }\n  return s;\n}\nfunction glCompile(gl, type, src) {\n  const sh = gl.createShader(type);\n  gl.shaderSource(sh, src); gl.compileShader(sh);\n  if (!gl.getShaderParameter(sh, gl.COMPILE_STATUS)) throw new Error('著色器編譯失敗：' + gl.getShaderInfoLog(sh));\n  return sh;\n}\nfunction glProgramFor(gl, st) {\n  if (st.prog) return st.prog;\n  const p = gl.createProgram();\n  gl.attachShader(p, glCompile(gl, gl.VERTEX_SHADER, VS_GL));\n  gl.attachShader(p, glCompile(gl, gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER, FS_Q8LM_GL));\n  gl.linkProgram(p);\n  if (!gl.getProgramParameter(p, gl.LINK_STATUS)) throw new Error('程式連結失敗：' + gl.getProgramInfoLog(p));\n  st.prog = p;\n  return p;\n}\nfunction glTex2D(gl, internal, w, h) {\n  const t = gl.createTexture();\n  gl.bindTexture(gl.TEXTURE_2D, t);\n  gl.texParameteri(gl.TEXTURE_2D, gl.TEXTURE_MIN_FILTER, gl.NEAREST);\n  gl.texParameteri(gl.TEXTURE_2D, gl.TEXTURE_MAG_FILTER, gl.NEAREST);\n  gl.texStorage2D(gl.TEXTURE_2D, 1, internal, w, h);\n  return t;\n}\n// 把一個分塊的權重（rows×K 位元組）打包成 maxTex 寬的 RGBA8 紋理（尾端補 0）\nfunction glUploadWeightTile(gl, bytes, texels, maxTex) {\n  const th = Math.max(1, Math.ceil(texels / maxTex));\n  const px = new Uint8Array(maxTex * th * 4);\n  px.set(bytes);\n  const t = glTex2D(gl, gl.RGBA8, maxTex, th);\n  gl.texSubImage2D(gl.TEXTURE_2D, 0, 0, 0, maxTex, th, gl.RGBA, gl.UNSIGNED_BYTE, px);\n  return { tex: t };\n}\n// WebGL2 版 lm_head：整張權重（V×K）依 maxTex² 切塊，權重紋理快取在上下文上（同一個權重陣列只上傳一次）\nfunction q8lmGl(gl, x, W, V, K, zp, scale) {\n  const sup = nn.glSupport(gl);\n  if (!sup.ok) throw new Error(sup.reason);\n  if (K % 4 !== 0) throw new Error('q8lm（WebGL2）：K 必須是 4 的倍數（K=' + K + '）');\n  const st = glStateFor(gl);\n  const maxTex = st.maxTex, K4 = K / 4;\n  if (K > maxTex) throw new Error('q8lm（WebGL2）：K=' + K + ' 超過紋理寬度上限 ' + maxTex);\n  const prog = glProgramFor(gl, st);\n  const tileRows = Math.floor(maxTex * maxTex / K4);\n  let tiles = st.weights.get(W);\n  if (!tiles) {\n    tiles = [];\n    for (let r0 = 0; r0 < V; r0 += tileRows) {\n      const n = Math.min(tileRows, V - r0);\n      tiles.push({ row0: r0, rows: n, tex: glUploadWeightTile(gl, W.subarray(r0 * K, (r0 + n) * K), n * K4, maxTex).tex });\n    }\n    st.weights.set(W, tiles);\n  }\n  // x：寬 K、高 1 的 RGBA32F（R 通道）\n  const xpx = new Float32Array(K * 4);\n  for (let k = 0; k < K; k++) xpx[k * 4] = x[k];\n  const xTex = glTex2D(gl, gl.RGBA32F, K, 1);\n  gl.texSubImage2D(gl.TEXTURE_2D, 0, 0, 0, K, 1, gl.RGBA, gl.FLOAT, xpx);\n  const out = new Float32Array(V);\n  const fb = gl.createFramebuffer();\n  const tmp = [xTex];\n  try {\n    gl.useProgram(prog);\n    const uW = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'uW'), uX = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'uX');\n    gl.uniform1i(uW, 0); gl.uniform1i(uX, 1);\n    gl.uniform1i(gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'uK4'), K4);\n    gl.uniform1i(gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'uTW'), maxTex);\n    gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'uZp'), zp);\n    gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'uScale'), scale);\n    gl.bindFramebuffer(gl.FRAMEBUFFER, fb);\n    for (const tile of tiles) {\n      const ow = Math.min(tile.rows, maxTex), oh = Math.ceil(tile.rows / ow);\n      const oTex = glTex2D(gl, gl.RGBA32F, ow, oh);\n      tmp.push(oTex);\n      gl.framebufferTexture2D(gl.FRAMEBUFFER, gl.COLOR_ATTACHMENT0, gl.TEXTURE_2D, oTex, 0);\n      if (gl.checkFramebufferStatus(gl.FRAMEBUFFER) !== gl.FRAMEBUFFER_COMPLETE) throw new Error('WebGL2 幀緩衝區不完整');\n      gl.uniform1i(gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'uRows'), tile.rows);\n      gl.uniform1i(gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'uOW'), ow);\n      gl.viewport(0, 0, ow, oh);\n      gl.activeTexture(gl.TEXTURE0); gl.bindTexture(gl.TEXTURE_2D, tile.tex);\n      gl.activeTexture(gl.TEXTURE1); gl.bindTexture(gl.TEXTURE_2D, xTex);\n      gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLES, 0, 3);\n      const buf = new Float32Array(ow * oh * 4);\n      gl.readPixels(0, 0, ow, oh, gl.RGBA, gl.FLOAT, buf);\n      for (let i = 0; i < tile.rows; i++) out[tile.row0 + i] = buf[i * 4];\n    }\n  } finally {\n    gl.bindFramebuffer(gl.FRAMEBUFFER, null);\n    gl.deleteFramebuffer(fb);\n    for (const t of tmp) gl.deleteTexture(t);\n  }\n  return out;\n}\n\n// 分塊快取：同一個權重陣列只切一次（分塊物件穩定，WGSL 端的權重緩衝區才能常駐）\nconst chunkCache = new WeakMap();\nfunction cachedChunks(W, V, K, maxBytes) {\n  let c = chunkCache.get(W);\n  if (!c) { c = planChunks(W, V, K, maxBytes); chunkCache.set(W, c); }\n  return c;\n}\n// WebGPU 版 lm_head（分塊、常駐權重）；丟例外由呼叫端決定退路\nasync function q8lmWgsl(dev, x, chunks, K, zp, scale) {\n  if (K % 4 !== 0) throw new Error('q8lm：K 必須是 4 的倍數（K=' + K + '）');\n  const xf = Float32Array.from(x);\n  const V = chunks.reduce((s, c) => s + c.rows, 0);\n  const sc = Math.fround(scale);\n  const xb = inBuf(dev, xf);\n  const out = new Float32Array(V);\n  try {\n    for (const c of chunks) {\n      const wb = weightBuf(dev, c.w);\n      const u = unif((d) => { d.setUint32(0, c.rows, true); d.setUint32(4, K, true); d.setInt32(8, zp, true); d.setFloat32(12, sc, true); });\n      const r = await dispatchRead(dev, WGSL_Q8LM, [xb, wb], c.rows, u, Math.min(c.rows, MAX_GROUPS), Math.ceil(c.rows / MAX_GROUPS));\n      out.set(r, c.row0);\n    }\n  } finally { xb.destroy && xb.destroy(); }\n  return out;\n}\n\n// 自動選層的 lm_head（網頁版與桌面版渲染行程共用）：T1 WebGPU（分塊）→ T3 WebGL2（紋理分塊）。\n// 都不可用或執行失敗就丟出「每一層各自的原因」，呼叫端退回 ONNX 路徑；不走慢的純 JS（比 ORT 還慢，沒有意義）。\n// opts：{ navigator, gl, skipT1 }（測試用：skipT1 強制走 WebGL2）。回傳 { result, info:{ layer, ms, reasons } }。\nasync function q8lmAuto(x, W, V, K, zp, scale, opts) {\n  const o = opts || {};\n  const nav = o.navigator !== undefined ? o.navigator : (typeof navigator !== 'undefined' ? navigator : undefined);\n  const reasons = [];\n  const t0 = Date.now();\n  if (!o.skipT1) {\n    const g = await nn.getDevice(nav);\n    if (g.dev) {\n      try {\n        const r = await q8lmWgsl(g.dev, x, cachedChunks(W, V, K, MAX_CHUNK_BYTES), K, zp, scale);\n        return { result: r, info: { layer: 'T1', ms: Date.now() - t0, reasons: reasons } };\n      } catch (e) { reasons.push('WebGPU 執行失敗：' + String((e && e.message) || e)); }\n    } else reasons.push(g.reason || 'WebGPU 不可用');\n  } else reasons.push('已指定跳過 WebGPU');\n  const gl = o.gl !== undefined ? o.gl : nn.getGl({ navigator: nav });\n  if (gl) {\n    try {\n      const t1 = Date.now();\n      const r = q8lmGl(gl, x, W, V, K, zp, scale);\n      return { result: r, info: { layer: 'T3', ms: Date.now() - t1, reasons: reasons } };\n    } catch (e) { reasons.push('WebGL2 執行失敗：' + String((e && e.message) || e)); }\n  } else reasons.push('WebGL2 上下文不可用');\n  const err = new Error('lm_head 沒有可用的 GPU 層（' + reasons.join('；') + '）');\n  err.reasons = reasons;\n  throw err;\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { quantizeDynamicRef, q8mmRef, q8lmRef, q8mm, q8mmVariant, q8lm, q8lmAuto, q8lmGl, q8lmWgsl, cachedChunks, planChunks, WGSL_Q8MM, WGSL_Q8MM_DEC, WGSL_Q8MM_DECR, WGSL_Q8MM_DECR8, WGSL_Q8MM_PF, WGSL_Q8LM, FS_Q8LM_GL, MAX_GROUPS, MAX_CHUNK_BYTES, q8mmBatched, WGSL_Q8MM_DYN, WGSL_Q8MM_DEC_DYN, WGSL_Q8MM_PF_DYN, WGSL_Q8MM_DECR_DYN, WGSL_Q8MM_DECR8_DYN, WGSL_Q8MM_DECR8F_DYN, WGSL_Q8MM_DECR8F, WGSL_Q8MM_DECR4F, WGSL_Q8MM_DECR2F, WGSL_Q8MM_PF8X4 };\n\n};\nMODS[\"onnx_lite\"] = function (module, exports, require) {\n/* onnx_lite.js — 極簡 ONNX 讀取器與改寫器（只用 Uint8Array，Node 與瀏覽器都能跑，不需要 Buffer）。\n * 用途：從現有 q8 模型檔取出權重（推論概念驗證），以及產生「輸出隱藏狀態、不算 lm_head」的變體圖（DESIGN.webgpu-cuda.md §7.3）。\n * 純 UMD。桌面版的 nr-onnx-lite.js 是這份檔案的拷貝（改一邊要同步）。\n *\n * parseModel 的回傳形狀：\n *   { buf, nodes, inits（物件：名稱→張量資訊，舊呼叫端用 m.inits[名稱]）, inputs, outputs（名稱字串）,\n *     graph: { nodes, inits（Map：名稱→同一批張量資訊）, inputs, outputs }（llm_q8_onnx 用）}\n * 2026-11-19 修正：O12f（ffbd0462d）把回傳改成只有 { graph }，舊呼叫端的 m.inits／m.nodes 變成 undefined，\n * 於是 Qwen3 GPU 整段解碼報「Cannot read properties of undefined」與「m.nodes is not iterable」。這裡把舊形狀還原，graph 保留給 O12f。\n * 輸入不合法（空檔、文字／網頁、截斷、缺 graph）會丟出寫明位元組數與檔頭的錯誤，不再回傳 undefined。\n */\n(function (root, factory) {\n  if (typeof module === 'object' && module.exports) module.exports = factory();\n  else root.FaOnnxLite = factory();\n})(typeof self !== 'undefined' ? self : this, function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  const td = typeof TextDecoder !== 'undefined' ? new TextDecoder('utf-8') : null;\n  const te = typeof TextEncoder !== 'undefined' ? new TextEncoder() : null;\n  const decodeUtf8 = (u8) => (td ? td.decode(u8) : Buffer.from(u8.buffer, u8.byteOffset, u8.length).toString('utf8'));\n  const encodeUtf8 = (s) => (te ? te.encode(s) : new Uint8Array(Buffer.from(s, 'utf8')));\n  const f32At = (u8, p) => new DataView(u8.buffer, u8.byteOffset, u8.byteLength).getFloat32(p, true);\n\n  // 位元組的描述：長度與前 16 位元組（十六進位）。錯誤訊息用，讓人看得出是截斷、空檔還是網頁。\n  function describe(u8) {\n    const head = Array.from(u8.subarray(0, 16), (b) => b.toString(16).padStart(2, '0')).join(' ');\n    return u8.length + ' 位元組，前 16 位元組：' + (head || '（無）');\n  }\n  // 讀 varint，回傳 [值, 新位置]；超出檔案範圍就丟錯（截斷的檔案會在這裡露出來）\n  function varint(buf, pos) {\n    let r = 0, mul = 1;\n    for (;;) {\n      if (pos >= buf.length) throw new Error('onnx_lite：varint 讀到檔案結尾（位置 ' + pos + '，共 ' + buf.length + ' 位元組，可能是截斷）');\n      const b = buf[pos++];\n      r += (b & 0x7f) * mul;\n      if (!(b & 0x80)) break;\n      mul *= 128;\n    }\n    return [r, pos];\n  }\n  // 一段長度為 len 的欄位內容必須在 end 與檔案長度之內；否則丟出寫明數字的錯誤\n  function checkRange(buf, pos, len, field, end) {\n    const limit = Math.min(end, buf.length);\n    if (pos + len > limit) throw new Error('onnx_lite：欄位 ' + field + ' 宣告 ' + len + ' 位元組，但只剩 ' + Math.max(0, limit - pos) + ' 位元組（位置 ' + pos + '，檔案共 ' + buf.length + ' 位元組）；檔案可能被截斷');\n  }\n  // 走一段訊息，對每個欄位呼叫 fn(欄位號, 線型, 值或[起,迄])；線型 2 的值是 [起, 迄]\n  function walk(buf, start, end, fn) {\n    let pos = start;\n    while (pos < end) {\n      let t; [t, pos] = varint(buf, pos);\n      const field = Math.floor(t / 8), wt = t % 8;\n      if (wt === 0) { let v; [v, pos] = varint(buf, pos); fn(field, 0, v); }\n      else if (wt === 2) { let len; [len, pos] = varint(buf, pos); checkRange(buf, pos, len, field, end); fn(field, 2, [pos, pos + len]); pos += len; }\n      else if (wt === 5) { checkRange(buf, pos, 4, field, end); fn(field, 5, [pos, pos + 4]); pos += 4; }\n      else if (wt === 1) { checkRange(buf, pos, 8, field, end); fn(field, 1, [pos, pos + 8]); pos += 8; }\n      else throw new Error('onnx_lite：不支援的線型 ' + wt + '（位置 ' + (pos - 1) + '）');\n    }\n  }\n  const str = (buf, r) => decodeUtf8(buf.subarray(r[0], r[1]));\n\n  function parseTensor(buf, r) {\n    const t = { name: '', dims: [], dtype: 0, raw: null, ext: {} };\n    walk(buf, r[0], r[1], (f, wt, v) => {\n      if (f === 1) { if (wt === 0) t.dims.push(v); else { let p = v[0]; while (p < v[1]) { let x; [x, p] = varint(buf, p); t.dims.push(x); } } }\n      else if (f === 2) t.dtype = v;\n      else if (f === 8) t.name = str(buf, v);\n      else if (f === 9) t.raw = v;  // [起, 迄]，不複製\n      else if (f === 4) { if (!t.floats) t.floats = []; if (wt === 2) { for (let p = v[0]; p < v[1]; p += 4) t.floats.push(f32At(buf, p)); } else t.floats.push(f32At(buf, v[0])); }\n      else if (f === 5) { if (!t.ints) t.ints = []; if (wt === 2) { let p = v[0]; while (p < v[1]) { let x; [x, p] = varint(buf, p); t.ints.push(x); } } else t.ints.push(v); }\n      else if (f === 7) { if (!t.ints) t.ints = []; if (wt === 2) { let p = v[0]; while (p < v[1]) { let x; [x, p] = varint(buf, p); t.ints.push(x); } } else t.ints.push(v); }   // int64_data（小的 int64 常數，例如 Split 的 splits）\n      else if (f === 13) { // external_data：StringStringEntryProto\n        let k = '', val = '';\n        walk(buf, v[0], v[1], (ff, w2, vv) => { if (ff === 1) k = str(buf, vv); else if (ff === 2) val = str(buf, vv); });\n        t.ext[k] = val;\n      }\n    });\n    return t;\n  }\n  function parseAttr(buf, r) {\n    const a = { name: '', i: null, f: null, ints: [], s: null };\n    walk(buf, r[0], r[1], (f, wt, v) => {\n      if (f === 1) a.name = str(buf, v);\n      else if (f === 3) a.i = v;\n      else if (f === 2) a.f = f32At(buf, v[0]);\n      else if (f === 8) { if (wt === 0) a.ints.push(v); }\n      else if (f === 4) a.s = str(buf, v);\n      else if (f === 5) a.tensor = v;  // TensorProto 範圍（Constant 節點的 value）\n      else if (f === 6) a.graph = v;   // GraphProto 範圍（If／Loop 的子圖）\n      else if (f === 9) { if (!a.strings) a.strings = []; a.strings.push(str(buf, v)); }\n    });\n    return a;\n  }\n  // 取得 Constant 節點的值：{ dims, dtype, values（Float32Array 或 BigInt/數字陣列） }\n  function constantValue(m, node) {\n    const a = node.attrs && node.attrs.value;\n    if (!a || !a.tensor) throw new Error('onnx_lite：節點 ' + node.name + ' 不是 tensor 常數');\n    const t = parseTensor(m.buf, a.tensor);\n    let values = null;\n    if (t.floats) values = Float32Array.from(t.floats);\n    else if (t.ints) values = t.ints.slice();\n    else if (t.raw) {\n      const bytes = m.buf.subarray(t.raw[0], t.raw[1]);\n      const dv = new DataView(bytes.buffer, bytes.byteOffset, bytes.byteLength);\n      const n = bytes.byteLength;\n      if (t.dtype === 1) { values = new Float32Array(n / 4); for (let i = 0; i < n / 4; i++) values[i] = dv.getFloat32(i * 4, true); }\n      else if (t.dtype === 6) { values = new Int32Array(n / 4); for (let i = 0; i < n / 4; i++) values[i] = dv.getInt32(i * 4, true); }\n      else if (t.dtype === 7) { values = []; for (let i = 0; i < n / 8; i++) values.push(Number(dv.getBigInt64(i * 8, true))); }\n      else if (t.dtype === 9) { values = Array.from(bytes); }\n      else values = bytes.slice();\n    }\n    return { dims: t.dims, dtype: t.dtype, values };\n  }\n  function parseNode(buf, r) {\n    const n = { name: '', op: '', inputs: [], outputs: [], attrs: {} };\n    walk(buf, r[0], r[1], (f, wt, v) => {\n      if (f === 1) n.inputs.push(str(buf, v));\n      else if (f === 2) n.outputs.push(str(buf, v));\n      else if (f === 3) n.name = str(buf, v);\n      else if (f === 4) n.op = str(buf, v);\n      else if (f === 5) { const a = parseAttr(buf, v); n.attrs[a.name] = a; }\n    });\n    return n;\n  }\n  // 解析一個 GraphProto（範圍 [起, 迄]）：節點、初始值（物件：名稱→張量資訊）、圖輸入名、圖輸出名（輸入不含初始值）\n  function parseGraph(buf, graph) {\n    const nodes = [], inits = {}, inputs = [], outputs = [];\n    const vname = (r) => { let s = ''; walk(buf, r[0], r[1], (f, wt, v) => { if (f === 1) s = str(buf, v); }); return s; };\n    walk(buf, graph[0], graph[1], (f, wt, v) => {\n      if (f === 1) nodes.push(parseNode(buf, v));\n      else if (f === 5) { const t = parseTensor(buf, v); inits[t.name] = t; }\n      else if (f === 11) inputs.push(vname(v));\n      else if (f === 12) outputs.push(vname(v));\n    });\n    return { nodes: nodes, inits: inits, inputs: inputs.filter((x) => !inits[x]), outputs: outputs };\n  }\n  // 輸入檢查：空檔、看起來是文字或網頁的內容，要在解析前就說清楚（否則會變成不知所云的例外）\n  function checkInput(buf) {\n    if (!buf || typeof buf.length !== 'number' || !(buf instanceof Uint8Array)) throw new Error('onnx_lite：輸入不是位元組（需要 Uint8Array）');\n    if (buf.length === 0) throw new Error('onnx_lite：檔案是空的（0 位元組）；常見原因是下載中斷或快取寫入失敗');\n    const n = Math.min(buf.length, 64);\n    let text = true;\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) { const b = buf[i]; if (!(b === 9 || b === 10 || b === 13 || (b >= 32 && b < 127))) { text = false; break; } }\n    if (text) throw new Error('onnx_lite：看起來是文字或網頁，不是 ONNX 二進位（' + describe(buf) + '）；常見原因是下載到錯誤頁');\n  }\n  // 讀整個模型。回傳形狀見檔案開頭。\n  function parseModel(buf) {\n    checkInput(buf);\n    let graph = null; const top = new Set();\n    walk(buf, 0, buf.length, (f, wt, v) => { top.add(f); if (f === 7) graph = v; });\n    if (!graph) throw new Error('onnx_lite：找不到 graph（ModelProto 欄位 7）；頂層欄位號：[' + Array.from(top).sort((a, b) => a - b).join(', ') + ']（' + describe(buf) + '）');\n    const g = parseGraph(buf, graph);\n    const initMap = new Map(Object.keys(g.inits).map((k) => [k, g.inits[k]]));\n    return { buf: buf, nodes: g.nodes, inits: g.inits, inputs: g.inputs, outputs: g.outputs,\n      graph: { nodes: g.nodes, inits: initMap, inputs: g.inputs, outputs: g.outputs } };\n  }\n\n  // ---- 張量的 typed array（llm_q8_onnx 用）：raw_data 不對齊時複製一份；小張量用 float_data／int 欄位 ----\n  const TYPED = { 1: Float32Array, 2: Uint8Array, 3: Int8Array, 6: Int32Array, 10: Uint16Array };\n  function tensorArray(buf, t) {\n    const elems = t.dims.reduce((a, b) => a * b, 1);\n    const C = TYPED[t.dtype];\n    if (t.raw) {\n      if (!C) throw new Error('onnx_lite：dtype ' + t.dtype + ' 暫不取陣列（' + t.name + '）');\n      const bytes = buf.subarray(t.raw[0], t.raw[1]);\n      const need = elems * C.BYTES_PER_ELEMENT;\n      if (bytes.length !== need) throw new Error('onnx_lite：' + t.name + ' 的 raw_data 長度 ' + bytes.length + ' 與形狀需要的 ' + need + ' 不符');\n      if (bytes.byteOffset % C.BYTES_PER_ELEMENT === 0) return new C(bytes.buffer, bytes.byteOffset, elems);\n      return new C(bytes.slice().buffer, 0, elems);\n    }\n    if (t.dtype === 1 && t.floats) return Float32Array.from(t.floats.slice(0, elems || t.floats.length));\n    if (t.dtype === 7 && t.ints) return BigInt64Array.from(t.ints.slice(0, elems || t.ints.length), (x) => BigInt(x));\n    if (t.ints && C) return C.from(t.ints.slice(0, elems || t.ints.length));\n    throw new Error('onnx_lite：' + t.name + ' 沒有 raw_data，也不是可讀的 float_data／int 欄位（dtype ' + t.dtype + '）');\n  }\n\n  // ---- 位元組組裝（只用 Uint8Array）----\n  const enc = (n) => { const o = []; while (n > 127) { o.push((n % 128) | 128); n = Math.floor(n / 128); } o.push(n); return Uint8Array.from(o); };\n  const cat = (list) => {\n    let len = 0; for (const b of list) len += b.length;\n    const out = new Uint8Array(len); let p = 0;\n    for (const b of list) { out.set(b, p); p += b.length; }\n    return out;\n  };\n  const fVarB = (f, v) => cat([enc(f * 8), enc(v)]);\n  const fBytesB = (f, b) => cat([enc(f * 8 + 2), enc(b.length), b]);\n  const fStrB = (f, s) => fBytesB(f, encodeUtf8(s));\n  function valueInfo(name, elem, dims) {  // dims：數字或字串（符號維度，dim_param）\n    const dimMsgs = dims.map((d) => fBytesB(1, typeof d === 'number' ? fVarB(1, d) : fStrB(2, d)));\n    return cat([fStrB(1, name), fBytesB(2, fBytesB(1, cat([fVarB(1, elem), fBytesB(2, cat(dimMsgs))])))]);\n  }\n  // 依序走一段訊息，回傳每個欄位 { f, wt, start, end, vr }（start..end 是含標籤的整段位元組）\n  function fieldsOf(buf, a, b) {\n    const out = [];\n    let pos = a;\n    while (pos < b) {\n      const start = pos;\n      let t; [t, pos] = varint(buf, pos);\n      const f = Math.floor(t / 8), wt = t % 8;\n      let vr;\n      if (wt === 0) { let v; [v, pos] = varint(buf, pos); vr = v; }\n      else if (wt === 2) { let len; [len, pos] = varint(buf, pos); checkRange(buf, pos, len, f, b); vr = [pos, pos + len]; pos += len; }\n      else if (wt === 5) { checkRange(buf, pos, 4, f, b); vr = [pos, pos + 4]; pos += 4; }\n      else if (wt === 1) { checkRange(buf, pos, 8, f, b); vr = [pos, pos + 8]; pos += 8; }\n      else throw new Error('onnx_lite：不支援的線型 ' + wt + '（位置 ' + start + '）');\n      out.push({ f: f, wt: wt, start: start, end: pos, vr: vr });\n    }\n    return out;\n  }\n  // 把模型改成：移除 dropNodeName 節點與之後不再被使用的節點，並把圖輸出 replaceOutput 換成 hiddenName（float32，維度 hiddenDims）\n  // 權重位元組原樣沿用（subarray，不複製）；回傳 { removed, buf():Uint8Array }\n  function buildHiddenStateModel(buf, o) {\n    checkInput(buf);\n    const top = fieldsOf(buf, 0, buf.length);\n    const gf = top.find((x) => x.f === 7);\n    if (!gf) throw new Error('onnx_lite：找不到 graph（ModelProto 欄位 7）（' + describe(buf) + '）');\n    const parts = fieldsOf(buf, gf.vr[0], gf.vr[1]);\n    const nodes = [];\n    parts.forEach((p, i) => { if (p.f === 1) { const n = parseNode(buf, p.vr); n._i = i; nodes.push(n); } });\n    const drop = new Set();\n    const target = nodes.find((n) => n.name === o.dropNodeName);\n    if (!target) throw new Error('onnx_lite：找不到節點 ' + o.dropNodeName);\n    drop.add(target);\n    const outNames = new Set(); // 圖輸出（扣掉要換掉的）\n    parts.forEach((p) => { if (p.f === 12) { let nm = ''; walk(buf, p.vr[0], p.vr[1], (f, wt, v) => { if (f === 1) nm = str(buf, v); }); if (nm !== o.replaceOutput) outNames.add(nm); } });\n    outNames.add(o.hiddenName);\n    // 反覆清掉沒有任何使用者、也不是圖輸出的節點\n    for (let changed = true; changed;) {\n      changed = false;\n      const used = new Set(outNames);\n      nodes.forEach((n) => { if (!drop.has(n)) n.inputs.forEach((x) => used.add(x)); });\n      nodes.forEach((n) => { if (!drop.has(n) && n.outputs.every((x) => !used.has(x))) { drop.add(n); changed = true; } });\n    }\n    const keepIdx = new Set(); drop.forEach((n) => keepIdx.add(n._i));\n    const gp = [];\n    parts.forEach((p, i) => {\n      if (p.f === 1 && keepIdx.has(i)) return;\n      if (p.f === 12) { let nm = ''; walk(buf, p.vr[0], p.vr[1], (f, wt, v) => { if (f === 1) nm = str(buf, v); }); if (nm === o.replaceOutput) { gp.push(fBytesB(12, valueInfo(o.hiddenName, 1, o.hiddenDims))); return; } }\n      gp.push(buf.subarray(p.start, p.end));\n    });\n    const gLen = gp.reduce((s, b) => s + b.length, 0);\n    const out = [];\n    top.forEach((p) => { if (p === gf) { out.push(cat([enc(7 * 8 + 2), enc(gLen)])); gp.forEach((b) => out.push(b)); } else out.push(buf.subarray(p.start, p.end)); });\n    return { removed: Array.from(drop).map((n) => n.name), buf: function () { return cat(out); } };\n  }\n  // 取張量的位元組（raw_data；外部資料不支援）\n  function tensorBytes(model, name) {\n    const t = model.inits[name];\n    if (!t) throw new Error('onnx_lite：沒有權重 ' + name);\n    if (!t.raw) throw new Error('onnx_lite：權重 ' + name + ' 沒有 raw_data（可能是外部資料或欄位型）');\n    return model.buf.subarray(t.raw[0], t.raw[1]);\n  }\n  // 取純量（scale 為 float、zero_point 為整數）：raw 或 floats／ints 欄位都接受\n  function scalar(model, name) {\n    const t = model.inits[name];\n    if (!t) throw new Error('onnx_lite：沒有權重 ' + name);\n    if (t.floats && t.floats.length) return t.floats[0];\n    if (t.ints && t.ints.length) return t.ints[0];\n    if (t.raw) { const b = model.buf; return t.dtype === 1 ? f32At(b, t.raw[0]) : b[t.raw[0]]; }\n    throw new Error('onnx_lite：權重 ' + name + ' 沒有可讀的純量');\n  }\n  const DTYPE = { 1: 'f