(p + 'bq', L.bq, nh * hd); need(p + 'bk', L.bk, nkv * hd); need(p + 'bv', L.bv, nkv * hd); }\n    });\n  }\n\n  // 建立一個解碼狀態（每層的 KV 快取，依位置累加）。opts.useOverrides === false 時不用任何覆寫。\n  function createState(arch, weights, opts) {\n    assertSupported(arch);\n    checkWeights(arch, weights);\n    const hd = ARCH.headDimOf(arch);\n    return { arch: arch, w: weights, hd: hd, ops: resolveOps(arch, opts), pos: 0, cacheK: Array.from({ length: arch.layers }, () => []), cacheV: Array.from({ length: arch.layers }, () => []) };\n  }\n\n  // 餵一個詞元，回傳這個位置的 logits（長度 vocab）。狀態會前進一格。\n  function step(state, token) {\n    const H = state.arch.hidden;\n    if (!(token >= 0 && token < state.arch.vocab) || token !== Math.floor(token)) throw new Error('llm_skeleton：詞元超出詞表（' + token + '）');\n    return stepVec(state, state.w.embed.subarray(token * H, token * H + H));\n  }\n  // 餵一個已經是隱藏向量的輸入（例如影像嵌入），回傳這個位置的 logits。狀態會前進一格。\n  function stepVec(state, x0) {\n    const a = state.arch, w = state.w, hd = state.hd, H = a.hidden, nh = a.heads, nkv = a.kvHeads, ops = state.ops;\n    if (!x0 || x0.length !== H) throw new Error('llm_skeleton：輸入向量長度應為 hidden=' + H + '（實際 ' + (x0 ? x0.length : '缺少') + '）');\n    const pos = state.pos;\n    let x = Float32Array.from(x0);\n    for (let li = 0; li < a.layers; li++) {\n      const L = w.layers[li];\n      const h = ops.rmsnorm(x, L.attnNorm, a.eps);\n      let q = ops.matvec(L.wq, nh * hd, H, h);\n      let k = ops.matvec(L.wk, nkv * hd, H, h);\n      const v = ops.matvec(L.wv, nkv * hd, H, h);\n      if (a.bias) {\n        for (let i = 0; i < nh * hd; i++) q[i] += L.bq[i];\n        for (let i = 0; i < nkv * hd; i++) { k[i] += L.bk[i]; v[i] += L.bv[i]; }\n      }\n      if (a.qkNorm) {\n        // qk-norm：每個 head 各自做 RMSNorm（權重長度 hd）\n        const perHead = (vec, n, wn) => { const o = new Float32Array(vec.length); for (let hh = 0; hh < n; hh++) o.set(ops.rmsnorm(vec.subarray(hh * hd, hh * hd + hd), wn, a.eps), hh * hd); return o; };\n        q = perHead(q, nh, L.qNorm); k = perHead(k, nkv, L.kNorm);\n      }\n      q = ops.rope(q, nh, hd, pos, a.rope.base, a.rope.scaling);\n      k = ops.rope(k, nkv, hd, pos, a.rope.base, a.rope.scaling);\n      state.cacheK[li].push(k); state.cacheV[li].push(v);\n      const T = state.cacheK[li].length;\n      const attnOut = new Float32Array(nh * hd);\n      const scale = 1 / Math.sqrt(hd);\n      for (let qh = 0; qh < nh; qh++) {\n        const kh = kvHeadOf(qh, nh, nkv);\n        const qv = q.subarray(qh * hd, qh * hd + hd);\n        const scores = [];\n        for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) {\n          const kt = state.cacheK[li][t].subarray(kh * hd, kh * hd + hd);\n          let s = 0; for (let i = 0; i < hd; i++) s += qv[i] * kt[i];\n          scores.push(s * scale);\n        }\n        const p = softmax(scores);\n        for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) {\n          const vt = state.cacheV[li][t].subarray(kh * hd, kh * hd + hd);\n          for (let i = 0; i < hd; i++) attnOut[qh * hd + i] += p[t] * vt[i];\n        }\n      }\n      const o = ops.matvec(L.wo, H, nh * hd, attnOut);\n      for (let i = 0; i < H; i++) x[i] += o[i];\n      const h2 = ops.rmsnorm(x, L.ffnNorm, a.eps);\n      const g = ops.matvec(L.wGate, a.ffn, H, h2), u = ops.matvec(L.wUp, a.ffn, H, h2);\n      const act = new Float32Array(a.ffn);\n      for (let i = 0; i < a.ffn; i++) act[i] = silu(g[i]) * u[i];\n      const d = ops.matvec(L.wDown, H, a.ffn, act);\n      for (let i = 0; i < H; i++) x[i] += d[i];\n    }\n    const n = ops.rmsnorm(x, w.finalNorm, a.eps);\n    const head = a.tiedEmbeddings ? w.embed : w.lmHead;\n    if (!head) throw new Error('llm_skeleton：沒有 lm_head（tiedEmbeddings 為假時必填）');\n    const logits = ops.matvec(head, a.vocab, H, n);\n    state.pos = pos + 1;\n    return logits;\n  }\n\n  // 整段 prefix 依序 step，回傳最後一個位置的 logits 與 argmax（貪婪解碼用）\n  function run(arch, weights, tokens, opts) {\n    const st = createState(arch, weights, opts);\n    let logits = null;\n    for (const t of tokens) logits = step(st, t);\n    let best = 0; for (let i = 1; i < logits.length; i++) if (logits[i] > logits[best]) best = i;\n    return { logits: logits, argmax: best, state: st };\n  }\n\n  return { rmsnorm: rmsnorm, matvec: matvec, silu: silu, softmax: softmax, rope: rope, invFreq: invFreq, kvHeadOf: kvHeadOf,\n    SLOTS: SLOTS, registerOverride: registerOverride, clearOverrides: clearOverrides, resolveOps: resolveOps,\n    createState: createState, step: step, stepVec: stepVec, run: run };\n}));\n\n};\nMODS[\"llm_skeleton_gpu\"] = function (module, exports, require) {\n/* llm_skeleton_gpu.js — 通用解碼骨架的 GPU 版（O12b）。結構與 llm_skeleton.js 的 step 相同，只有投影（matvec，y = W·x）改成非同步、\n * 由呼叫端注入（真桌面版用既有的 gemv 核心；node 測試用 CPU 替身）。RMSNorm、RoPE、注意力留在 CPU（逐元素、很小），與參考實作共用同一份程式。\n * 驗證：node 測試以 CPU 替身的 matvec 對拍 llm_skeleton.run，必須逐位相同；真 GPU 的對拍在桌面版評估做。\n * UMD：node 用 module.exports；瀏覽器掛在 self.FaLlmSkeletonGpu。\n */\n(function (root, factory) {\n  if (typeof module === 'object' && module.exports) { module.exports = factory(require('./llm_skeleton.js')); }\n  else { root.FaLlmSkeletonGpu = factory(root.FaLlmSkeleton); }\n}(typeof self !== 'undefined' ? self : this, function (S) {\n  'use strict';\n\n  // mv(W, rows, cols, x) → Promise<Float32Array>（y = W·x，W 為 [rows][cols] row-major）\n  async function stepGpu(state, token, mv) {\n    const a = state.arch, w = state.w, hd = state.hd, H = a.hidden, nh = a.heads, nkv = a.kvHeads;\n    // GPU 版還沒有偏置的路徑；有偏置就直接丟錯，不能悄悄少加偏置算出錯的結果\n    if (a.bias) throw new Error('llm_skeleton_gpu：偏置（bias）尚未在 GPU 版實作');\n    if (!(token >= 0 && token < a.vocab) || token !== Math.floor(token)) throw new Error('llm_skeleton_gpu：詞元超出詞表（' + token + '）');\n    const pos = state.pos;\n    let x = Float32Array.from(w.embed.subarray(token * H, token * H + H));\n    for (let li = 0; li < a.layers; li++) {\n      const L = w.layers[li];\n      const h = S.rmsnorm(x, L.attnNorm, a.eps);\n      let q = await mv(L.wq, nh * hd, H, h);\n      let k = await mv(L.wk, nkv * hd, H, h);\n      const v = await mv(L.wv, nkv * hd, H, h);\n      if (a.qkNorm) {\n        const perHead = (vec, n, wn) => { const o = new Float32Array(vec.length); for (let hh = 0; hh < n; hh++) o.set(S.rmsnorm(vec.subarray(hh * hd, hh * hd + hd), wn, a.eps), hh * hd); return o; };\n        q = perHead(q, nh, L.qNorm); k = perHead(k, nkv, L.kNorm);\n      }\n      q = S.rope(q, nh, hd, pos, a.rope.base, a.rope.scaling);\n      k = S.rope(k, nkv, hd, pos, a.rope.base, a.rope.scaling);\n      state.cacheK[li].push(k); state.cacheV[li].push(v);\n      const T = state.cacheK[li].length;\n      const attnOut = new Float32Array(nh * hd);\n      const scale = 1 / Math.sqrt(hd);\n      for (let qh = 0; qh < nh; qh++) {\n        const kh = S.kvHeadOf(qh, nh, nkv);\n        const qv = q.subarray(qh * hd, qh * hd + hd);\n        const scores = [];\n        for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) {\n          const kt = state.cacheK[li][t].subarray(kh * hd, kh * hd + hd);\n          let s = 0; for (let i = 0; i < hd; i++) s += qv[i] * kt[i];\n          scores.push(s * scale);\n        }\n        const p = S.softmax(scores);\n        for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) {\n          const vt = state.cacheV[li][t].subarray(kh * hd, kh * hd + hd);\n          for (let i = 0; i < hd; i++) attnOut[qh * hd + i] += p[t] * vt[i];\n        }\n      }\n      const o = await mv(L.wo, H, nh * hd, attnOut);\n      for (let i = 0; i < H; i++) x[i] += o[i];\n      const h2 = S.rmsnorm(x, L.ffnNorm, a.eps);\n      const g = await mv(L.wGate, a.ffn, H, h2), u = await mv(L.wUp, a.ffn, H, h2);\n      const act = new Float32Array(a.ffn);\n      for (let i = 0; i < a.ffn; i++) act[i] = S.silu(g[i]) * u[i];\n      const d = await mv(L.wDown, H, a.ffn, act);\n      for (let i = 0; i < H; i++) x[i] += d[i];\n    }\n    const n = S.rmsnorm(x, w.finalNorm, a.eps);\n    const head = a.tiedEmbeddings ? w.embed : w.lmHead;\n    if (!head) throw new Error('llm_skeleton_gpu：沒有 lm_head');\n    const logits = await mv(head, a.vocab, H, n);\n    state.pos = pos + 1;\n    return logits;\n  }\n\n  // 整段 prefix；狀態與權重檢查沿用 llm_skeleton（createState 會驗證描述表與權重長度）。useOverrides:false：GPU 版不吃 CPU 的覆寫槽。\n  async function runGpu(arch, weights, tokens, mv) {\n    if (arch.bias) throw new Error('llm_skeleton_gpu：偏置（bias）尚未在 GPU 版實作');\n    const st = S.createState(arch, weights, { useOverrides: false });\n    let logits = null;\n    for (const t of tokens) logits = await stepGpu(st, t, mv);\n    let best = 0; for (let i = 1; i < logits.length; i++) if (logits[i] > logits[best]) best = i;\n    return { logits: logits, argmax: best, state: st };\n  }\n\n  // ---------- 完整 GPU 解碼（O12b）：整個解碼步驟在 GPU 上，一個 command encoder、一次 submit ----------\n  // 運算順序與 llm_skeleton.stepVec 相同：RMSNorm → 投影（f32 矩陣乘，權重 [out][in] row-major）→ [qk-norm] → RoPE（llama3 縮放的表由 S.invFreq 算）\n  // → KV 寫入 → 注意力（GQA）→ 輸出投影 → 殘差 → RMSNorm → gate／up → SiLU×up → down → 殘差 → 最後 RMSNorm → lm_head → logits。\n  // 參考實作的權重是 f32，沒有動態量化，所以這裡也不量化（O12b 清單中的「動態量化」只適用 q8 權重，見 qwen_gpu）。\n  // 精度：GPU 的加總是 f32、順序與 CPU（f64 累加）不同，所以對拍是「界內」而非逐位相同。\n  const SK_UNI = 'struct P { a: u32, b: u32, c: u32, d: u32, e: f32, f: u32, g: u32, h: u32 }\\n';\n  const SK_WGSL = {};\n  // y[outOff + r] = Σ_c W[r·cols + c]·x[c]；一個執行緒一列\n  SK_WGSL.mv = SK_UNI + `\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> W: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let r = gid.x;\n  if (r >= p.a) { return; }\n  var s: f32 = 0.0;\n  let o = r * p.b;\n  for (var c: u32 = 0u; c < p.b; c = c + 1u) { s = s + W[o + c] * x[c]; }\n  y[p.c + r] = s;\n}`;\n  // 每列 RMSNorm：a＝列數，b＝維度，e＝eps；一個執行緒一列（也用於 qk-norm 的每頭正規化）\n  SK_WGSL.rms = SK_UNI + `\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> g: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let r = gid.x;\n  if (r >= p.a) { return; }\n  let base = r * p.b;\n  var ss: f32 = 0.0;\n  for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < p.b; i = i + 1u) { let v = x[base + i]; ss = ss + v * v; }\n  let inv = 1.0 / sqrt(ss / f32(p.b) + p.e);\n  for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < p.b; i = i + 1u) { y[base + i] = x[base + i] * inv * g[i]; }\n}`;\n  // RoPE（half 風格）：a＝頭數，b＝hd，c＝位置（取 cos／sin 表的列），d＝輸出偏移（元素數）。一個執行緒一組 (頭, i)。\n  SK_WGSL.rope = SK_UNI + `\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> vin: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> cs: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read> sn: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<storage, read_write> out: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(4) var<uniform> p: P;\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let half = p.b / 2u;\n  let idx = gid.x;\n  if (idx >= p.a * half) { return; }\n  let h = idx / half; let i = idx % half;\n  let base = h * p.b;\n  let a = vin[base + i]; let b = vin[base + i + half];\n  let c = cs[p.c * half + i]; let s = sn[p.c * half + i];\n  out[p.d + base + i] = a * c - b * s;\n  out[p.d + base + i + half] = b * c + a * s;\n}`;\n  // 注意力（GQA，因果）：a＝Q 頭數，b＝KV 頭數，c＝hd，d＝有效長度 T（=位置+1），e＝scale，f＝maxT。一個執行緒一個 Q 頭。\n  SK_WGSL.attn = SK_UNI + `\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> q: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> kc: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read> vc: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<storage, read_write> sc: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(4) var<storage, read_write> out: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(5) var<uniform> p: P;\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let qh = gid.x;\n  if (qh >= p.a) { return; }\n  let hd = p.c; let Nk = p.b * hd; let kvh = qh / (p.a / p.b);\n  let T = p.d; let maxT = p.f;\n  let qo = qh * hd; let ko = kvh * hd; let sb = qh * maxT;\n  var mx: f32 = -3.0e38;\n  for (var t: u32 = 0u; t < T; t = t + 1u) {\n    var dot: f32 = 0.0;\n    for (var d: u32 = 0u; d < hd; d = d + 1u) { dot = dot + q[qo + d] * kc[t * Nk + ko + d]; }\n    let w = dot * p.e; sc[sb + t] = w; mx = max(mx, w);\n  }\n  var sum: f32 = 0.0;\n  for (var t: u32 = 0u; t < T; t = t + 1u) { let e = exp(sc[sb + t] - mx); sc[sb + t] = e; sum = sum + e; }\n  for (var d: u32 = 0u; d < hd; d = d + 1u) { out[qo + d] = 0.0; }\n  for (var t: u32 = 0u; t < T; t = t + 1u) {\n    let pj = sc[sb + t] / sum;\n    for (var d: u32 = 0u; d < hd; d = d + 1u) { out[qo + d] = out[qo + d] + pj * vc[t * Nk + ko + d]; }\n  }\n}`;\n  // x[i] += y[i]（就地；每個執行緒只碰自己的 i）：a＝n\n  SK_WGSL.addk = SK_UNI + `\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read_write> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> p: P;\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x;\n  if (i >= p.a) { return; }\n  x[i] = x[i] + y[i];\n}`;\n  // act[i] = silu(g[i])·u[i]：a＝n\n  SK_WGSL.silu = SK_UNI + `\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> g: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> u: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> act: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x;\n  if (i >= p.a) { return; }\n  let v = g[i];\n  act[i] = (v / (1.0 + exp(-v))) * u[i];\n}`;\n\n  // dev：GPUDevice；arch／weights：與 llm_skeleton 相同；opts.maxT（預設 64）。回傳 { step(token) → Promise<Float32Array logits>, reset(), pos(), destroy() }。\n  function createGpuDecoder(dev, arch, weights, opts) {\n    const o = opts || {};\n    if (arch.bias) throw new Error('llm_skeleton_gpu：偏置（bias）尚未在 GPU 版實作');\n    const st0 = S.createState(arch, weights, { useOverrides: false });   // 驗證描述表與權重長度（與 CPU 參考共用）\n    const hd = st0.hd, H = arch.hidden, nh = arch.heads, nkv = arch.kvHeads, F = arch.ffn, V = arch.vocab, L = arch.layers;\n    const half = hd / 2, Nq = nh * hd, Nk = nkv * hd, maxT = o.maxT || 64, eps = arch.eps;\n    const ST = 0x80 | 0x08 | 0x04, UNI = 0x40 | 0x08;   // STORAGE｜COPY_DST｜COPY_SRC；UNIFORM｜COPY_DST\n    const bufs = [];\n    const mkBuf = (n, usage) => { const b = dev.createBuffer({ size: Math.max(16, (n + 3) & ~3), usage: usage }); bufs.push(b); return b; };\n    const f32buf = (arr) => { const b = mkBuf(arr.length * 4, ST); dev.queue.writeBuffer(b, 0, arr); return b; };\n    const pipes = {};\n    for (const k of Object.keys(SK_WGSL)) {\n      const mod = dev.createShaderModule({ code: SK_WGSL[k] });\n      pipes[k] = dev.createComputePipeline({ layout: 'auto', compute: { module: mod, entryPoint: 'main' } });\n    }\n    const ops = [];   // { pipe, bg, uni, groups, fill }：fill(dv, pos) 寫 pos 相關的 uniform\n    const op = (kind, list, uniFields, groups, fill) => {\n      const uni = mkBuf(32, UNI);\n      const dv = new DataView(new ArrayBuffer(32));\n      const put = (f) => { f(dv); dev.queue.writeBuffer(uni, 0, new Uint8Array(dv.buffer)); };\n      if (!fill) put(() => uniFields(dv));\n      const pipe = pipes[kind];\n      const bg = dev.createBindGroup({ layout: pipe.getBindGroupLayout(0), entries: list.concat([uni]).map((b, i) => ({ binding: i, resource: { buffer: b } })) });\n      ops.push({ pipe: pipe, bg: bg, uni: uni, groups: groups, fill: fill ? (pos) => { fill(dv, pos); dev.queue.writeBuffer(uni, 0, new Uint8Array(dv.buffer)); } : null });\n    };\n    const u = (a, b, c, d, e, f) => (dv) => { dv.setUint32(0, a, true); dv.setUint32(4, b, true); dv.setUint32(8, c, true); dv.setUint32(12, d, true); dv.setFloat32(16, e || 0, true); dv.setUint32(20, f || 0, true); };\n    const g1 = (n) => [Math.ceil(n / 64), 1, 1];\n    // 權重與常數緩衝區\n    const cosT = new Float32Array(maxT * half), sinT = new Float32Array(maxT * half);\n    const fr = S.invFreq(hd, arch.rope.base, arch.rope.scaling);\n    for (let p = 0; p < maxT; p++) for (let i = 0; i < half; i++) { const th = p * fr[i]; cosT[p * half + i] = Math.cos(th); sinT[p * half + i] = Math.sin(th); }\n    const cosB = f32buf(cosT), sinB = f32buf(sinT);\n    const xA = mkBuf(H * 4, ST), h1 = mkBuf(H * 4, ST), qb = mkBuf(Nq * 4, ST), kb = mkBuf(Nk * 4, ST), qn = mkBuf(Nq * 4, ST), kn = mkBuf(Nk * 4, ST);\n    const qr = mkBuf(Nq * 4, ST), at = mkBuf(Nq * 4, ST), ob = mkBuf(H * 4, ST), gB = mkBuf(F * 4, ST), uB = mkBuf(F * 4, ST), aB = mkBuf(F * 4, ST), dB = mkBuf(H * 4, ST);\n    const scB = mkBuf(nh * maxT * 4, ST), logits = mkBuf(V * 4, ST);\n    const rb = dev.createBuffer({ size: V * 4, usage: 0x0001 | 0x08 });   // MAP_READ｜COPY_DST\n    const kc = [], vc = [];\n    const lw = [];\n    for (let li = 0; li < L; li++) {\n      const Lw = weights.layers[li];\n      kc.push(mkBuf(maxT * Nk * 4, ST)); vc.push(mkBuf(maxT * Nk * 4, ST));\n      lw.push({ attnNorm: f32buf(Lw.attnNorm), wq: f32buf(Lw.wq), wk: f32buf(Lw.wk), wv: f32buf(Lw.wv), wo: f32buf(Lw.wo),\n        ffnNorm: f32buf(Lw.ffnNorm), wGate: f32buf(Lw.wGate), wUp: f32buf(Lw.wUp), wDown: f32buf(Lw.wDown),\n        qNorm: arch.qkNorm ? f32buf(Lw.qNorm) : null, kNorm: arch.qkNorm ? f32buf(Lw.kNorm) : null });\n    }\n    const finalB = f32buf(weights.finalNorm), headB = f32buf(arch.tiedEmbeddings ? weights.embed : weights.lmHead);\n    // 建立每步的運算序列（一次建好；pos 相關的 uniform 由 fill 每步寫入）\n    for (let li = 0; li < L; li++) {\n      const W = lw[li];\n      op('rms', [xA, W.attnNorm, h1], u(H, H, 0, 0, eps), [Math.ceil(1 / 64), 1, 1]);   // 一列\n      op('mv', [W.wq, h1, qb], u(Nq, H, 0, 0), g1(Nq));\n      op('mv', [W.wk, h1, kb], u(Nk, H, 0, 0), g1(Nk));\n      op('mv', [W.wv, h1, vc[li]], null, g1(Nk), (dv, pos) => { dv.setUint32(0, Nk, true); dv.setUint32(4, H, true); dv.setUint32(8, pos * Nk, true); });\n      let qSrc = qb, kSrc = kb;\n      if (arch.qkNorm) {\n        op('rms', [qb, W.qNorm, qn], u(nh, hd, 0, 0, eps), g1(nh)); qSrc = qn;\n        op('rms', [kb, W.kNorm, kn], u(nkv, hd, 0, 0, eps), g1(nkv)); kSrc = kn;\n      }\n      op('rope', [qSrc, cosB, sinB, qr], null, g1(nh * half), (dv, pos) => { dv.setUint32(0, nh, true); dv.setUint32(4, hd, true); dv.setUint32(8, pos, true); dv.setUint32(12, 0, true); });\n      op('rope', [kSrc, cosB, sinB, kc[li]], null, g1(nkv * half), (dv, pos) => { dv.setUint32(0, nkv, true); dv.setUint32(4, hd, true); dv.setUint32(8, pos, true); dv.setUint32(12, pos * Nk, true); });\n      op('attn', [qr, kc[li], vc[li], scB, at], null, g1(nh), (dv, pos) => { dv.setUint32(0, nh, true); dv.setUint32(4, nkv, true); dv.setUint32(8, hd, true); dv.setUint32(12, pos + 1, true); dv.setFloat32(16, 1 / Math.sqrt(hd), true); dv.setUint32(20, maxT, true); });\n      op('mv', [W.wo, at, ob], u(H, Nq, 0, 0), g1(H));\n      op('addk', [xA, ob], u(H, 0, 0, 0), g1(H));\n      op('rms', [xA, W.ffnNorm, h1], u(H, H, 0, 0, eps), [1, 1, 1]);\n      op('mv', [W.wGate, h1, gB], u(F, H, 0, 0), g1(F));\n      op('mv', [W.wUp, h1, uB], u(F, H, 0, 0), g1(F));\n      op('silu', [gB, uB, aB], u(F, 0, 0, 0), g1(F));\n      op('mv', [W.wDown, aB, dB], u(H, F, 0, 0), g1(H));\n      op('addk', [xA, dB], u(H, 0, 0, 0), g1(H));\n    }\n    op('rms', [xA, finalB, h1], u(H, H, 0, 0, eps), [1, 1, 1]);\n    op('mv', [headB, h1, logits], u(V, H, 0, 0), g1(V));\n    let pos = 0, dead = null, chain = Promise.resolve();\n    const run = async (token) => {\n      if (dead) throw new Error('llm_skeleton_gpu：解碼器已失效：' + dead);\n      if (!(token >= 0 && token < V) || token !== Math.floor(token)) throw new Error('llm_skeleton_gpu：詞元超出詞表（' + token + '）');\n      if (pos >= maxT) throw new Error('llm_skeleton_gpu：序列超過 maxT（' + maxT + '）');\n      try {\n        dev.queue.writeBuffer(xA, 0, weights.embed.subarray(token * H, token * H + H));\n        for (const d of ops) if (d.fill) d.fill(pos);\n        const enc = dev.createCommandEncoder();\n        for (const d of ops) { const pass = enc.beginComputePass(); pass.setPipeline(d.pipe); pass.setBindGroup(0, d.bg); pass.dispatchWorkgroups(d.groups[0], d.groups[1], d.groups[2]); pass.end(); }\n        enc.copyBufferToBuffer(logits, 0, rb, 0, V * 4);\n        dev.queue.submit([enc.finish()]);\n        await rb.mapAsync(1);\n        const out = new Float32Array(rb.getMappedRange().slice(0, V * 4));\n        rb.unmap();\n        pos++;\n        return out;\n      } catch (e) { dead = String((e && e.message) || e); throw e; }\n    };\n    return {\n      // 串行化：每次 step 等上一次完成（mapAsync 不能重疊）\n      step(token) { const p = chain.then(() => run(token)); chain = p.catch(() => {}); return p; },\n      reset() { pos = 0; },\n      pos() { return pos; },\n      get dead() { return dead; },\n      destroy() { for (const b of bufs) { try { b.destroy(); } catch (e) { /* 已釋放 */ } } },\n    };\n  }\n\n  return { stepGpu: stepGpu, runGpu: runGpu, createGpuDecoder: createGpuDecoder, SK_WGSL: SK_WGSL };\n}));\n\n};\nMODS[\"nr_gen_params\"] = function (module, exports, require) {\n// 原生執行器的生成參數語意（純函式）：與 transformers.js 的 logits 處理器做法相同，參數名稱與桌面版 FaVlm.textGenParams 一致。\n// 不自訂預設：產品端（renderer/src/vlm/vlm_core.js 的 textGenParams）算出 gen 物件，原生端照字面套用。\n// 支援的鍵：do_sample、temperature、top_p、repetition_penalty、no_repeat_ngram_size。其他鍵直接報錯（不靜默忽略）。\n// 處理順序（與 transformers.js 相同）：重複懲罰 → 不重複 n-gram → 溫度 → top-p → 取樣（do_sample 為 false 時取 argmax）。\n'use strict';\n\nconst SUPPORTED = ['do_sample', 'temperature', 'top_p', 'repetition_penalty', 'no_repeat_ngram_size'];\n\nfunction validateGen(gen) {\n    if (!gen || typeof gen !== 'object' || Array.isArray(gen)) throw new Error('gen 必須是物件（產品端的 textGenParams 結果）');\n    for (const k of Object.keys(gen)) if (SUPPORTED.indexOf(k) < 0) throw new Error('原生端不支援的生成參數：' + k);\n    if (gen.repetition_penalty != null && !(Number(gen.repetition_penalty) > 0)) throw new Error('repetition_penalty 必須大於 0');\n    if (gen.temperature != null && !(Number(gen.temperature) > 0)) throw new Error('temperature 必須大於 0');\n    if (gen.top_p != null && !(Number(gen.top_p) > 0 && Number(gen.top_p) <= 1)) throw new Error('top_p 必須在 (0, 1]');\n    if (gen.no_repeat_ngram_size != null && !(Number.isInteger(gen.no_repeat_ngram_size) && gen.no_repeat_ngram_size >= 0)) throw new Error('no_repeat_ngram_size 必須是非負整數');\n    return gen;\n}\n\n// 重複懲罰（RepetitionPenaltyLogitsProcessor）：對 input 加已生成的全部 token 的 logits，正數除以 penalty、負數乘以 penalty。\nfunction applyRepetitionPenalty(logits, seenIds, penalty) {\n    if (penalty == null || penalty === 1) return;\n    const seen = new Set(seenIds);\n    for (const t of seen) {\n        if (t < 0 || t >= logits.length) continue;\n        const v = logits[t];\n        logits[t] = v > 0 ? v / penalty : v * penalty;\n    }\n}\n\n// 不重複 n-gram（NoRepeatNGramLogitsProcessor）：若某個 n-1 前綴已在序列中出現過，就禁止接續出現過的下一個 token。\nfunction applyNoRepeatNGram(logits, seqIds, n) {\n    if (!n || n <= 1 || seqIds.length < n) return;\n    const banned = new Map(); // 前綴字串 → 禁止的下一個 token 集合\n    for (let i = 0; i + n <= seqIds.length; i++) {\n        const prefix = seqIds.slice(i, i + n - 1).join(',');\n        const next = seqIds[i + n - 1];\n        if (!banned.has(prefix)) banned.set(prefix, new Set());\n        banned.get(prefix).add(next);\n    }\n    const tail = seqIds.slice(seqIds.length - (n - 1)).join(',');\n    const bans = banned.get(tail);\n    if (bans) for (const t of bans) logits[t] = -Infinity;\n}\n\n// 溫度（TemperatureLogitsWarper）\nfunction applyTemperature(logits, temperature) {\n    if (temperature == null || temperature === 1) return;\n    for (let i = 0; i < logits.length; i++) logits[i] = logits[i] / temperature;\n}\n\n// top-p（TopPLogitsWarper）：依 transformers.js 的做法，升序排序後累積機率 ≤ (1 − top_p) 的 token 移除；至少保留 1 個。\nfunction applyTopP(logits, topP) {\n    if (topP == null || topP >= 1) return;\n    const idx = Array.from(logits.keys()).sort((a, b) => logits[a] - logits[b]); // 升序\n    let max = -Infinity; for (let i = 0; i < logits.length; i++) if (logits[i] > max) max = logits[i];\n    let sum = 0; const e = new Float64Array(logits.length);\n    for (let i = 0; i < logits.length; i++) { e[i] = Math.exp(logits[i] - max); sum += e[i]; }\n    let cum = 0;\n    for (let j = 0; j < idx.length; j++) {\n        const t = idx[j];\n        cum += e[t] / sum;\n        if (cum <= 1 - topP && j < idx.length - 1) logits[t] = -Infinity; else break;\n    }\n}\n\n// 可重現的亂數（mulberry32）：同一個 seed 得到同一串數字\nfunction makeRng(seed) {\n    let s = (seed >>> 0) || 1;\n    return function () {\n        s = (s + 0x6D2B79F5) >>> 0;\n        let t = s;\n        t = Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 15), t | 1);\n        t ^= t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), t | 61);\n        return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296;\n    };\n}\n\n// 依 gen 從 logits 選出下一個 token。logits 會被就地修改。\n// promptIds：輸入的 token；genIds：已生成的 token；rng：do_sample 為 true 時使用（必須傳入，保證可重現）。\nfunction pickToken(logits, promptIds, genIds, gen, rng) {\n    validateGen(gen);\n    const all = promptIds.concat(genIds);\n    applyRepetitionPenalty(logits, all, gen.repetition_penalty);\n    applyNoRepeatNGram(logits, all, gen.no_repeat_ngram_size);\n    if (gen.do_sample === false) {\n        let best = 0, bv = -Infinity;\n        for (let i = 0; i < logits.length; i++) if (logits[i] > bv) { bv = logits[i]; best = i; }\n        return best;\n    }\n    if (typeof rng !== 'function') throw new Error('取樣需要可重現的亂數函式（rng），不能用 Math.random');\n    applyTemperature(logits, gen.temperature);\n    applyTopP(logits, gen.top_p);\n    let max = -Infinity; for (let i = 0; i < logits.length; i++) if (logits[i] > max) max = logits[i];\n    let sum = 0; const p = new Float64Array(logits.length);\n    for (let i = 0; i < logits.length; i++) { p[i] = logits[i] === -Infinity ? 0 : Math.exp(logits[i] - max); sum += p[i]; }\n    const r = rng() * sum;\n    let acc = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < p.length; i++) { acc += p[i]; if (r < acc) return i; }\n    return p.length - 1;\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { SUPPORTED, validateGen, applyRepetitionPenalty, applyNoRepeatNGram, applyTemperature, applyTopP, makeRng, pickToken };\n\n};\nMODS[\"nr_template\"] = function (module, exports, require) {\n// 原生執行器的提示樣板模組（純函式，子程序與測試都可用，不依賴 transformers.js）。\n// 每個模型一個樣板，以名稱登記在 TEMPLATES；run 訊息的 template 欄位指定名稱（預設 'qwen3-chatml'）。\n// 'qwen3-chatml'：Qwen3 的 ChatML 格式。\n//   訊息：<|im_start|>{role}\\n{content}<|im_end|>\\n\n//   生成提示：<|im_start|>assistant\\n；enable_thinking 為 false 時補上空的思考區塊 <think>\\n\\n</think>\\n\\n（Qwen3 官方做法）。\n//   歷史的 assistant 訊息會去掉 <think>...</think>（官方樣板也只保留最後一輪的思考）。\n//   prefill：接在生成提示之後的原始文字（不加結束標記）。\n'use strict';\n\nconst THINK_BLOCK_RE = /<think>[\\s\\S]*?<\\/think>\\s*/g;\n\nfunction qwen3ChatML(messages, opts) {\n    opts = opts || {};\n    if (!Array.isArray(messages)) throw new Error('messages 必須是陣列');\n    let s = '';\n    for (let i = 0; i < messages.length; i++) {\n        const m = messages[i];\n        if (!m || typeof m.role !== 'string') throw new Error('第 ' + i + ' 則訊息缺少 role');\n        let content = m.content == null ? '' : String(m.content);\n        if (m.role === 'assistant') content = content.replace(THINK_BLOCK_RE, '');\n        if (!['system', 'user', 'assistant', 'tool'].includes(m.role)) throw new Error('不支援的 role：' + m.role);\n        s += '<|im_start|>' + m.role + '\\n' + content + '<|im_end|>\\n';\n    }\n    s += '<|im_start|>assistant\\n';\n    if (opts.enable_thinking === false) s += '<think>\\n\\n</think>\\n\\n';\n    if (opts.prefill) s += String(opts.prefill);\n    return s;\n}\n\nconst TEMPLATES = {\n    'qwen3-chatml': qwen3ChatML,\n};\n\n// 依名稱套用樣板；未知名稱直接丟錯（不靜默退回預設）\nfunction applyTemplate(name, messages, opts) {\n    const fn = TEMPLATES[name || 'qwen3-chatml'];\n    if (!fn) throw new Error('未知的提示樣板：' + name + '（可用：' + Object.keys(TEMPLATES).join('、') + '）');\n    return fn(messages, opts || {});\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { TEMPLATES, applyTemplate, qwen3ChatML };\n\n};\nMODS[\"llm_web_core\"] = function (module, exports, require) {\n/* llm_web_core.js — 網頁版 LLM 推論核心（純函式，UMD）。DESIGN.lora-training.md §25；lm_head 的 GPU 接線見 DESIGN.webgpu-cuda.md §7.3。\n *\n * 不依賴 Node：\n *   - 分詞器：BPE（tokenizer.json，與 nr-tokenizer.js 同一套規則，改用 TextEncoder／TextDecoder）\n *   - 推論：onnxruntime-web 由呼叫端注入（ort 物件），session 用 executionProviders:['wasm']\n *   - 貪婪解碼（temperature 0）＋ KV cache：past_key_values.{l}.{key|value}，28 層、8 KV 頭、head_dim 128（Qwen3-0.6B）\n *   - 可選的隱藏狀態頭（opts.head）：變體圖輸出 final_norm 的隱藏狀態，lm_head 由呼叫端的 run() 算（GPU）。\n *     任何失敗（沒有 GPU、逾時、長度不對、開頭幾步的對拍不合）都退回原本的 session，生成不中斷；原因與層別寫進診斷。\n *\n * 匯出：\n *   createTokenizer(tokenizerJson) → { encode(text), decode(ids), specials }\n *   greedyGenerate(ort, session, promptIds, opts) → { tokens, stoppedBy, head:{診斷} }\n *   loadSession(ort, bytes, opts) → Promise<InferenceSession>\n */\n(function (root, factory) {\n    if (typeof module === 'object' && module.exports) module.exports = factory();\n    else root.FaLlmWeb = factory();\n})(typeof self !== 'undefined' ? self : this, function () {\n    'use strict';\n\n    // ---- byte-level BPE（GPT-2 系）----\n    function bytesToUnicode() {\n        const bs = []; for (let i = 33; i <= 126; i++) bs.push(i); for (let i = 161; i <= 172; i++) bs.push(i); for (let i = 174; i <= 255; i++) bs.push(i);\n        const cs = bs.slice(); let n = 0;\n        for (let b = 0; b < 256; b++) if (bs.indexOf(b) < 0) { bs.push(b); cs.push(256 + n); n++; }\n        const b2u = new Array(256), u2b = new Map();\n        bs.forEach((b, i) => { const c = String.fromCharCode(cs[i]); b2u[b] = c; u2b.set(c, b); });\n        return { b2u, u2b };\n    }\n    const { b2u, u2b } = bytesToUnicode();\n    const enc8 = new TextEncoder();\n    const dec8 = new TextDecoder('utf-8');\n    function reEsc(s) { return s.replace(/[.*+?^${}()|[\\]\\\\]/g, '\\\\$&'); }\n\n    function createTokenizer(tokj) {\n        if (!tokj || !tokj.model || tokj.model.type !== 'BPE') throw new Error('只支援 BPE 的 tokenizer.json');\n        const vocab = tokj.model.vocab;\n        const ranks = new Map();\n        tokj.model.merges.forEach((m, i) => { const pair = Array.isArray(m) ? m : m.split(' '); ranks.set(pair[0] + '\\u0001' + pair[1], i); });\n        const added = (tokj.added_tokens || []).map((t) => ({ content: t.content, id: t.id }));\n        const addedMap = new Map(added.map((t) => [t.content, t.id]));\n        const addedRe = added.length ? new RegExp('(' + added.map((t) => reEsc(t.content)).sort((a, b) => b.length - a.length).join('|') + ')') : null;\n        const pre = tokj.pre_tokenizer && tokj.pre_tokenizer.pretokenizers ? tokj.pre_tokenizer.pretokenizers.find((p) => p.type === 'Split') : null;\n        if (!pre || !pre.pattern || !pre.pattern.Regex) throw new Error('tokenizer.json 缺少 Split 預分詞規則');\n        // 瀏覽器的 RegExp 不一定支援行內旗標 (?i:...)：展開成大小寫都接受（只處理不含巢狀括號的群組）\n        const rx = String(pre.pattern.Regex).replace(/\\(\\?i:([^()]*)\\)/g, (_, body) => '(?:' + body.replace(/[A-Za-z]/g, (ch) => '[' + ch.toLowerCase() + ch.toUpperCase() + ']') + ')');\n        const preRe = new RegExp(rx, 'gu');\n        const normalizeNFC = !!(tokj.normalizer && tokj.normalizer.type === 'NFC');\n        const idToTok = new Map(Object.entries(vocab).map(([k, v]) => [v, k]));\n        for (const t of added) idToTok.set(t.id, t.content);\n\n        function bpe(word) {\n            let parts = Array.from(word);\n            while (parts.length > 1) {\n                let best = null, bi = -1;\n                for (let i = 0; i < parts.length - 1; i++) {\n                    const r = ranks.get(parts[i] + '\\u0001' + parts[i + 1]);\n                    if (r !== undefined && (best === null || r < best)) { best = r; bi = i; }\n                }\n                if (bi < 0) break;\n                parts = parts.slice(0, bi).concat([parts[bi] + parts[bi + 1]], parts.slice(bi + 2));\n            }\n            return parts;\n        }\n        function encodeChunk(text) {\n            const ids = []; preRe.lastIndex = 0; let m;\n            while ((m = preRe.exec(text))) {\n                const piece = Array.from(enc8.encode(m[0]), (b) => b2u[b]).join('');\n                for (const tok of bpe(piece)) {\n                    const id = vocab[tok];\n                    if (id === undefined) throw new Error('vocab 找不到 token：' + JSON.stringify(tok));\n                    ids.push(id);\n                }\n            }\n            return ids;\n        }\n        function encode(text) {\n            const out = [];\n            const parts = addedRe ? String(text).split(addedRe) : [String(text)];\n            for (const part of parts) {\n                if (!part) continue;\n                if (addedMap.has(part)) { out.push(addedMap.get(part)); continue; }\n                out.push(...encodeChunk(normalizeNFC ? part.normalize('NFC') : part));\n            }\n            return out;\n        }\n        function decode(ids) {\n            const specials = new Set(added.map((t) => t.content));\n            let out = '', buf = [];\n            const flush = () => { if (buf.length) { out += dec8.decode(Uint8Array.from(buf)); buf = []; } };\n            for (const tok of ids.map((i) => (idToTok.has(i) ? idToTok.get(i) : ''))) {\n                if (specials.has(tok)) { flush(); out += tok; continue; }\n                for (const c of Array.from(tok)) buf.push(u2b.has(c) ? u2b.get(c) : 0);\n            }\n            flush();\n            return out;\n        }\n        return { encode, decode, vocabSize: idToTok.size, specials: added.map((t) => t.content) };\n    }\n\n    // ---- ONNX session（注入的 ort＝onnxruntime-web）----\n    async function loadSession(ort, bytes, opts) {\n        if (!ort || !ort.InferenceSession) throw new Error('沒有 onnxruntime-web（ort.InferenceSession 不存在）');\n        const o = opts || {};\n        // 圖最佳化預設 disabled：q8 的 MatMulInteger 圖在 wasm 下開 all 會變差（實測 6 題 16 token：all 28/96、disabled 54/96；見 DESIGN §25）\n        return ort.InferenceSession.create(bytes, { executionProviders: o.executionProviders || ['wasm'], graphOptimizationLevel: o.graphOptimizationLevel || 'disabled' });\n    }\n\n    function withTimeout(p, ms, what) {\n        if (!(ms > 0)) return p;\n        let tm = null;\n        return Promise.race([p, new Promise((_, rej) => { tm = setTimeout(() => rej(new Error(what + '逾時（' + ms + ' 毫秒）')), ms); })])\n            .finally(() => clearTimeout(tm));\n    }\n    function argmaxOf(row) { let best = 0, bv = -Infinity; for (let v = 0; v < row.length; v++) { const x = row[v]; if (x > bv) { bv = x; best = v; } } return best; }\n    // 兩組 logits 的相對差（以參考組的最大絕對值為尺度）與 argmax 是否相同\n    function compareRows(got, ref) {\n        let maxAbs = 0, refMax = 0;\n        for (let v = 0; v < ref.length; v++) { const d = Math.abs(got[v] - ref[v]); if (d > maxAbs) maxAbs = d; const a = Math.abs(ref[v]); if (a > refMax) refMax = a; }\n        return { maxRel: refMax > 0 ? maxAbs / refMax : 0, argmaxSame: argmaxOf(got) === argmaxOf(ref) };\n    }\n\n    // ---- 貪婪解碼＋KV cache ----\n    // 形狀由模型決定：層數、KV 頭數、head_dim 從 opts 來（預設 Qwen3-0.6B：28 / 8 / 128）\n    // opts.gpuDecode（可選，Qwen3 q8 整段 GPU 解碼，DESIGN.webgpu-cuda.md §7.13）：{ engine（qwen_gpu 的 createGpuEngine 結果：step(ids)→{token}、reset()）,\n    //   verifyTol 不用（動態量化讓數值有百分之幾的雜訊，只比 argmax）, timeoutMs（每步，預設 20000） }\n    //   開頭：GPU 預填與原圖預填各跑一次，第一個詞元不同就整段退回原路徑；之後每步只跑 GPU。任何一步失敗：用原圖把「已生成但原圖還沒吃進 KV」的詞元補進去，接著照原路徑走。\n    // opts.head（可選）：{ variant（隱藏狀態變體的 session）, hiddenName（變體圖的隱藏狀態輸出名）, run(hidden:Float32Array)→Promise<Float32Array(V)>,\n    //   timeoutMs（預設 8000）, verifySteps（預設 1：開頭幾步同時跑原圖，argmax 與相對誤差對拍）, verifyTol（預設 1e-3） }\n    function greedyGenerate(ort, session, promptIds, opts) {\n        const o = opts || {};\n        const L = o.layers || 28, KV = o.kvHeads || 8, HD = o.headDim || 128;\n        const maxNew = o.maxNew || 16, eos = new Set(o.eosIds || []);\n        const stopCheck = typeof o.isStopRequested === 'function' ? o.isStopRequested : () => false;\n        if (!promptIds || !promptIds.length) throw new Error('prompt 是空的');\n        const H = o.head && o.head.variant && typeof o.head.run === 'function' ? o.head : null;\n        const timeoutMs = H ? (H.timeoutMs === undefined ? 8000 : H.timeoutMs) : 0;\n        const verifySteps = H ? (H.verifySteps === undefined ? 1 : H.verifySteps) : 0;\n        const verifyTol = H ? (H.verifyTol === undefined ? 1e-3 : H.verifyTol) : 0;\n        const diag = { requested: !!H, used: 0, steps: 0, verify: [], fallbackAt: -1, reason: '', headMs: 0, variantMs: 0, origMs: 0 };\n        const GD = o.gpuDecode && o.gpuDecode.engine && typeof o.gpuDecode.engine.step === 'function' ? o.gpuDecode : null;\n        const gdiag = { requested: !!GD, used: 0, verify: null, fallbackAt: -1, reason: '', gpuMs: 0, origMs: 0 };\n        return (async () => {\n            let past = {};\n            for (let l = 0; l < L; l++) for (const k of ['key', 'value']) past[`past_key_values.${l}.${k}`] = new ort.Tensor('float32', new Float32Array(0), [1, KV, 0, HD]);\n            let pastLen = 0, q = promptIds.slice(), out = [], stoppedBy = 'max';\n            let headOn = !!H;\n            let s0 = 0;\n            if (GD) {\n                // ---- GPU 整段解碼階段 ----\n                const gTimeout = GD.timeoutMs === undefined ? 20000 : GD.timeoutMs;\n                let gpuTok = null, ortTok = null, r0 = null, ortLen = 0;\n                try {\n                    const feed0 = Object.assign({}, past);\n                    feed0.input_ids = new ort.Tensor('int64', BigInt64Array.from(q.map(BigInt)), [1, q.length]);\n                    feed0.attention_mask = new ort.Tensor('int64', BigInt64Array.from(new Array(q.length).fill(1n)), [1, q.length]);\n                    feed0.position_ids = new ort.Tensor('int64', BigInt64Array.from(Array.from({ length: q.length }, (_, i) => BigInt(i))), [1, q.length]);\n                    GD.engine.reset();\n                    const t0 = Date.now();\n                    gpuTok = (await withTimeout(Promise.resolve().then(() => GD.engine.step(q)), gTimeout, 'GPU 解碼預填 ')).token;\n                    gdiag.gpuMs += Date.now() - t0;\n                    const t1 = Date.now();\n                    r0 = await session.run(feed0);\n                    gdiag.origMs += Date.now() - t1;\n                    const V0 = r0.logits.dims[2], last = (q.length - 1) * V0;\n                    ortTok = argmaxOf(r0.logits.data.subarray(last, last + V0));\n                    ortLen = q.length;\n                    gdiag.verify = { gpuToken: gpuTok, ortToken: ortTok, argmaxSame: gpuTok === ortTok };\n                } catch (e) {\n                    gdiag.reason = 'GPU 解碼失敗，改用原路徑：' + String((e && e.message) || e); gdiag.fallbackAt = 0; gpuTok = null;\n                }\n                if (r0) {\n                    // 原圖的第一步已經有了：不論 GPU 是否一致，這一步都以原圖為準\n                    out.push(ortTok); diag.steps++; s0 = 1;\n                    past = {}; for (let l = 0; l < L; l++) for (const k of ['key', 'value']) past[`past_key_values.${l}.${k}`] = r0[`present.${l}.${k}`];\n                    pastLen = ortLen;\n                    if (typeof o.onToken === 'function') o.onToken(ortTok, out.length);\n                    if (eos.has(ortTok)) return { tokens: out, stoppedBy: 'eos', head: diag, gpuDecode: gdiag };\n                    if (gpuTok !== null && gpuTok !== ortTok) { gdiag.fallbackAt = 0; gdiag.reason = '第一個詞元與原圖不同（GPU ' + gpuTok + '、原圖 ' + ortTok + '），改用原路徑'; gpuTok = null; }\n                    let pending = [ortTok];   // 已生成、但原圖的 KV 還沒吃進去的詞元\n                    if (gpuTok !== null) {\n                        let cur = ortTok;\n                        for (let s = 1; s < maxNew; s++) {\n                            if (stopCheck()) { stoppedBy = 'stop'; return { tokens: out, stoppedBy, head: diag, gpuDecode: gdiag }; }\n                            let t;\n                            try {\n                                const t2 = Date.now();\n                                t = (await withTimeout(Promise.resolve().then(() => GD.engine.step([cur])), gTimeout, 'GPU 解碼 ')).token;\n                                gdiag.gpuMs += Date.now() - t2;\n                            } catch (e) { gdiag.fallbackAt = s; gdiag.reason = 'GPU 解碼第 ' + s + ' 步失敗，改用原路徑：' + String((e && e.message) || e); break; }\n                            out.push(t); diag.steps++; gdiag.used++; pending.push(t); cur = t;\n                            if (typeof o.onToken === 'function') o.onToken(t, out.length);\n                            if (eos.has(t)) return { tokens: out, stoppedBy: 'eos', head: diag, gpuDecode: gdiag };\n                            s0 = out.length;\n                        }\n                        if (gdiag.fallbackAt < 0) return { tokens: out, stoppedBy: 'max', head: diag, gpuDecode: gdiag };\n                    }\n                    q = pending.slice();\n                    // 之後走原路徑迴圈；out 已有 s0 個詞元\n                    s0 = out.length;\n                }\n            }\n            for (let s = s0; s < maxNew; s++) {\n                if (stopCheck()) { stoppedBy = 'stop'; break; }\n                const len = pastLen + q.length;\n                const feed = Object.assign({}, past);\n                feed.input_ids = new ort.Tensor('int64', BigInt64Array.from(q.map(BigInt)), [1, q.length]);\n                feed.attention_mask = new ort.Tensor('int64', BigInt64Array.from(new Array(len).fill(1n)), [1, len]);\n                feed.position_ids = new ort.Tensor('int64', BigInt64Array.from(Array.from({ length: q.length }, (_, i) => BigInt(pastLen + i))), [1, q.length]);\n                diag.steps++;\n                let row = null, presentSrc = null;\n                if (headOn) {\n                    try {\n                        const t0 = Date.now();\n                        const rv = await H.variant.run(feed);\n                        diag.variantMs += Date.now() - t0;\n                        const hd = rv[H.hiddenName];\n                        if (!hd) throw new Error('變體圖沒有輸出 ' + H.hiddenName);\n                        const Hd = hd.dims[2], hl = (q.length - 1) * Hd;\n                        const hidden = Float32Array.from(hd.data.subarray(hl, hl + Hd));\n                        const t1 = Date.now();\n                        const lg = await withTimeout(Promise.resolve().then(() => H.run(hidden)), timeoutMs, 'GPU lm_head ');\n                        diag.headMs += Date.now() - t1;\n                        if (!lg || (H.vocab && lg.length !== H.vocab)) throw new Error('GPU lm_head 回傳長度 ' + (lg && lg.length) + '，預期 ' + H.vocab);\n                        row = lg; presentSrc = rv;\n                        if (diag.verify.length < verifySteps) {\n                            // 開頭幾步：原圖也跑一次，比對 argmax 與相對誤差；不合就退回原路徑（本步用原圖的結果）\n                            const t2 = Date.now();\n                            const r0 = await session.run(feed);\n                            diag.origMs += Date.now() - t2;\n                            const V0 = r0.logits.dims[2], last = (q.length - 1) * V0;\n                            const ref = r0.logits.data.subarray(last, last + V0);\n                            const cmp = compareRows(lg, ref);\n                            diag.verify.push({ step: s, maxRel: cmp.maxRel, argmaxSame: cmp.argmaxSame });\n                            if (!cmp.argmaxSame || !(cmp.maxRel <= verifyTol)) {\n                                headOn = false; diag.fallbackAt = s;\n                                diag.reason = '結果不合（第 ' + s + ' 步：相對誤差 ' + cmp.maxRel.toExponential(2) + '，argmax ' + (cmp.argmaxSame ? '一致' : '不一致') + '），改用原路徑';\n                                row = null; presentSrc = r0;\n                                const V1 = r0.logits.dims[2], l1 = (q.length - 1) * V1;\n                                row = Float32Array.from(r0.logits.data.subarray(l1, l1 + V1));\n                            }\n                        }\n                        if (headOn) diag.used++;\n                    } catch (e) {\n                        headOn = false; diag.fallbackAt = s;\n                        diag.reason = 'GPU lm_head 失敗，改用原路徑：' + String((e && e.message) || e);\n                        row = null; presentSrc = null;\n                    }\n                }\n                if (!row) {\n                    const t3 = Date.now();\n                    const r = await session.run(feed);\n                    diag.origMs += Date.now() - t3;\n                    const V = r.logits.dims[2], last = (q.length - 1) * V;\n                    row = Float32Array.from(r.logits.data.subarray(last, last + V));\n                    presentSrc = r;\n                }\n                const best = argmaxOf(row);\n                out.push(best);\n                if (eos.has(best)) { stoppedBy = 'eos'; break; }\n                past = {};\n                for (let l = 0; l < L; l++) for (const k of ['key', 'value']) past[`past_key_values.${l}.${k}`] = presentSrc[`present.${l}.${k}`];\n                pastLen = len; q = [best];\n                if (typeof o.onToken === 'function') o.onToken(best, out.length);\n            }\n            return { tokens: out, stoppedBy, head: diag, gpuDecode: gdiag };\n        })();\n    }\n\n    return { createTokenizer, loadSession, greedyGenerate, bytesToUnicode };\n});\n\n};\nconst CACHE = {}; function req(p) { const n = String(p).replace(/^\\.\\//, '').replace(/\\.js$/, ''); if (n === 'gpu_core') { if (!self.FaGpuCore) throw new Error('FaGpuCore 還沒載入'); return self.FaGpuCore; } if (CACHE[n]) return CACHE[n].exports; if (!MODS[n]) throw new Error('沒有模組 ' + p); const m = { exports: {} }; CACHE[n] = m; MODS[n].call(m.exports, m, m.exports, req); return m.exports; }\nreturn { decode: req('qwen_decode'), q4: req('qwen_decode_q4'), gpu: req('qwen_gpu'), chat: req('qwen_chat'), llmweb: req('llm_web_core'), whisper: { enc: req('whisper_enc'), gpu: req('whisper_gpu'), attach: req('whisper_attach') }, graph: req('graph_session'), tpl: req('nr_template'), pick: req('device_pick'), mem: req('gpu_mem'), models: req('qwen_models'), nn: req('nn_ops'), mm: req('mm_ops'), cpuShare: req('cpu_share'), cpuGemm: req('cpu_gemm'), gpuAsync: req('gpu_async_queue'), mpCore: req('mp_core'), hetero: req('hetero_split'), heteroRates: req('hetero_rates'), heteroIdb: req('hetero_rates_idb'), benchCore: req('bench_core'), bench: req('bench_run'), kernel: req('kernel_select'), race: req('variant_race'), priors: req('profile_priors'), vt: req('variant_table'), llmArch: req('llm_arch'), llmSkel: req('llm_skeleton'), llmSkelGpu: req('llm_skeleton_gpu') };",FA_GUI_BRIDGE_SRC="// GUI bridge core (pure, no DOM): the wire protocol between a skill program (shell, JavaScript, Python, later SDL / GTK# / XAML / QML hosts)\n// and the window the AI Chat page draws for it. The program never touches the DOM: it writes one JSON message per line, prefixed \"@gui \",\n// and the page validates each message and keeps a small widget tree per window. The DOM renderer (ai_chat_gui_render.js, a later batch) only\n// reads this tree, so every rule that matters for safety (kinds, props, sizes, ids, text-only values) is enforced here and is testable in node.\n//\n//   program -> page   @gui {\"v\":1,\"op\":\"open\",\"id\":\"w1\",\"title\":\"Hello\",\"width\":420}\n//                     @gui {\"v\":1,\"op\":\"add\",\"id\":\"w1\",\"parent\":\"root\",\"node\":{\"id\":\"b1\",\"kind\":\"button\",\"text\":\"OK\"}}\n//                     @gui {\"v\":1,\"op\":\"set\",\"id\":\"w1\",\"node\":\"b1\",\"props\":{\"text\":\"Done\"}}\n//                     @gui {\"v\":1,\"op\":\"remove\",\"id\":\"w1\",\"node\":\"b1\"}   /  {\"v\":1,\"op\":\"close\",\"id\":\"w1\"}\n//   page -> program   {\"v\":1,\"event\":\"click\",\"id\":\"w1\",\"node\":\"b1\"}, {\"v\":1,\"event\":\"input\",\"id\":\"w1\",\"node\":\"e1\",\"value\":\"...\"}\n//                     (event \"close\" when the user closes the window; \"select\" for list, \"change\" for checkbox)\n//\n//                     @gui {\"v\":1,\"op\":\"draw\",\"id\":\"w1\",\"node\":\"c1\",\"ops\":[[\"clear\",\"#000\"],[\"rect\",10,10,20,4,\"#0f0\"]]}\n//                     (a draw replaces the whole frame of a canvas; a canvas answers \"key\" and \"frame\" events)\n//                     @gui {\"v\":1,\"op\":\"image\",\"id\":\"w1\",\"node\":\"c1\",\"name\":\"ship\",\"data\":\"data:image/png;base64,...\"}\n//                     (a picture is registered once per canvas; a frame draws it by name: [\"image\",\"ship\",x,y,w,h]. data null removes it.\n//                      Only the Python / JavaScript route sends pictures: the program-output route refuses them, since its lines are short.)\n//\n// Kinds: column, row, expander (containers, children added with parent), label, button, entry, textarea, editor, checkbox, progress, list, multilist, table, tree, canvas.\n// Values are always plain text: no HTML and no script ever reaches the page through this protocol.\n(function (root, factory) {\n  if (typeof module === 'object' && module.exports) { module.exports = factory(); } else { root.AiChatGuiBridge = factory(); }\n}(typeof self !== 'undefined' ? self : this, function () {\n  'use strict';\n  var VERSION = 1, PREFIX = '@gui ';\n  var MAX_LINE = 64 * 1024 * 1024, MAX_BULK_LINE = 64 * 1024 * 1024, BULK_OP_RE = /\"op\"\\s*:\\s*\"(image|glbuf|set|add|draw)\"/, MAX_EDITOR_TEXT = 50000000, MAX_WINDOWS = 64, MAX_NODES = 100000, MAX_TEXT = 50000000, MAX_ITEMS = 100000, MAX_DEPTH = 64;\n  var ID_RE = /^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,40}$/;\n  var OPS = ['open', 'add', 'set', 'remove', 'close', 'draw', 'image', 'theme', 'shortcut', 'tone', 'glbuf', 'glprog', 'glframe'];\n  // window-level look: palette (five named colors), font family, size, corner radius; shortcuts: \"Ctrl+Shift+Alt+<key>\" -> a name the\n  // program gets back as a \"shortcut\" event; tone: a short beep played by the page (nothing is stored)\n  var PALETTE_KEYS = ['bg', 'fg', 'accent', 'danger', 'muted'];\n  var FONTS = ['sans-serif', 'serif', 'monospace'];\n  var WAVES = ['sine', 'square', 'triangle', 'sawtooth'];\n  var SHORTCUT_RE = /^(Ctrl\\+)?(Shift\\+)?(Alt\\+)?([A-Z0-9]|F([1-9]|1[0-2])|Enter|Esc|Space|Up|Down|Left|Right|Delete|Backspace|Tab)$/;\n  var MAX_SHORTCUTS = 1000;\n  var CONTAINERS = ['column', 'row', 'expander', 'grid', 'stack', 'scroll', 'tabs', 'tab', 'split', 'menubar', 'menu'];\n  // where a kind may be added: tab pages only inside tabs (and tabs hold only tab pages); menus only in a menubar, menu items only in a menu\n  var PARENT_OF = { tab: 'tabs', menu: 'menubar', menuitem: 'menu' };\n  var ONLY_CHILDREN = { tabs: ['tab'], menubar: ['menu'], menu: ['menuitem'] };\n  var MAX_COLUMNS = 1000, MAX_DRAW = 100000, // a frame of any ordinary size; the page paints big frames adaptively (see gui_host.js), so there is no small fixed cap\n     MAX_CANVAS = 16384, MAX_FPS = 240;\n  var MAX_IMAGES = 4096; // pictures have no size limit: a big one is sent in parts (see the image op)\n  var COLOR_RE = /^#([0-9a-fA-F]{3}|[0-9a-fA-F]{6})$/;\n  var IMAGE_RE = /^data:image\\/(png|jpeg|gif|webp);base64,([A-Za-z0-9+/]+={0,2})$/;\n  // a draw command and its length (name included): every command ends with its color, except clear, which is only the color\n  var DRAW_LENGTH = { clear: 2, rect: 6, circle: 5, line: 6, text: 5 };\n  var KINDS = {\n    column: { props: [] },\n    row: { props: [] },\n    expander: { props: ['text', 'expanded'], events: ['toggle'] },\n    // grid: children fill a table of `columns` equal columns, row by row; scroll: a column at most `height` pixels high that scrolls\n    grid: { props: ['columns'] },\n    // stack: its children are drawn on top of each other in the same area (the later child on top), each filling it: a HUD canvas over a gl canvas\n    stack: { props: [] },\n    scroll: { props: ['height'] },\n    // tabs: its children are tab pages (kind tab, text = the title); selected is the page's node id (the first page when empty); the user's click comes\n    // back as select with the page id. split: two or more children side by side (direction row) or stacked (column), the first one ratio percent wide.\n    // menubar > menu (text) > menuitem (text, keys = the shortcut hint shown beside it, e.g. Ctrl+S; click event)\n    tabs: { props: ['selected'], events: ['select'] },\n    tab: { props: ['text'] },\n    // weights: one share per child (2 to 12 children, each 1-100): the children take the space in those proportions (ratio is then unused)\n    split: { props: ['direction', 'ratio', 'weights'] },\n    menubar: { props: [] },\n    menu: { props: ['text'] },\n    menuitem: { props: ['text', 'keys', 'enabled'], events: ['click'] },\n    label: { props: ['text'] },\n    // button icon: a short symbol or emoji shown before the text (the toolbar look: icon plus text)\n    button: { props: ['text', 'enabled', 'icon'], events: ['click'] },\n    entry: { props: ['value', 'placeholder', 'enabled', 'secret'], events: ['input'] },\n    textarea: { props: ['value', 'placeholder', 'rows', 'enabled'], events: ['input'] },\n    // editor: a code or text editing surface with line numbers (numbers), syntax colors for lang (python, javascript, json, markdown, html, css; anything else is plain), scrollbars\n    // prose: a proportional reading font and roomier lines (documents); caret / caret_to (set only, not stored): move the caret (and select to caret_to)\n    // and focus the editor; the user's caret and selection come back as the \"caret\" event {start, end} (character offsets)\n    // wrap: long lines wrap at the editor's width (no line numbers then); markdown: a read-only view of Markdown text drawn with real headings, bold, lists, quotes and code\n    editor: { props: ['value', 'lang', 'rows', 'enabled', 'numbers', 'prose', 'wrap'], events: ['input', 'caret'] },\n    markdown: { props: ['value'] },\n    checkbox: { props: ['text', 'checked', 'enabled'], events: ['change'] },\n    progress: { props: ['value', 'max'] },\n    list: { props: ['items', 'selected', 'enabled', 'rows'], events: ['select'] },\n    multilist: { props: ['items', 'selected', 'enabled', 'rows'], events: ['select'] },\n    table: { props: ['columns', 'rows', 'enabled'], events: ['cell'] },\n    // tree: a grid whose first column is indented by depth; rows are {id, depth, cells, tones, bold, expanded} in drawing order (a row with\n    // expanded true or false has children; its descendants are hidden while it is false). A click sends select (value = the row id),\n    // the arrow sends toggle (value = the row id; the bridge flips the row's expanded flag itself). selected is the selected row id.\n    tree: { props: ['columns', 'rows', 'selected', 'enabled'], events: ['select', 'toggle'] },\n    // doc: a read-only page of blocks (title, p, h, pre, list, table, kv, ref); a click on a ref block sends ref (value = its ref)\n    doc: { props: ['blocks'], events: ['ref'] },\n    // filepick: a button that asks the program to pick files (a click sends pick; gui.py's pick_files() then opens the chooser)\n    filepick: { props: ['text', 'enabled'], events: ['pick'] },\n    // a canvas is drawn by whole frames (op \"draw\" replaces the frame); fps > 0 makes the page send \"frame\" events, key presses come as \"key\",\n    // the pointer as \"mouse\" ({kind: down | up | move, x, y, button} with x and y inside the canvas), the wheel as \"wheel\" ({x, y, dy}),\n    // and \"resize\" ({width, height}: the canvas's new size in pixels when its window is resized or maximized)\n    // fit: the canvas keeps its width x height as the drawing space and is scaled (centered, whole picture visible) to fill the area it is given (grow)\n    canvas: { props: ['width', 'height', 'fps', 'fit', 'gl', 'transparent'], events: ['key', 'frame', 'mouse', 'wheel', 'resize', 'glerror'] }\n  };\n  // layout and look hints every node may carry: grow = share of the free space in its parent (0 none, 1-10 weight; a row grows sideways,\n  // a column downwards), gap = space between its children and pad = inner space (pixels), role = a named look from the design system\n  var ROLES = ['toolbar', 'sidebar', 'statusbar', 'card', 'panel', 'heading', 'title', 'muted', 'primary', 'danger', 'surface', 'group', 'divider', 'outline', 'page'];\n  var COMMON = ['visible', 'grow', 'gap', 'pad', 'role'];\n\n  function fail(error) { return { ok: false, error: error }; }\n  function isObj(v) { return v !== null && typeof v === 'object' && !Array.isArray(v); }\n  function text(v, field, max) {\n    if (typeof v !== 'string') { throw new Error(field + ' must be a string'); }\n    if (v.length > (max || MAX_TEXT)) { throw new Error(field + ' is longer than ' + (max || MAX_TEXT) + ' characters'); }\n    return v;\n  }\n  function id(v, field) {\n    if (typeof v !== 'string' || !ID_RE.test(v)) { throw new Error(field + ' must be 1-40 letters, digits, _ or -'); }\n    return v;\n  }\n  function num(v, field, lo, hi) {\n    if (typeof v !== 'number' || !isFinite(v) || v < lo || v > hi) { throw new Error(field + ' must be a number from ' + lo + ' to ' + hi); }\n    return v;\n  }\n  function bool(v, field) { if (typeof v !== 'boolean') { throw new Error(field + ' must be true or false'); } return v; }\n\n  // one prop, checked by its name; the same rules serve add (node props) and set\n  function prop(kind, name, v) {\n    switch (name) {\n      case 'text': case 'value': case 'placeholder': case 'lang': case 'keys': return text(v, name);\n      case 'icon': if (typeof v !== 'string' || v.length > 8) { throw new Error('icon must be a short text (a symbol or emoji, at most 8 characters)'); } return v;\n      case 'enabled': case 'checked': case 'visible': case 'secret': case 'expanded': case 'numbers': case 'fit': case 'gl': case 'transparent': case 'prose': case 'wrap': return bool(v, name);\n      case 'rows': return num(v, name, 1, 1000);\n      case 'grow': return num(v, name, 0, 10);\n      case 'gap': case 'pad': return num(v, name, 0, 32);\n      case 'role': if (ROLES.indexOf(v) < 0) { throw new Error('role must be one of ' + ROLES.join(', ')); } return v;\n      case 'max': return num(v, name, 0, 1e12);\n      case 'selected': return text(v, name);\n      case 'items':\n        if (!Array.isArray(v) || v.length > MAX_ITEMS) { throw new Error('items must be an array of at most ' + MAX_ITEMS + ' strings'); }\n        return v.map(function (s, i) { return text(s, 'items[' + i + ']'); });\n    }\n    throw new Error('prop \"' + name + '\" is not allowed on ' + kind);\n  }\n\n  // progress takes a number for value; everything else with a value is text\n  function propValue(kind, name, v) {\n    if (kind === 'editor' && name === 'value') { return text(v, name, MAX_EDITOR_TEXT); } // a file being edited is far longer than a label\n    if (kind === 'progress' && name === 'value') { return num(v, 'value', 0, 1e12); }\n    if (kind === 'grid' && name === 'columns') { return num(v, name, 1, 12); }\n    if (kind === 'split' && name === 'ratio') { return num(v, name, 10, 90); }\n    if (kind === 'split' && name === 'weights') {\n      if (!Array.isArray(v) || v.length < 2 || v.length > 12) { throw new Error('weights must be an array of 2 to 12 numbers'); }\n      return v.map(function (x, i) { return num(x, 'weights[' + i + ']', 1, 100); });\n    }\n    if (kind === 'split' && name === 'direction') { if (v !== 'row' && v !== 'column') { throw new Error('direction must be row or column'); } return v; }\n    if (kind === 'menuitem' && name === 'keys') { return text(v, name); }\n    if (kind === 'scroll' && name === 'height') { return num(v, name, 40, 100000); }\n    if (kind === 'canvas' && (name === 'width' || name === 'height')) { return num(v, name, 1, MAX_CANVAS); }\n    if (kind === 'canvas' && name === 'fps') { return num(v, name, 0, MAX_FPS); }\n    if (kind === 'table' && name === 'columns') { return cellList(v, 'columns', 1, MAX_COLUMNS); }\n    if (kind === 'table' && name === 'rows') { return tableRows(v); }\n    if (kind === 'tree' && name === 'columns') { return treeColumns(v); }\n    if (kind === 'tree' && name === 'rows') { return treeRows(v); }\n    if (kind === 'doc' && name === 'blocks') { return docBlocks(v); }\n    if (kind === 'multilist' && name === 'selected') { return cellList(v, 'selected', 0, MAX_ITEMS); }\n    return prop(kind, name, v);\n  }\n\n  // an array of text values (table columns, multilist selection)\n  function cellList(v, field, min, max) {\n    if (!Array.isArray(v) || v.length < min || v.length > max) { throw new Error(field + ' must be an array of ' + min + ' to ' + max + ' strings'); }\n    return v.map(function (s, i) { return text(s, field + '[' + i + ']'); });\n  }\n\n  // tree columns: [{title, width (20-2000 px), align (left, right, center)}]\n  var TREE_TONES = ['pass', 'fail', 'warn', 'muted'];\n  var MAX_TREE_ROWS = 1000000, MAX_TREE_DEPTH = 100;\n  function treeColumns(v) {\n    if (!Array.isArray(v) || v.length < 1 || v.length > MAX_COLUMNS) { throw new Error('columns must be an array of 1 to ' + MAX_COLUMNS + ' columns'); }\n    return v.map(function (c, i) {\n      var what = 'columns[' + i + ']';\n      if (!isObj(c)) { throw new Error(what + ' must be an object'); }\n      var col = { title: text(c.title, what + '.title') };\n      if (c.width !== undefined) { col.width = num(c.width, what + '.width', 20, 2000); }\n      if (c.align !== undefined) {\n        if (['left', 'right', 'center'].indexOf(c.align) < 0) { throw new Error(what + '.align must be left, right or center'); }\n        col.align = c.align;\n      }\n      return col;\n    });\n  }\n  // tree rows: at most 3000; depth 0-20; cells one text per column; tones (per cell, pass/fail/warn/muted or null); bold; expanded (present = has children)\n  function treeRows(v) {\n    if (!Array.isArray(v) || v.length > MAX_TREE_ROWS) { throw new Error('rows must be an array of at most ' + MAX_TREE_ROWS + ' tree rows'); }\n    return v.map(function (r, i) {\n      var what = 'rows[' + i + ']';\n      if (!isObj(r)) { throw new Error(what + ' must be an object'); }\n      var row = {\n        id: text(r.id, what + '.id'),\n        depth: num(r.depth === undefined ? 0 : r.depth, what + '.depth', 0, MAX_TREE_DEPTH),\n        cells: cellList(r.cells, what + '.cells', 0, MAX_COLUMNS)\n      };\n      if (r.tones !== undefined) {\n        if (!Array.isArray(r.tones) || r.tones.length > MAX_COLUMNS) { throw new Error(what + '.tones must be an array of at most ' + MAX_COLUMNS + ' items'); }\n        row.tones = r.tones.map(function (t, j) {\n          if (t === '') { return null; } // Redmine 版的程式用空字串表示「沒有色調」\n          if (t !== null && TREE_TONES.indexOf(t) < 0) { throw new Error(what + '.tones[' + j + '] must be pass, fail, warn, muted or null'); }\n          return t;\n        });\n      }\n      if (r.bold !== undefined) { row.bold = bool(r.bold, what + '.bold'); }\n      if (r.expanded !== undefined) { row.expanded = bool(r.expanded, what + '.expanded'); }\n      return row;\n    });\n  }\n  // every row of a tree has one cell per column (checked when both are known: on add and after each set)\n  function checkTreeCells(n) {\n    if (!n.rows || !n.columns) { return; }\n    n.rows.forEach(function (r, i) { if (r.cells.length !== n.columns.length) { throw new Error('rows[' + i + '] has ' + r.cells.length + ' cells, the tree has ' + n.columns.length + ' columns'); } });\n  }\n  function treeRowOf(node, id) {\n    for (var i = 0; i < (node.rows || []).length; i++) { if (node.rows[i].id === id) { return node.rows[i]; } }\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  // doc: a read-only page of blocks (see gui.py's doc). One block text up to 300000 characters, the whole doc 400000 (the skill's\n  // detail pages are that big); a block keeps only the props its kind takes.\n  var DOC_KINDS = {\n    title: ['text', 'badge', 'tone'], p: ['text', 'tone'], h: ['text'], pre: ['text', 'wrap'],\n    list: ['items', 'tone'], table: ['columns', 'rows'], kv: ['rows'], ref: ['text', 'ref']\n  };\n  var MAX_DOC_BLOCKS = 200000, MAX_DOC_TEXT = 50000000, MAX_DOC_TOTAL = 50000000, MAX_DOC_ROWS = 1000000;\n  function docBlocks(v) {\n    if (!Array.isArray(v) || v.length > MAX_DOC_BLOCKS) { throw new Error('blocks must be an array of at most ' + MAX_DOC_BLOCKS + ' blocks'); }\n    var total = 0;\n    function str(s, field) {\n      if (typeof s !== 'string') { throw new Error(field + ' must be a string'); }\n      if (s.length > MAX_DOC_TEXT) { throw new Error(field + ' is longer than ' + MAX_DOC_TEXT + ' characters'); }\n      total += s.length;\n      if (total > MAX_DOC_TOTAL) { throw new Error('the doc is longer than ' + MAX_DOC_TOTAL + ' characters'); }\n      return s;\n    }\n    function tone(t, field) { if (t === '') { return undefined; } if (t !== undefined && TREE_TONES.indexOf(t) < 0) { throw new Error(field + ' must be pass, fail, warn or muted'); } return t; }\n    return v.map(function (b, i) {\n      var what = 'blocks[' + i + ']', out = {};\n      if (!isObj(b)) { throw new Error(what + ' must be an object'); }\n      if (!Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(DOC_KINDS, b.t)) { throw new Error(what + '.t must be one of ' + Object.keys(DOC_KINDS).join(', ')); }\n      Object.keys(b).forEach(function (k) {\n        if (k === 't') { return; }\n        if (DOC_KINDS[b.t].indexOf(k) < 0) { throw new Error(what + ' prop \"' + k + '\" is not allowed on ' + b.t + ' blocks'); }\n        var f = what + '.' + k;\n        if (k === 'text' || k === 'badge' || k === 'ref') { out[k] = str(b[k], f); }\n        else if (k === 'tone') { out[k] = tone(b[k], f); }\n        else if (k === 'wrap') { out[k] = bool(b[k], f); }\n        else if (k === 'items') {\n          if (!Array.isArray(b[k]) || b[k].length > MAX_ITEMS) { throw new Error(f + ' must be an array of at most ' + MAX_ITEMS + ' strings'); }\n          out[k] = b[k].map(function (s, j) { return str(s, f + '[' + j + ']'); });\n        }\n        else if (k === 'columns') { out[k] = cellList(b[k], f, 1, MAX_COLUMNS).map(function (s, j) { return str(s, f + '[' + j + ']'); }); }\n        else if (k === 'rows' && b.t === 'table') {\n          if (!Array.isArray(b[k]) || b[k].length > MAX_DOC_ROWS) { throw new Error(f + ' must be an array of at most ' + MAX_DOC_ROWS + ' rows'); }\n          out[k] = b[k].map(function (r, j) {\n            if (!Array.isArray(r) || r.length !== (b.columns || []).length) { throw new Error(f + '[' + j + '] must have one cell per column'); }\n            return r.map(function (c, ci) { return str(c, f + '[' + j + '][' + ci + ']'); });\n          });\n        }\n        else if (k === 'rows') { // kv: [key, value, highlight, mono]\n          if (!Array.isArray(b[k]) || b[k].length > MAX_DOC_ROWS) { throw new Error(f + ' must be an array of at most ' + MAX_DOC_ROWS + ' rows'); }\n          out[k] = b[k].map(function (r, j) {\n            if (!Array.isArray(r) || r.length < 2 || r.length > 4) { throw new Error(f + '[' + j + '] must be [key, value, highlight, mono]'); }\n            return [str(r[0], f + '[' + j + '][0]'), str(r[1], f + '[' + j + '][1]'), r[2] === undefined ? false : bool(r[2], f + '[' + j + '][2]'), r[3] === undefined ? false : bool(r[3], f + '[' + j + '][3]')];\n          });\n        }\n      });\n      out.t = b.t;\n      return out;\n    });\n  }\n  function docHasRef(node, ref) {\n    return (node.blocks || []).some(function (b) { return b.t === 'ref' && b.ref === ref; });\n  }\n\n  // table rows: an array of rows, each with one text value per column\n  function tableRows(v) {\n    if (!Array.isArray(v) || v.length > MAX_ITEMS) { throw new Error('rows must be an array of at most ' + MAX_ITEMS + ' rows'); }\n    return v.map(function (r, i) { return cellList(r, 'rows[' + i + ']', 0, MAX_COLUMNS); });\n  }\n\n  // a picture registered on the canvas: data is a PNG, JPEG, GIF or WebP data URL (any size that fits one message; a bigger one is sent in parts)\n  function imageData(v) {\n    var bad = 'data must be a data:image/png, jpeg, gif or webp;base64 URL';\n    if (typeof v !== 'string') { throw new Error(bad); }\n    var m = IMAGE_RE.exec(v);\n    if (!m) { throw new Error(bad); }\n    var b64 = m[2], pad = (b64.match(/=+$/) || [''])[0].length;\n    if (b64.length % 4 !== 0) { throw new Error('data is not valid base64'); }\n    return v;\n  }\n\n  // draw [\"image\", name, x, y] or [\"image\", name, x, y, w, h]: the name must be a picture of this canvas\n  function imageCommand(op, what, images) {\n    if (op.length !== 4 && op.length !== 6 && op.length !== 8) { throw new Error(what + ' image needs a name, x, y and optionally w, h and flip_x, flip_y'); }\n    var name = id(op[1], what + '[1]');\n    if (!Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(images, name)) { throw new Error(what + ' image \"' + name + '\" is not loaded on this canvas'); }\n    var out = ['image', name, num(op[2], what + '[2]', -1e5, 1e5), num(op[3], what + '[3]', -1e5, 1e5)];\n    if (op.length >= 6) { out.push(num(op[4], what + '[4]', 0, 1e5), num(op[5], what + '[5]', 0, 1e5)); }\n    // flip_x, flip_y (0 or 1): mirror the picture across its vertical / horizontal axis inside its w x h box\n    if (op.length === 8) { out.push(num(op[6], what + '[6]', 0, 1) ? 1 : 0, num(op[7], what + '[7]', 0, 1) ? 1 : 0); }\n    return out;\n  }\n\n  // one draw command: [\"rect\", x, y, w, h, \"#rrggbb\"] and the rest of DRAW_LENGTH. Coordinates are checked, never clipped here.\n  function drawCommand(op, what, images) {\n    if (Array.isArray(op) && op[0] === 'image') { return imageCommand(op, what, images); }\n    if (!Array.isArray(op) || !Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(DRAW_LENGTH, op[0])) { throw new Error(what + ' must be [name, ...] with name clear, rect, circle, line, text or image'); }\n    var name = op[0];\n    if (op.length !== DRAW_LENGTH[name]) { throw new Error(what + ' ' + name + ' needs ' + (DRAW_LENGTH[name] - 1) + ' values after the name'); }\n    var color = op[op.length - 1];\n    if (typeof color !== 'string' || !COLOR_RE.test(color)) { throw new Error(what + ' color must be #rgb or #rrggbb'); }\n    var c = function (i) { return num(op[i], what + '[' + i + ']', -1e5, 1e5); };\n    if (name === 'clear') { return [name, color]; }\n    if (name === 'rect') { return [name, c(1), c(2), num(op[3], what + '[3]', 0, 1e5), num(op[4], what + '[4]', 0, 1e5), color]; }\n    if (name === 'circle') { return [name, c(1), c(2), num(op[3], what + '[3]', 0, 1e4), color]; }\n    if (name === 'line') { return [name, c(1), c(2), c(3), c(4), color]; }\n    return [name, c(1), c(2), text(op[3], what + '[3]'), color];\n  }\n\n  // ---- WebGL2 canvas (a canvas created with gl: true) ----\n  // The program sends three kinds of messages: glbuf (a named vertex or index buffer as base64 bytes), glprog (a named GLSL ES 3.00 vertex +\n  // fragment shader pair) and glframe (one whole frame of commands, like draw does for 2D). The bridge checks shapes and limits and keeps the\n  // data; the page compiles and draws it with its own WebGL2 context. Nothing here is ever evaluated as script.\n  var MAX_GL_BUFS = 1000, MAX_GL_BUF_BYTES = 48 * 1024 * 1024, MAX_GL_PROGS = 500, MAX_GL_SRC = 1000000, MAX_GL_CMDS = 100000, MAX_GL_COUNT = 1000000000;\n  var GL_MODES = ['points', 'lines', 'line_strip', 'triangles', 'triangle_strip'];\n  var GL_STATES = ['depth', 'blend', 'additive', 'cull'];\n  var GL_NAME_RE = /^[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]{0,40}$/;\n  var GL_B64_RE = /^[A-Za-z0-9+/]*={0,2}$/;\n  // extern：把宿主給的外部來源（例如 WebGPU 畫好的畫布）整張鋪在目前的畫面上；一幀最多這麼多次（DESIGN.webgpu-cuda.md §13 階段 9）\n  var MAX_GL_EXTERNS_PER_FRAME = 4;\n  function glBuffer(msg, target) {\n    var name = id(msg.name, 'name');\n    target.glbufs = target.glbufs || {};\n    if (msg.data === null) { delete target.glbufs[name]; return; }\n    var type = msg.type;\n    if (type !== 'f32' && type !== 'u16' && type !== 'u32') { throw new Error('type must be f32, u16 or u32'); }\n    var b64 = msg.data;\n    if (typeof b64 !== 'string' || !GL_B64_RE.test(b64) || b64.length % 4 !== 0) { throw new Error('data must be base64'); }\n    var pad = (b64.match(/=+$/) || [''])[0].length, bytes = b64.length / 4 * 3 - pad, unit = type === 'u16' ? 2 : 4;\n    if (bytes > MAX_GL_BUF_BYTES) { throw new Error('buffer is larger than ' + (MAX_GL_BUF_BYTES / 1048576) + ' MB'); }\n    if (bytes === 0 || bytes % unit !== 0) { throw new Error('buffer size must be a non-zero multiple of ' + unit + ' bytes'); }\n    if (!Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(target.glbufs, name) && Object.keys(target.glbufs).length >= MAX_GL_BUFS) { throw new Error('at most ' + MAX_GL_BUFS + ' buffers per canvas'); }\n    var prev = target.glbufs[name];\n    target.glbufs[name] = { type: type, data: b64, bytes: bytes, v: prev ? prev.v + 1 : 1 };\n  }\n  function glProgram(msg, target) {\n    var name = id(msg.name, 'name');\n    target.glprogs = target.glprogs || {};\n    if (msg.vs === null) { delete target.glprogs[name]; return; }\n    ['vs', 'fs'].forEach(function (k) {\n      if (typeof msg[k] !== 'string' || msg[k].length < 20 || msg[k].length > MAX_GL_SRC) { throw new Error(k + ' must be shader source of 20 to ' + MAX_GL_SRC + ' characters'); }\n      if (msg[k].indexOf('#version 300 es') !== 0 && msg[k].replace(/^\\s+/, '').indexOf('#version 300 es') !== 0) { throw new Error(k + ' must start with #version 300 es'); }\n    });\n    if (!Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(target.glprogs, name) && Object.keys(target.glprogs).length >= MAX_GL_PROGS) { throw new Error('at most ' + MAX_GL_PROGS + ' programs per canvas'); }\n    var prev = target.glprogs[name];\n    target.glprogs[name] = { vs: msg.vs, fs: msg.fs, v: prev ? prev.v + 1 : 1 };\n  }\n  // [\"clear\", r, g, b, a] | [\"state\", \"depth\"|\"blend\"|\"cull\", 0|1] | [\"use\", prog] | [\"uf\", name, v...] (1, 2, 3, 4, 9 or 16 floats) | [\"ui\", name, int]\n  // | [\"attr\", name, buffer, size 1-4, strideBytes, offsetBytes, divisor 0|1] | [\"index\", buffer] (for the next draw only) | [\"draw\", mode, first, count, instanc